h-TW\": [\"企业高管\", \"创业者\", \"战略顾问\", \"投资经理\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Taylor\'s MBA获QS Top 100 MBA认证，灵活安排课程，多国学员构成多元学习环境。\", \"ms\": \"Taylor\'s MBA获QS Top 100 MBA认证，灵活安排课程，多国学员构成多元学习环境。\", \"zh-CN\": \"Taylor\'s MBA获QS Top 100 MBA认证，灵活安排课程，多国学员构成多元学习环境。\", \"zh-TW\": \"Taylor\'s MBA获QS Top 100 MBA认证，灵活安排课程，多国学员构成多元学习环境。\"}',NULL,'','','',NULL,NULL,'missing-source','needs-review',NULL,NULL,NULL,'UNKNOWN 92,000',1,'2026-05-23 02:29:50.333520','2026-05-23 04:20:54.000000',NULL,''),(7431,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-001-bachelor-of-science-honours-in-architecture','TSU-UG-001','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architecture\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architecture\", \"zh-CN\": \"建筑学理学荣誉学士\", \"zh-TW\": \"建築學理學榮譽學士\"}','Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architecture','engineering','{\"en\": \"School of Architecture, Building and Design\", \"ms\": \"School of Architecture, Building and Design\", \"zh-CN\": \"建筑、建成环境与设计学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"建築、建成環境與設計學院\"}','建筑、建成环境与设计学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',94006,'USD','USD 39,169 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-architecture-building-and-design-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": 4, \"ielts\": 5.5, \"toefl\": 60}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 6.0 TOEFL 60 (Internet Based Test) MUET Band 4 UEC English B4 O level Grade C 1119 (GCE-O) Grade B Taylor’s EET Overall Score 6.0 Taylor’s IEN Level 2- Grade B Pre-University/Diploma Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS score of 5.5 OR its equivalent Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.00; ATAR 70; 65%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.00; ATAR 70; 65%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.00; ATAR 70; 65%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.00; ATAR 70; 65%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Architecture. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM/O-level or equivalent A pass in SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits, including Mathematics. (Except for UEC) Pass an Interview and Aptitude Assessment (AA) Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 70 A Level Min. CDD excluding General Paper or studies in student’s first language Note: any combination of grade but not lower than Grade D Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 65% in 6 subjects Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CGPA 2.67 in 3 subjects Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass in UEC with Min. 5Bs including Mathematics (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in Mathematics subject may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Mathematic subject at SPM or equivalent level) Taylor\'s Foundation in Design (FID) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor\'s Foundation in Natural and Built Environments (FNBE) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 (not subject to interview and AA) Other Taylor\'s Foundation in related field Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass with min. CGPA 2.67 International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 28 points and above based on 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 60% Foundation in related field from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government Pass with CGPA 2.00 Diploma from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government Pass with CGPA 2.67 Other foundation, matriculation, high school certificates from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, aptitudeAssessment. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Explore Taylor\'s industry-focused curriculum, designed to equip you with robust skills for thriving in today\'s rapidly changing environment. Below is an overview of what you can expect from this programme\'s structure.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Architectural Design I\", \"Architecture History and Theory\", \"Design Communication\", \"Architectural Design II\", \"Asian Architecture\", \"Building Construction and Materials\", \"Architecture and Environment\", \"Architectural Design III\", \"Computer Applications\", \"Architectural Design IV\"], \"ms\": [\"Explore Taylor\'s industry-focused curriculum, designed to equip you with robust skills for thriving in today\'s rapidly changing environment. Below is an overview of what you can expect from this programme\'s structure.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Architectural Design I\", \"Architecture History and Theory\", \"Design Communication\", \"Architectural Design II\", \"Asian Architecture\", \"Building Construction and Materials\", \"Architecture and Environment\", \"Architectural Design III\", \"Computer Applications\", \"Architectural Design IV\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Once you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Science in Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers as an architecture graduate, including:\", \"Architectural Model Specialist\", \"Architectural Photographer\", \"Architectural Structure Specialist\", \"Computer-Aided Design / 3D Visualiser\", \"Interior Designer / Interior Architect\", \"Resort / Hotel Architectural Conceptualiser\", \"Theme Park Conceptual Architect\", \"Town Planning Conceptual Architect\"], \"ms\": [\"Once you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Science in Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers as an architecture graduate, including:\", \"Architectural Model Specialist\", \"Architectural Photographer\", \"Architectural Structure Specialist\", \"Computer-Aided Design / 3D Visualiser\", \"Interior Designer / Interior Architect\", \"Resort / Hotel Architectural Conceptualiser\", \"Theme Park Conceptual Architect\", \"Town Planning Conceptual Architect\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"The Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architecture, accredited by the Board of Architects Malaysia (Lembaga Arkitek Malaysia or LAM), is a pre-professional degree programme exempting graduates from the LAM Part I Examination. A consistently sought-after programme, this degree is ideal for students committed to shaping the future of the built environment. You\'ll acquire comprehensive theoretical knowledge and practical skills through a curriculum that nurtures your creativity, critical thinking, and technical expertise. Upon completion of the programme, you graduate as an Assistant Architect, equipped to contribute under registered practitioners, while pursuing further professional training.\", \"ms\": \"The Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architecture, accredited by the Board of Architects Malaysia (Lembaga Arkitek Malaysia or LAM), is a pre-professional degree programme exempting graduates from the LAM Part I Examination. A consistently sought-after programme, this degree is ideal for students committed to shaping the future of the built environment. You\'ll acquire comprehensive theoretical knowledge and practical skills through a curriculum that nurtures your creativity, critical thinking, and technical expertise. Upon completion of the programme, you graduate as an Assistant Architect, equipped to contribute under registered practitioners, while pursuing further professional training.\", \"zh-CN\": \"建筑学理学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由建筑、建成环境与设计学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"建築學理學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由建築、建成環境與設計學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-in-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-in-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-in-architecture.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-in-architecture.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-architecture-buildin