iversity. Entry Pathway AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 60 A Level Min. grades DD Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 55% in 6 subjects Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs Taylor’s Foundation in Design (FID) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Foundation in Natural and Built Environments (FNBE) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Other Taylor\'s Foundation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Diploma in Interior Design (DID) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 International Baccalaureate (IB) Min 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Foundation from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 Diploma from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 CGPA 2.00 MoE Matriculation with min. CGPA 2.00 Any other qualification recognised by the Malaysian govt. Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Bachelor of Arts (Honours) in Interior Architecture encourages collaboration with disciplines such as architecture, landscape design, and the creation of expressive spaces in the public realm. By exploring these inte\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provide fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Interior Architecture Design I\", \"Design Communication\", \"Interior Structure and Construction\", \"Narrative Media\", \"Interior Architecture Design II\", \"Digital Modeling and Visualisation\", \"Material and Finishes\"], \"ms\": [\"The Bachelor of Arts (Honours) in Interior Architecture encourages collaboration with disciplines such as architecture, landscape design, and the creation of expressive spaces in the public realm. By exploring these inte\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provide fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Interior Architecture Design I\", \"Design Communication\", \"Interior Structure and Construction\", \"Narrative Media\", \"Interior Architecture Design II\", \"Digital Modeling and Visualisation\", \"Material and Finishes\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3.5-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3.5-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Once you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Arts in Interior Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers as an interior architecture graduate, including:\", \"Academician\", \"Conceptualiser\", \"Event & Exhibition Designer\", \"Film, TV, Stage, Set & Theatre Designer\", \"Furniture Designer\", \"In-House Designer\", \"Interior Architect / Interior Designer\", \"Interior Model Specialist\", \"Interior Photographer\", \"Project Manager\", \"Research Assistant\", \"Visualiser (2-D & 3-D)\"], \"ms\": [\"Once you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Arts in Interior Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers as an interior architecture graduate, including:\", \"Academician\", \"Conceptualiser\", \"Event & Exhibition Designer\", \"Film, TV, Stage, Set & Theatre Designer\", \"Furniture Designer\", \"In-House Designer\", \"Interior Architect / Interior Designer\", \"Interior Model Specialist\", \"Interior Photographer\", \"Project Manager\", \"Research Assistant\", \"Visualiser (2-D & 3-D)\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 13 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 13 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"The Bachelor of Arts (Honours) in Interior Architecture programme is meticulously structured to provide you with a comprehensive education in the field. The programme consists of up to 123 credit units, including a dedicated 12-credit industrial training component, so you gain both academic depth and valuable workplace exposure. Ideal for students aiming to enter the interior architecture field with a strong, recognised foundation, this degree is a preferred choice for those drawn to human-centred design careers. Aligning with the degree programme requirements set by the Board of Architects Malaysia or Lembaga Arkitek Malaysia (LAM), the regulatory body for the Architecture and Interior Architecture/Design professions in Malaysia, our curriculum meets Malaysia\'s highest standards for interior architecture education.\", \"ms\": \"The Bachelor of Arts (Honours) in Interior Architecture programme is meticulously structured to provide you with a comprehensive education in the field. The programme consists of up to 123 credit units, including a dedicated 12-credit industrial training component, so you gain both academic depth and valuable workplace exposure. Ideal for students aiming to enter the interior architecture field with a strong, recognised foundation, this degree is a preferred choice for those drawn to human-centred design careers. Aligning with the degree programme requirements set by the Board of Architects Malaysia or Lembaga Arkitek Malaysia (LAM), the regulatory body for the Architecture and Interior Architecture/Design professions in Malaysia, our curriculum meets Malaysia\'s highest standards for interior architecture education.\", \"zh-CN\": \"室内建筑文学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由建筑、建成环境与设计学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"室内建築文學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由建築、建成環境與設計學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-art-in-interior-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-art-in-interior-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-art-in-interior-architecture.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-art-in-interior-architecture.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}