ylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-architecture-building-and-design-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": 3, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": 40}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 5.0 TOEFL 40 (Internet Based Test) MUET Band 3 UEC English B6 O level Grade C 1119 (GCE-O) Grade C Taylor’s EET Overall Score 5.0 Taylor’s IEN Level 2- Grade C Pre-University/Diploma Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS score of 5.0 OR its equivalent Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.67; ATAR 65\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.67; ATAR 65\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.67; ATAR 65。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.67; ATAR 65。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Quantity Surveying. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM/O-Level with Pre-University/Foundation A pass in SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits, including Mathematics, for students from Foundation programmes. A pass in SPM/O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits including Mathematics for students from Pre-U (CPU, STPM, UEC, IB or equivalent from other institutions) and Diploma qualifications. A Pass in Mathematics at a higher level can be used to replace the prerequisite Credit in Mathematics in SPM/O-Level/or equivalent. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 65 A Level Min. DDD Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 65% in 6 subjects Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CGPA 2.00 for 3 subjects Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with Min. 5Bs including Mathematics or Advanced Mathematics or Advanced Mathematics 1 or Advanced Mathematics 2 (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in the subjects above may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Mathematic subject at SPM or equivalent level) Taylor\'s Foundation in Natural and Built Environments (FNBE) Pass with min. CGPA 2.50 (not subject to AA) Taylor\'s Foundation in Design (FID) Pass with min. CGPA 2.50 Other Taylor\'s Foundation Other Taylor\'s Foundation in related field (Demonstrated numerical proficiency in Mathematics, Accounting, Principles of Economics or Statistics) with min CGPA 2.50 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass with min. CGPA 2.67 International Baccalaureate Diploma Programme (IBDP) Min. 24 points and above based on 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 60% Foundation in related field from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government Pass with CGPA 2.50 (demonstrated numerical proficiency in Mathematics, Accounting, Principles of Economics or Statistics) Diploma from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government Pass with CGPA 2.67 Other foundation, matriculation, high school certificates from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"In the Bachelor of Quantity Surveying (Hons) programme, the Common Core, University Core and Complementary Study components form the cornerstone of your education. These modules provide essential knowledge and skills tha\", \"Get ready to explore a range of exciting subjects designed to equip you with a comprehensive understanding of the industry.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Construction Technology I\", \"Legal Studies\", \"Environmental Science and Services\", \"Fundamental Measurement & Costing\", \"Construction Technology II\", \"Building Services Technology\", \"Advanced Measurement\", \"Construction Economics & Management\", \"Construction Project Management\"], \"ms\": [\"In the Bachelor of Quantity Surveying (Hons) programme, the Common Core, University Core and Complementary Study components form the cornerstone of your education. These modules provide essential knowledge and skills tha\", \"Get ready to explore a range of exciting subjects designed to equip you with a comprehensive understanding of the industry.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Construction Technology I\", \"Legal Studies\", \"Environmental Science and Services\", \"Fundamental Measurement & Costing\", \"Construction Technology II\", \"Building Services Technology\", \"Advanced Measurement\", \"Construction Economics & Management\", \"Construction Project Management\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3.5-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3.5-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Quantity Surveying programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers in the construction and civil engineering industries, including:\", \"Building Material Manager\", \"Building Surveyor\", \"Construction Manager\", \"Consultant Quantity Surveyor\", \"Contractor Quantity Surveyor\", \"Developer Quantity Surveyor\", \"Geomatic & Land Surveyor\", \"Mechanical & Electrical Quantity Surveyor\", \"Property Management, Valuation & Estate Agency Surveyor\"], \"ms\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Quantity Surveying programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers in the construction and civil engineering industries, including:\", \"Building Material Manager\", \"Building Surveyor\", \"Construction Manager\", \"Consultant Quantity Surveyor\", \"Contractor Quantity Surveyor\", \"Developer Quantity Surveyor\", \"Geomatic & Land Surveyor\", \"Mechanical & Electrical Quantity Surveyor\", \"Property Management, Valuation & Estate Agency Surveyor\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Our Bachelor of Quantity Surveying programme offers a recognised qualification and serves as a stepping stone towards becoming a Registered Quantity Surveyor—a pivotal role within the construction industry. Students automatically become members of the Board of Quantity Surveyors Malaysia (BQSM), a widely recognised professional body. This affiliation not only validates your expertise but also provides you with access to a vast network spanning over 140 countries through the Royal Institution of Chartered Surveyors (RICS). Additionally, our programme is accredited by the Pacific Association of Quantity Surveyors (PAQS), further enhancing its credibility and value. Highly regarded in the industry, the programme continues to attract demand from students pursuing careers in contract administration and sustainable procurement.\", \"ms\": \"Our Bachelor of Quantity Surveying programme offers a recognised qualification and serves as a stepping stone towards becoming a Registered Quantity Surveyor—a pivotal role within the construction industry. Students automatically become members of the Board of Quantity Surveyors Malaysia (BQSM), a widely recognised professional body. This affiliation not only validates your expertise but also provides you with access to a vast network spanning over 140 countries through the Royal Institution of Chartered Surveyors (RICS). Additionally, our programme is accredited by the Pacific Association of Quantity Surveyors (PAQS), further enhancing its credibility and value. Highly regarded in the industry, the programme continues to attract demand from students pursuing careers in contract administration and sustainable procurement.\", \"zh-CN\": \"工料测量荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由建筑、建成环境与设计学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"工料测量榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由建築、建成環境與設計學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation cl