ject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 65; 50%; IB 24 points\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 65; 50%; IB 24 points\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 65; 50%; IB 24 points。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 65; 50%; IB 24 points。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Sustainable Digital Construction Management. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM/O-Level with Pre-University/Foundation Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits including Science or Mathematics for entry with Pre-U/Foundation qualification. (Except for UEC) SPM/O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits including Science or Mathematics for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway AUSMAT (SACEi) ATAR 65% A Level Min. DD Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. 65% average in 6 subjects Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Pass with Grade CC in at least 2 subjects Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) A Pass in UEC with Min. 5 Bs including Science or Mathematics (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in Mathematics or Science subject may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Mathematic or Science subject at SPM or equivalent level) Taylor\'s Foundation/Diploma Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation/Diploma programme with min CGPA 2.00 International Baccalaureate (IB) Min 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Equivalent Qualification Foundation from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 Diploma from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 MoE Matriculation with min. CGPA 2.00 Any other qualification recognised by the Malaysian govt. Application via APEL A is allowed. Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Sustainable Digital Construction Management is multidisciplinary, collaborative and technology-driven and provides better opportunities for students\' successful careers in the ASEAN E\", \"It addresses critical global challenges by integrating contemporary construction management theory and practice with fundamental and interrelated sustainable design and construction theory and practice. The programme wil\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Construction Management and Safety\", \"Construction Technology I\", \"Building Information Modelling I\", \"Building Services\", \"Construction Environmental Protection Management\", \"Site Management\"], \"ms\": [\"The Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Sustainable Digital Construction Management is multidisciplinary, collaborative and technology-driven and provides better opportunities for students\' successful careers in the ASEAN E\", \"It addresses critical global challenges by integrating contemporary construction management theory and practice with fundamental and interrelated sustainable design and construction theory and practice. The programme wil\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Construction Management and Safety\", \"Construction Technology I\", \"Building Information Modelling I\", \"Building Services\", \"Construction Environmental Protection Management\", \"Site Management\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Sustainable Digital Construction Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Construction Manager\", \"Green Building Consultant\", \"Green Building Facilitator\", \"Building Performance Manager\", \"Sustainability Consultant\", \"Sustainability Manager\", \"Sustainability Analyst\", \"Green Building Project Manager\", \"Sustainability Program Specialist\", \"Sustainability Coordinator\", \"Project Consultant Sustainability\", \"Energy Project Manager\", \"Communication Manager – Climate and Energy\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Sustainable Digital Construction Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Construction Manager\", \"Green Building Consultant\", \"Green Building Facilitator\", \"Building Performance Manager\", \"Sustainability Consultant\", \"Sustainability Manager\", \"Sustainability Analyst\", \"Green Building Project Manager\", \"Sustainability Program Specialist\", \"Sustainability Coordinator\", \"Project Consultant Sustainability\", \"Energy Project Manager\", \"Communication Manager – Climate and Energy\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Our Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Sustainable Digital Construction Management programme responds directly to the growing demand for future-ready skilled construction managers in Malaysia and globally. One of the few programmes of its kind in the region, it attracts high-calibre students who want to be part of a new era in construction. The programme addresses sustainability challenges in the construction industry, with an emphasis on Smart and Green Construction practices. Our comprehensive curriculum leverages a Work-based Learning track featuring a year-long industry placement, bridging academic learning with hands-on experience. Aligning with the government\'s strategic plan, Construction 4.0, the programme incorporates Building Information Modeling (BIM), preparing you to support the national goal of BIM adoption across 80% of construction projects by 2025.\", \"ms\": \"Our Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Sustainable Digital Construction Management programme responds directly to the growing demand for future-ready skilled construction managers in Malaysia and globally. One of the few programmes of its kind in the region, it attracts high-calibre students who want to be part of a new era in construction. The programme addresses sustainability challenges in the construction industry, with an emphasis on Smart and Green Construction practices. Our comprehensive curriculum leverages a Work-based Learning track featuring a year-long industry placement, bridging academic learning with hands-on experience. Aligning with the government\'s strategic plan, Construction 4.0, the programme incorporates Building Information Modeling (BIM), preparing you to support the national goal of BIM adoption across 80% of construction projects by 2025.\", \"zh-CN\": \"可持续数字建造管理理学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由建筑、建成环境与设计学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"可持续數字建造管理理學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由建築、建成環境與設計學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-honours-in-sustainable-digital-construction-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-honours-in-sustainable-digital-construction-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-honours-in-sustainable-digital-construction-management.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/bachelor-of-science-honours-in-sustainable-digi