 not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-architecture-building-and-design/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-achitecture-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"April\", \"September\"]','April and September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": 40}','For International Students English Requirements: IELTS 5.0 / TOEFL 40 (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score). Note : *The list of registered architect offices, approved architectural-related organisations or practices within the building industry can be obtained from the Lembaga Arkitek Malaysia (LAM) website. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.50\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.50\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.50。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.67; CGPA 2.50。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about pursuing a Master of Architecture. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Pre-requisite Pass interview which includes review of Design Portfolio and Personal Statement. Entry Pathway Bachelor of Science or Arts in Architectural Studies with a minimum CGPA 2.67; Any other qualifications recognised by the Board of Architects Malaysia and Malaysian Ministry of Higher Education; Students must obtain LAM Part I exemption/recognition prior to joining the programme. Minimum six (6) months practical experience after graduating from the first stage of architectural education at a registered architect office, approved architectural related organization or practice within the building industry.* OR Bachelor of Science or Arts in Architectural Studies with a minimum CGPA above 2.50 and below 2.66 ; Any other qualifications recognised by the Board of Architects Malaysia and Malaysian Ministry of Higher Education Students must obtain LAM Part I exemption/recognition prior to joining the programme. Minimum twelve (12) months practical experience after graduating from the first stage of architectural education at a registered architect office , approved architectural related organisation or practice within the building industry.* As evidence, students are to provide a reference letter from the company that clearly indicates the duration of work experience, supported by a company profile, and portfolio of their practical experience','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, portfolio, workExperience, referenceLetter. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"design portfolio or practical experience portfolio when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"design portfolio or practical experience portfolio when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"专业要求公布时提交设计作品集或实践经验证明\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it（译名待复核）\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"專業要求公布时提交設計作品集或实践經验證明\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it（译名待覆核）\"]}','{\"en\": [\"In the Master of Architecture programme, you will embark on a transformative journey of specialist and research-based studio projects. By applying your knowledge of technology, environment, cultural context, architecture\", \"Core Modules\", \"Advanced Architectural Design Studio I\", \"Advanced Architectural Design Studio II\", \"Architectural Design Thesis I\", \"Architectural Design Thesis II\", \"Research Methods\", \"Dissertation I\", \"Dissertation II\", \"Environment & Technology I\", \"Environment & Technology II\", \"Professional Practice & Entrepreneurship I\", \"Professional Practice & Entrepreneurship II\", \"Electives\"], \"ms\": [\"In the Master of Architecture programme, you will embark on a transformative journey of specialist and research-based studio projects. By applying your knowledge of technology, environment, cultural context, architecture\", \"Core Modules\", \"Advanced Architectural Design Studio I\", \"Advanced Architectural Design Studio II\", \"Architectural Design Thesis I\", \"Architectural Design Thesis II\", \"Research Methods\", \"Dissertation I\", \"Dissertation II\", \"Environment & Technology I\", \"Environment & Technology II\", \"Professional Practice & Entrepreneurship I\", \"Professional Practice & Entrepreneurship II\", \"Electives\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：2-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：2-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Architect\", \"Architectural Structure Specialist\", \"Design Consultant\", \"Interior Designer / Interior Architect\", \"Project Manager\", \"Site Supervisor\", \"Residential / Commercial Architect\", \"Resort / Hotel Architectural Conceptualiser\", \"Theme Park Conceptual Architect\", \"Town Planning Conceptual Architect\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Architect\", \"Architectural Structure Specialist\", \"Design Consultant\", \"Interior Designer / Interior Architect\", \"Project Manager\", \"Site Supervisor\", \"Residential / Commercial Architect\", \"Resort / Hotel Architectural Conceptualiser\", \"Theme Park Conceptual Architect\", \"Town Planning Conceptual Architect\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"In the Master of Architecture programme, you will embark on a transformative journey of specialist and research-based studio projects. By applying your knowledge of technology, environment, cultural context, architecture\", \"Research Methods\"], \"ms\": [\"In the Master of Architecture programme, you will embark on a transformative journey of specialist and research-based studio projects. By applying your knowledge of technology, environment, cultural context, architecture\", \"Research Methods\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Master of Architecture is a postgraduate programme designed to elevate your architectural career through coursework. This prestigious professional degree programme holds the same equivalency as the LAM Part II Examination of the Board of Architects (LAM), and is a continuation of the Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architecture, following the qualification achieved through LAM Part I. Each intake welcomes a select cohort of students, ensuring you benefit from focused support, graduating with a deep understanding of architecture and the built environment. With an emphasis on theoretical knowledge and practical application, this degree prepares you to advance confidently towards registration as a Professional Architect with LAM.\", \"ms\": \"Master of Architecture is a postgraduate programme designed to elevate your architectural career through coursework. This prestigious professional degree programme holds the same equivalency as the LAM Part II Examination of the Board of Architects (LAM), and is a continuation of the Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Architecture, following the qualification achieved through LAM Part I. Each intake welcomes a select cohort of students, ensuring you benefit from focused support, graduating with a deep understanding of architecture and the built environment. With an emphasis on theoretical knowledge and practical application, this degree prepares you to advance confidently towards registration as a Professional Architect with LAM.\", \"zh-CN\": \"建筑学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由建筑、建成环境与设计学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"建築學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由建築、建成環境與設計學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/master-coursework/master-of-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/master-coursework/master-of-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/master-coursework/master-of-architecture.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/master-coursework/master-of-architecture.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/f