separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Master of Science in Virtual Design and Construction is an integrated, multidisciplinary and technology-driven postgraduate programme which provides diversified opportunities for the student’s successful career in th\", \"The programme will combine internationally renowned academic and industry expertise with intensive practical learning, using state-of-the-art technologies within the university\'s dedicated computer laboratories and virtu\", \"Core Modules\", \"You will need to choose 1 module from the list below:\", \"Construction Process and Practice\", \"Information Management and Building Information Modelling\", \"Change Management in Construction Digitalisation\", \"Integrated Project I\", \"Integrated Project II\", \"Dissertation I\", \"Dissertation II\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Specialisations\", \"You will need to choose one of the below:\"], \"ms\": [\"The Master of Science in Virtual Design and Construction is an integrated, multidisciplinary and technology-driven postgraduate programme which provides diversified opportunities for the student’s successful career in th\", \"The programme will combine internationally renowned academic and industry expertise with intensive practical learning, using state-of-the-art technologies within the university\'s dedicated computer laboratories and virtu\", \"Core Modules\", \"You will need to choose 1 module from the list below:\", \"Construction Process and Practice\", \"Information Management and Building Information Modelling\", \"Change Management in Construction Digitalisation\", \"Integrated Project I\", \"Integrated Project II\", \"Dissertation I\", \"Dissertation II\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Specialisations\", \"You will need to choose one of the below:\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：1-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：1-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science in Virtual Design and Construction programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Building Information Management Designer/Coordinator\", \"Building Information Management/Virtual Design Construction Specialist\", \"Digital Construction Manager/Specialist\", \"Project Coordinator\", \"Registered Construction Project Manager\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science in Virtual Design and Construction programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Building Information Management Designer/Coordinator\", \"Building Information Management/Virtual Design Construction Specialist\", \"Digital Construction Manager/Specialist\", \"Project Coordinator\", \"Registered Construction Project Manager\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 6 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 6 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Specialisations\"], \"ms\": [\"Specialisations\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our programme gives you specialist expertise in digital-enabled design and construction projects, while integrating sophisticated technologies relevant to industrial practice. You\'ll master key innovations like Building Information Modelling (BIM), Virtualisation and Extended Reality, Autonomous Construction, Predictive Analysis, Cloud and Realtime Collaboration through hands-on learning in our dedicated laboratories and virtual environment facilities. With limited cohort sizes, you\'ll work closely with faculty experts while developing skills tailored to the needs of the ASEAN Economic Community industry. This focused approach ensures you graduate ready to lead in the competitive and fast-evolving construction sector.\", \"ms\": \"Our programme gives you specialist expertise in digital-enabled design and construction projects, while integrating sophisticated technologies relevant to industrial practice. You\'ll master key innovations like Building Information Modelling (BIM), Virtualisation and Extended Reality, Autonomous Construction, Predictive Analysis, Cloud and Realtime Collaboration through hands-on learning in our dedicated laboratories and virtual environment facilities. With limited cohort sizes, you\'ll work closely with faculty experts while developing skills tailored to the needs of the ASEAN Economic Community industry. This focused approach ensures you graduate ready to lead in the competitive and fast-evolving construction sector.\", \"zh-CN\": \"虚拟设计与建造理学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由建筑、建成环境与设计学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"虚拟設計與建造理學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由建築、建成環境與設計學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/master-coursework/master-of-science-in-virtual-design-and-construction.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/master-coursework/master-of-science-in-virtual-design-and-construction.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/master-coursework/master-of-science-in-virtual-design-and-construction.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.e