ficial-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-M-002. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 15,894 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.021045','2026-06-21 01:09:06.021045',15894.00,'master'),(7437,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-007-doctor-of-philosophy-phd-in-architecture','TSU-PHD-007','{\"en\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Architecture\", \"ms\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Architecture\", \"zh-CN\": \"建筑学哲学博士（PhD）\", \"zh-TW\": \"建築學哲學博士（PhD）\"}','Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Architecture','engineering','{\"en\": \"School of Architecture, Building and Design\", \"ms\": \"School of Architecture, Building and Design\", \"zh-CN\": \"建筑、建成环境与设计学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"建築、建成環境與設計學院\"}','建筑、建成环境与设计学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',16307,'USD','USD 13,589 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-architecture-building-and-design-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6, \"toefl\": null}','International students must have proof of good proficiency in verbal and written English: International English Language Testing System (IELTS) score of 6.0 or its equivalent. The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Accelerated PhD Programme Bachelor\'s degree candidates who are registered for master\'s degree programmes may apply to convert to the doctoral degree programmes subjected to the following conditions: Within 1 year for full time and within 2 years for part-time candidates Having shown competency and capability in conducting research at doctoral level through rigorous internal evaluation Approval of the Taylor\'s University Senate If Your Bachelor\'s Degree is from a Different Field Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience are required to undergo and pass a bridging module. Note : Any of the condition of the above would require student\'s research proposal to be approved. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below: Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation; An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field; A list of scholarly published work; The minimum language proficiency of the candidates must be determined by the HEP consistent with applicable programme standards or based on the needs of the programme, i.e., learning outcomes and the medium of instruction. A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications or productions must be published or produced within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications or productions, the candidate must be the principal author or creator with the contributions of others clearly defined. Notes All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 0, \"note\": {\"en\": \"Master\'s Degree (Malaysian Qualification Framework, Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field; Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field\", \"ms\": \"Master\'s Degree (Malaysian Qualification Framework, Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field; Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：Master\'s Degree (Malaysian Qualification Framework, Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field; Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：Master\'s Degree (Malaysian Qualification Framework, Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field; Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements We offer two entry pathways for this PhD programme, which are normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Master\'s A Master\'s Degree (Malaysian Qualification Framework, Level 6) or equivalent (accepted by HEP) in Architecture or related field. Applications are admitted who meet the course requirements and whose research interests match those of an available member of the doctoral faculty. Interview & Review Candidates are required to submit a statement of purpose of their motivation for engaging in this programme of study. Qualified applicants may be invited to interview with a member of the doctoral faculty. English Requirement','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal, supervisor, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in architecture, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in architecture, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 6 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 6 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Architectural Critic\", \"Building Conservationist\", \"Historian\", \"Professor/Researcher\", \"Project Manager\", \"Sustainable Design Consultant\", \"Urban Designer\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Architecture programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Architectural Critic\", \"Building Conservationist\", \"Historian\", \"Professor/Researcher\", \"Project Manager\", \"Sustainable Design Consultant\", \"Urban Designer\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 8 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 8 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in architecture, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in architecture, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our PhD in Architecture programme provides a platform for you to delve deep into your chosen research areas, pushing the boundaries of architectural understanding and practice. As a doctoral candidate, you will work closely with your advisors to develop and execute a research project of substantial scope and significance. While not a licensure programme, the Doctor of Philosophy (Architecture) offers extensive opportunities, producing scholars whose work shapes policy and practice across Asia. With only a select few admitted each year, you\'ll join a tight-knit community of researchers who are passionate about driving innovation in the field through critical analysis and the generation of new insights.\", \"ms\": \"Our PhD in Architecture programme provides a platform for you to delve deep into your chosen research areas, pushing the boundaries of architectural understanding and practice. As a doctoral candidate, you will work closely with your advisors to develop and execute a research project of substantial scope and significance. While not a licensure programme, the Doctor of Philosophy (Architecture) offers extensive opportunities, producing scholars whose work shapes policy and practice across Asia. With only a select few admitted each year, you\'ll join a tight-knit community of researchers who are passionate about driving innovation in the field through critical analysis and the generation of new insights.\", \"zh-CN\": \"建筑学哲学博士（PhD） 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由建筑、建成环境与设计学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"建築學哲學博士（PhD） 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由建築、建成環境與設計學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-architecture.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-architecture.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/architecture-building-and-design/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-architecture.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-architecture-building-and-design/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-architecture-building-and-design-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-001. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,589 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.025828','2026-06-21 01:09:06.025828',13589.00,'phd'),(7438,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-008-bachelor-of-biomedical-science-honours','TSU-UG-008','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours)\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours)\", \"zh-CN\": \"生物医学科学荣誉学士\", \"zh-TW\": \"生物醫學科學榮譽學士\"}','Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours)','medicine','{\"en\": \"School of Biosciences\", \"ms\": \"School of Biosciences\", \"zh-CN\": \"生物科学学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"生物科學學院\"}','生物科学学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',96818,'USD','USD 40,341 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-biosciences/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-biosciences-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": 51, \"muet\": 3, \"ielts\": 5.5, \"toefl\": 46}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 5.5 MUET Band 3 Pre-University / Diploma Completed Pre-University / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 5.5 TOEFL iBT 46 PTE 51 Linguaskill 160 Pre-University / Foundation in Science Completed Pre-University / Foundation in Science programme that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Note : - International students may join IEN Preparatory Course and achieve the IELTS score. - All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.5, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; ATAR 60; 60%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; ATAR 60; 60%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; ATAR 60; 60%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; ATAR 60; 60%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Biomedical Science. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / SPMV / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits (Except for UEC) SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation in Science (FIS) Pass with min. CGPA 2.50 including GPA 2.33 in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CGPA 2.33 for 2 subjects including GPA 2.33 in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including (ANY 2): Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry A Level Min. DD including min. D in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry AUSMAT (SACEi) ATAR 60 with min. Grade C+ each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 60% in 6 subjects including 65% each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects including min. 5 points at Higher Level (HL) in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Matriculation in Science Min. CGPA 2.33 for 3 subjects including (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry MUFY Overall 55% including 65% each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics/Mathematics, Chemistry Other Qualifications Students with other qualifications will be considered on a case-by-case basis. Application via APEL A is allowed. Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours) programme combines core biomedical knowledge with applicable skills. You will study:\", \"Anatomy & Physiology\", \"Pathology & Microbiology\", \"Molecular Biology & Genetics\", \"Pharmacology & Toxicology\", \"Research & Laboratory Training\", \"This balanced approach ensures you gain both scientific knowledge and the practical abilities needed for a career in biomedical science.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Basic Anatomy with Histology and Heamatology\", \"Basic Pharmacology and Toxicology with Health Informatics\", \"Introduction to Microbiology\", \"Principles of Biochemistry\"], \"ms\": [\"The Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours) programme combines core biomedical knowledge with applicable skills. You will study:\", \"Anatomy & Physiology\", \"Pathology & Microbiology\", \"Molecular Biology & Genetics\", \"Pharmacology & Toxicology\", \"Research & Laboratory Training\", \"This balanced approach ensures you gain both scientific knowledge and the practical abilities needed for a career in biomedical science.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Basic Anatomy with Histology and Heamatology\", \"Basic Pharmacology and Toxicology with Health Informatics\", \"Introduction to Microbiology\", \"Principles of Biochemistry\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Future Career\", \"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours) programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Bioentrepreneur\", \"Biomedical Scientist\", \"Clinical Biochemist\", \"Clinical Cytogeneticist\", \"Clinical Molecular Geneticist\", \"Clinical Geneticist\", \"Clinical Operations Specialist\", \"Medical Science Writer\", \"Medical Laboratory Scientist\", \"Health & Safety Officer\", \"Immunologist\", \"Laboratory Technologist\"], \"ms\": [\"Future Career\", \"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours) programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Bioentrepreneur\", \"Biomedical Scientist\", \"Clinical Biochemist\", \"Clinical Cytogeneticist\", \"Clinical Molecular Geneticist\", \"Clinical Geneticist\", \"Clinical Operations Specialist\", \"Medical Science Writer\", \"Medical Laboratory Scientist\", \"Health & Safety Officer\", \"Immunologist\", \"Laboratory Technologist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research & Laboratory Training\"], \"ms\": [\"Research & Laboratory Training\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"The Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours) at Taylor’s University provides a strong foundation in human biology, health, and disease. The programme integrates theory with hands-on laboratory experience, preparing you to tackle modern biomedical challenges. Study core areas including physiology, pathology, molecular biology, genetics, and pharmacology. Through practical laboratory work and research projects, you will learn to translate scientific concepts into real-world solutions. With guidance from experienced faculty and exposure to the latest technologies, graduate ready to launch a career in in biomedical research, healthcare, or the broader life science industry.\", \"ms\": \"The Bachelor of Biomedical Science (Honours) at Taylor’s University provides a strong foundation in human biology, health, and disease. The programme integrates theory with hands-on laboratory experience, preparing you to tackle modern biomedical challenges. Study core areas including physiology, pathology, molecular biology, genetics, and pharmacology. Through practical laboratory work and research projects, you will learn to translate scientific concepts into real-world solutions. With guidance from experienced faculty and exposure to the latest technologies, graduate ready to launch a career in in biomedical research, healthcare, or the broader life science industry.\", \"zh-CN\": \"生物医学科学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由生物科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"生物醫學科學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由生物科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biomedical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biomedical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biomedical-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biomedical-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-biosciences/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-biosciences-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Local-student MYR fee captured separat