; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Food Science. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / SPMV / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits (Except for UEC) SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation in Science (FIS) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 including (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CGPA 2.00 for 2 subjects including (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including (ANY 2): Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry A Level Min. DD including min. D each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry AUSMAT (SACEi) ATAR 60 with min. Grade C+ each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics/Mathematics, Chemistry Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 60% in 6 subjects including 65% each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects including min. 5 points at Higher Level (HL) in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Matriculation in Science Min. CGPA 2.00 for 3 subjects including (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry MUFY Overall 50% including (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics/Mathematics, Chemistry; Other Qualifications Students with other qualifications will be considered on a case-by-case basis. Application via APEL A is allowed. Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"We will delve into the science behind food processing, exploring the various techniques and methods used in transforming raw ingredients into finished food products. You will learn about the principles of food preservati\", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Food Science & Nutrition\", \"Fundamentals of Chemistry\", \"Introduction to Microbiology\", \"Cell Biology\", \"Principles of Biochemistry\", \"Food Chemistry\", \"Food Physics\", \"Food Microbiology\", \"Introduction to Biostatistics\"], \"ms\": [\"We will delve into the science behind food processing, exploring the various techniques and methods used in transforming raw ingredients into finished food products. You will learn about the principles of food preservati\", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Food Science & Nutrition\", \"Fundamentals of Chemistry\", \"Introduction to Microbiology\", \"Cell Biology\", \"Principles of Biochemistry\", \"Food Chemistry\", \"Food Physics\", \"Food Microbiology\", \"Introduction to Biostatistics\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Consultancy\", \"Food Analyst\", \"Food Product Specialist\", \"Food Technologist\", \"Industry Buyer / Retail Buyer\", \"Product / Process Development Scientist\", \"Production Manager\", \"Quality Assurance Associate\", \"Quality Control Officer\", \"Regulatory Affair Officer\", \"Research Scientist (Food)\", \"Flavour Technologist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Consultancy\", \"Food Analyst\", \"Food Product Specialist\", \"Food Technologist\", \"Industry Buyer / Retail Buyer\", \"Product / Process Development Scientist\", \"Production Manager\", \"Quality Assurance Associate\", \"Quality Control Officer\", \"Regulatory Affair Officer\", \"Research Scientist (Food)\", \"Flavour Technologist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 13 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 13 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"With global population growth intensifying food scarcity concerns, our programme emphasises the crucial role of innovation in shaping sustainable food systems. Through impactful research and experiential learning, gain practical know-how to develop environmentally responsible products and improve access to safe, nutritious food. Embark on a transformative journey with our sought-after Bachelor of Food Science (Honours) programme, crafted for those passionate about promoting health and sustainability through food. You\'ll master food processing, safety, nutrition, and sensory evaluation through hands-on learning in our specialised labs. Join us in pioneering solutions that safeguard our planet\'s future while nourishing communities worldwide.\", \"ms\": \"With global population growth intensifying food scarcity concerns, our programme emphasises the crucial role of innovation in shaping sustainable food systems. Through impactful research and experiential learning, gain practical know-how to develop environmentally responsible products and improve access to safe, nutritious food. Embark on a transformative journey with our sought-after Bachelor of Food Science (Honours) programme, crafted for those passionate about promoting health and sustainability through food. You\'ll master food processing, safety, nutrition, and sensory evaluation through hands-on learning in our specialised labs. Join us in pioneering solutions that safeguard our planet\'s future while nourishing communities worldwide.\", \"zh-CN\": \"食品科学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由生物科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"食品科學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由生物科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this r