ax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-biosciences/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-biosciences-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5.5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS, TOEFL, MUET, UEC English Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2 Grade C Pre-University / Diploma Completed Pre-University / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 5.5 Pre-University / Foundation in Science Completed Pre-University / Foundation in Science programme that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Biotechnology studies. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits in Mathematics and one science subject for entry with pre-university /foundation qualification. (Except for UEC) SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM with three (3) credits in Mathematics, one science subject and one any other subject for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation in Science (FIS) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Pass STPM with min. of Grade C (GPA 2.00) in any two (2) subjects, or its equivalent Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) A Pass in UEC with min 5Bs including Mathematics and one Science subject. Candidates without a Grade B in Mathematics and one Science subject may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Mathematics and one Science subject at SPM or equivalent level. A Level Min. DD for 2 subjects AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 60% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points based on 6 subjects Matriculation in Science Min. CGPA 2.00 Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Students with other qualifications will be considered on a case-by-case basis. Application via APEL A is allowed. Notes : The credit requirement at SPM level for candidate can be waived should the grades obtained at the STPM / STAM / Diploma / Matriculation / Foundation level are equivalent/higher. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a student in our programme, you will have the opportunity to explore a wide range of essential components in the field of biotechnology. We will expose you to scientific principles and knowledge that serve as the foun\", \"In addition, you will be introduced to bioinformatics technologies, which play a critical role in analysing and interpreting biological data. Through hands-on experiences and practical applications, you will develop the \", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Biotechnology\", \"Fundamentals of Chemistry\", \"Introduction to Microbiology\", \"Cell Biology\", \"Principles of Biochemistry\", \"Principle of Genetics\", \"Molecules from Nature: Biodiversity and Natural Products\", \"Techniques and Instrumentation in Biotechnology\"], \"ms\": [\"As a student in our programme, you will have the opportunity to explore a wide range of essential components in the field of biotechnology. We will expose you to scientific principles and knowledge that serve as the foun\", \"In addition, you will be introduced to bioinformatics technologies, which play a critical role in analysing and interpreting biological data. Through hands-on experiences and practical applications, you will develop the \", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Biotechnology\", \"Fundamentals of Chemistry\", \"Introduction to Microbiology\", \"Cell Biology\", \"Principles of Biochemistry\", \"Principle of Genetics\", \"Molecules from Nature: Biodiversity and Natural Products\", \"Techniques and Instrumentation in Biotechnology\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Biotechnology programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Research and development officers\", \"Business development associates\", \"Biotech data analyst\", \"Medical claim assessor\", \"Clinical research coordinators\", \"Sustainability consultant (biotech sector)\", \"Bioinformatics computational analyst\", \"Medical sales representatives\", \"Patent agents\", \"Bioentrepreneurs\", \"Environmental biotechnologist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Biotechnology programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Research and development officers\", \"Business development associates\", \"Biotech data analyst\", \"Medical claim assessor\", \"Clinical research coordinators\", \"Sustainability consultant (biotech sector)\", \"Bioinformatics computational analyst\", \"Medical sales representatives\", \"Patent agents\", \"Bioentrepreneurs\", \"Environmental biotechnologist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 12 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 12 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"The industry-recognised Bachelor of Biotechnology (Honours) programme is designed to provide you with a comprehensive education and training across agriculture, medical, and industrial biotechnology: three core areas driving scientific innovation. Through our progressive curriculum, dive into fascinating topics such as molecular cloning, genome editing, cell tissue culture techniques, bioinformatics analysis, bioprocessing technologies, and research and development techniques and instrumentation. You\'ll also gain real-world experience through hands-on sessions, learning to apply classroom concepts in laboratory settings. We advise early applications for students seeking to lead in this high-demand field, where graduates are increasingly sought after by multinational firms and research institutions.\", \"ms\": \"The industry-recognised Bachelor of Biotechnology (Honours) programme is designed to provide you with a comprehensive education and training across agriculture, medical, and industrial biotechnology: three core areas driving scientific innovation. Through our progressive curriculum, dive into fascinating topics such as molecular cloning, genome editing, cell tissue culture techniques, bioinformatics analysis, bioprocessing technologies, and research and development techniques and instrumentation. You\'ll also gain real-world experience through hands-on sessions, learning to apply classroom concepts in laboratory settings. We advise early applications for students seeking to lead in this high-demand field, where graduates are increasingly sought after by multinational firms and research institutions.\", \"zh-CN\": \"生物技术荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由生物科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"生物技術榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由生物科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biotechnology.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biotechnology.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biotechnology.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-biotechnology.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-biosciences/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-biosciences-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting esti