academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Master of Science. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Requirements Bachelor\'s Degree in Science (Tier 1) With CGPA equal or more than 2.75 with research project component in related field or 2 years working experience in Science related industry; OR Bachelor\'s Degree in Science (Tier 2) With CGPA less than 2.75 but more than 2.50, candidates will be subject to rigorous internal assessment; OR Bachelor\'s Degree in Science (Tier 3) With a CGPA less than 2.50 but more than 2.00, recognised by the Malaysian or National Government, AND a minimum of 5 years related working experience; OR Other Qualifications Any other equivalent qualification recognised by the Malaysian Government or accepted by the Taylor\'s University Senate, AND any of the above conditions would require student\'s research proposal to be approved','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter 