cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Food Science and Nutrition\", \"A far reaching area, this cluster seeks new insights into probiotics, live \'friendly\' microbes that protect and prevent against disease, food supplements, nutraceuticals, encapsulation controlled release of food bioactiv\", \"Health Sciences\", \"This cluster encompasses research in infectious diseases which looks at disease causing agents and the drugs or chemicals that kill or slow them down. This cluster also addresses growing health problems in society especi\", \"Applied Biodiversity\", \"This cluster investigates the use and conservation of biological resources. Application of this knowledge results in a more sustainable utilisation and protection of biological resources in areas such as environmental ma\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：2 to 4-year (full time); 3 to 6-year (part time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：2 to 4-year (full time); 3 to 6-year (part time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Food/Pharmaceutical Scientist\", \"Biotech Specialist\", \"Clinical Researcher\", \"Environmental Consultant\", \"Lab Manager\", \"Quality Assurance\", \"Healthcare Administrator\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Food/Pharmaceutical Scientist\", \"Biotech Specialist\", \"Clinical Researcher\", \"Environmental Consultant\", \"Lab Manager\", \"Quality Assurance\", \"Healthcare Administrator\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 8 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 8 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"This Master of Science is designed to provide you with an in-depth understanding of your chosen area within the field of Science. You will engage in a rigorous curriculum that combines theoretical knowledge with practica\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"A far reaching area, this cluster seeks new insights into probiotics, live \'friendly\' microbes that protect and prevent against disease, food supplements, nutraceuticals, encapsulation controlled release of food bioactiv\", \"This cluster encompasses research in infectious diseases which looks at disease causing agents and the drugs or chemicals that kill or slow them down. This cluster also addresses growing health problems in society especi\"], \"ms\": [\"This Master of Science is designed to provide you with an in-depth understanding of your chosen area within the field of Science. You will engage in a rigorous curriculum that combines theoretical knowledge with practica\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"A far reaching area, this cluster seeks new insights into probiotics, live \'friendly\' microbes that protect and prevent against disease, food supplements, nutraceuticals, encapsulation controlled release of food bioactiv\", \"This cluster encompasses research in infectious diseases which looks at disease causing agents and the drugs or chemicals that kill or slow them down. This cluster also addresses growing health problems in society especi\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our Master of Science degree programme offers a research-based curriculum that deepens your expertise in your chosen natural sciences field. Whether full-time or part-time, it immerses you in the intricacies of scientific inquiry. Through hands-on experience and close collaboration with esteemed faculty members, you will hone your critical thinking skills and nurture a lifelong passion for scientific exploration. Under the guidance of renowned faculty members, you will delve into specialised areas of study, gaining invaluable insights and mentorship. Engage in cutting-edge research across various biosciences domains, leveraging state-of-the-art facilities and advanced technologies to push the boundaries of knowledge. To ensure quality supervision, only a select number of students are admitted each intake. We recommend applying early to join our impactful community of research professionals.\", \"ms\": \"Our Master of Science degree programme offers a research-based curriculum that deepens your expertise in your chosen natural sciences field. Whether full-time or part-time, it immerses you in the intricacies of scientific inquiry. Through hands-on experience and close collaboration with esteemed faculty members, you will hone your critical thinking skills and nurture a lifelong passion for scientific exploration. Under the guidance of renowned faculty members, you will delve into specialised areas of study, gaining invaluable insights and mentorship. Engage in cutting-edge research across various biosciences domains, leveraging state-of-the-art facilities and advanced technologies to push the boundaries of knowledge. To ensure quality supervision, only a select number of students are admitted each intake. We recommend applying early to join our impactful community of research professionals.\", \"zh-CN\": \"科学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由生物科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"科學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由生物科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/master-research/master-of-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/master-research/master-of-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/master-research/master-of-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/master-research/master-of-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-research-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-M-003. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,654 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.048231','2026-06-21 01:09:06.048231',13654.00,'master'),(7443,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-013-doctor-of-philosophy-phd-in-science','TSU-PHD-013','{\"en\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Science\", \"ms\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Science\", \"zh-CN\": \"科学哲学博士（PhD）\", \"zh-TW\": \"科學哲學博士（PhD）\"}','Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Science','science','{\"en\": \"School of Biosciences\", \"ms\": \"School of Biosciences\", \"zh-CN\": \"生物科学学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"生物科學學院\"}','生物科学学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',16307,'USD','USD 13,589 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-biosciences/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-biosciences-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6, \"toefl\": 60}','English Requirement for international students : IELTS 6.0 / TOEFL 60 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Notes: [1] Bachelor\'s degree in Science candidates who are registered for master\'s degree programmes in Science may apply to convert to the doctoral degree programmes subjected to the following conditions: Within 1 year for full time and within 2 years for part-time candidates; Having shown competency and capability in conducting research at doctoral level through rigorous internal evaluation. Approval of the Taylor\'s University Senate. [2] All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department. Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below: Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation; An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field; A list of scholarly published work; The minimum language proficiency of the candidates must be determined by the HEP consistent with applicable programme standards or based on the needs of the programme, i.e., learning outcomes and the medium of instruction. A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications or productions must be published or produced within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications or productions, the candidate must be the principal author or creator with the contributions of others clearly defined. Notes All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','{\"gpa\": 3.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements We offered two entry pathway for this PhD programme, which is normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Master\'s Degree Masters in the field of Science; OR Bachelor\'s Degree Passed Bachelor\'s degree in Science with min. CGPA 3.67 and registered as a Masters candidate and passed related qualifying assessment Other equivalent qualifications Any other equivalent qualification recognised by the Malaysian Government or accepted by the Taylor\'s University Senate and any of condition of the above would require student\'s research proposal to be approved.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience, proposal, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our PhD in Science programme is designed to develop graduates who possess a wide range of competencies. We are committed to equipping you with the skills and abilities to synthesise knowledge, adapt practical skills, con\", \"Throughout your studies, you will engage in advanced studies and research that will enable you to synthesise existing knowledge in your field of study. We emphasise the importance of staying abreast of the latest develop\", \"Full time\", \"3 - 6 years\", \"Part time\", \"4 - 8 years\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Infectious Disease\", \"The rich biodiversity of Malaysia enables the discovery of novel compounds to fight infectious diseases. At Taylor\'s University, the identified natural compounds will be examined for their bioactive properties as well as\"], \"ms\": [\"Our PhD in Science programme is designed to develop graduates who possess a wide range of competencies. We are committed to equipping you with the skills and abilities to synthesise knowledge, adapt practical skills, con\", \"Throughout your studies, you will engage in advanced studies and research that will enable you to synthesise existing knowledge in your field of study. We emphasise the importance of staying abreast of the latest develop\", \"Full time\", \"3 - 6 years\", \"Part time\", \"4 - 8 years\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Infectious Disease\", \"The rich biodiversity of Malaysia enables the discovery of novel compounds to fight infectious diseases. At Taylor\'s University, the identified natural compounds will be examined for their bioactive properties as well as\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Pharmaceutical Scientist\", \"Biotech Specialist\", \"Clinical Researcher\", \"Environmental Consultant\", \"Data Analyst\", \"R&D Manager\", \"Regulatory Affairs\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Pharmaceutical Scientist\", \"Biotech Specialist\", \"Clinical Researcher\", \"Environmental Consultant\", \"Data Analyst\", \"R&D Manager\", \"Regulatory Affairs\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 8 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 8 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Throughout your studies, you will engage in advanced studies and research that will enable you to synthesise existing knowledge in your field of study. We emphasise the importance of staying abreast of the latest develop\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\"], \"ms\": [\"Throughout your studies, you will engage in advanced studies and research that will enable you to synthesise existing knowledge in your field of study. We emphasise the importance of staying abreast of the latest develop\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy in Science is a research-based programme that offers an immersive research experience for those driven by a passion for discovery. As a doctoral candidate in the School of Biosciences, you\'ll collaborate with esteemed faculty members who are leading experts in their respective fields. Each intake welcomes a select cohort of students, maintaining a rigorous and personalised supervision process. Whether your focus is biotechnology, environmental science, molecular biology, or beyond, our faculty provides invaluable insights, mentoring your growth as an impactful researcher.\", \"ms\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy in Science is a research-based programme that offers an immersive research experience for those driven by a passion for discovery. As a doctoral candidate in the School of Biosciences, you\'ll collaborate with esteemed faculty members who are leading experts in their respective fields. Each intake welcomes a select cohort of students, maintaining a rigorous and personalised supervision process. Whether your focus is biotechnology, environmental science, molecular biology, or beyond, our faculty provides invaluable insights, mentoring your growth as an impactful researcher.\", \"zh-CN\": \"科学哲学博士（PhD） 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由生物科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"科學哲學博士（PhD） 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由生物科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/biosciences/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-biosciences/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-biosciences-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-002. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,589 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.052490','2026-06-21 01:09:06.052490',13589.00,'phd'),(7444,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-014-bachelor-of-business-honours','TSU-UG-014','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Business (Honours)\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Business (Honours)\", \"zh-CN\": \"商业荣誉学士\", \"zh-TW\": \"商業榮譽學士\"}','Bachelor of Business (Honours)','business','{\"en\": \"Taylor\'s Business School\", \"ms\": \"Taylor\'s Business School\", \"zh-CN\": \"泰莱商学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"泰萊商學院\"}','泰莱商学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',90701,'USD','USD 37,792 total programme',51560,'Note: 1. Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. 2. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": 3, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS MUET/IELTS/TOEFL/UEC Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall Score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2 - Grade C Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS MUET Band 3 CEFR Low B2 Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Notes : International students may join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Check the entry requirements below to join our exciting programmes that offer you endless opportunities in the business world. Prerequisites SPM/ O-Level with Pre-U/ Foundation Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits (including a Pass in Mathematics and English) for entry with pre-university /foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM/ O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits (including a Pass in Mathematics and English) for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation programme with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass any Taylor\'s Diploma programme with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Minimum CC A Level Minimum DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Minimum ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Average of 60% or above in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Minimum 24 points in 6 subjects Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) A Pass in UEC with min 5Bs including a minimum pass in Mathematics and English. Candidates without a Pass in UEC Mathematics and English may be admitted if the candidate has a Pass in Mathematics and English at SPM or equivalent Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Equivalent Qualifications Pass Business Foundation from any other HEI HSC (Yr 12), New South Wales with min. average 60% in 5 subjects Pass MOHE Matriculation with min. CGPA 2.00 Pass Foundation (in other field) from other institutions recognised by MoHE Pass DIB or Diploma in other field from other institutions recognised by MoHE Other equivalent qualification recognised by Malaysian Government Application via APEL A is allowed Note : Candidates without a pass in Mathematics and English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Matriculation / Foundation / Diploma programme contains subjects in Mathematics and English that are equivalent and achieved higher at SPM level. Malaysian students using English as the medium of instruction in their previous study or with at least Band 2 in MUET or equivalent can be exempted from a pass in English requirement. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The curriculum revolves around the performance and management of business operations, ensuring that you are prepared to tackle the challenges and responsibilities that entail leading and running organisations. Taylor\'s B\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which provide in-depth fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Accounting for Non-Specialist\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Business Economics\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Quantitative Methods for Business\", \"Human Resource Management\", \"Introduction to International Business\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Strategic Management\"], \"ms\": [\"The curriculum revolves around the performance and management of business operations, ensuring that you are prepared to tackle the challenges and responsibilities that entail leading and running organisations. Taylor\'s B\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which provide in-depth fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Accounting for Non-Specialist\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Business Economics\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Quantitative Methods for Business\", \"Human Resource Management\", \"Introduction to International Business\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Strategic Management\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Embark on these exciting careers upon completing this Bachelor of Business programme:\", \"Business Consultant\", \"Public Relations Specialist\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Product Development Manager\", \"Business Developer\", \"Strategic Marketing Expert\", \"Social Media Specialist\", \"Market Researcher\"], \"ms\": [\"Embark on these exciting careers upon completing this Bachelor of Business programme:\", \"Business Consultant\", \"Public Relations Specialist\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Product Development Manager\", \"Business Developer\", \"Strategic Marketing Expert\", \"Social Media Specialist\", \"Market Researcher\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Throughout the Bachelor of Business (Honours) programme, you will develop a comprehensive understanding of key business functions, from management to the marketing of goods and services. Designed to encompass every facet of business ownership and operations, our holistic learning modules will equip you to navigate the complexities of today’s dynamic business landscape with confidence and clarity. Whether you envision leading your own enterprise or making a meaningful contribution within a global organisation, this programme will empower you with the critical knowledge, strategic insight, and practical skills required to drive success. Given the strong interest from aspiring business leaders, we carefully select individuals who demonstrate the potential to make a real impact in the world of business. We invite you to submit your application early to take advantage of this opportunity to shape your future and begin your journey towards meaningful leadership.\", \"ms\": \"Throughout the Bachelor of Business (Honours) programme, you will develop a comprehensive understanding of key business functions, from management to the marketing of goods and services. Designed to encompass every facet of business ownership and operations, our holistic learning modules will equip you to navigate the complexities of today’s dynamic business landscape with confidence and clarity. Whether you envision leading your own enterprise or making a meaningful contribution within a global organisation, this programme will empower you with the critical knowledge, strategic insight, and practical skills required to drive success. Given the strong interest from aspiring business leaders, we carefully select individuals who demonstrate the potential to make a real impact in the world of business. We invite you to submit your application early to take advantage of this opportunity to shape your future and begin your journey towards meaningful leadership.\", \"zh-CN\": \"商业荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"商業榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/