that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Join our programme which offers exciting opportunities in the world of business and marketing. Check out our entry requirements below. Prerequisites SPM/ O-Level with Pre-U/ Foundation Pass SPM/ O-Level or equivalent to 5 credits (including a pass in Mathematics and English) for an entry with pre-university/ foundation qualification (except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits (including a Pass in Mathematics and English) for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation programme with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass any Taylor\'s Diploma programme with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Minimum CC A Level Minimum DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Minimum ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Average of 60% or above in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Minimum 24 points in 6 subjects Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) A Pass in UEC with min 5Bs including a minimum pass in Mathematics and English. Candidates without a Pass in UEC Mathematics and English may be admitted if the candidate has a Pass in Mathematics and English at SPM or equivalent Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Equivalent Qualifications Pass Business Foundation from any other HEI HSC (Yr 12), New South Wales with min. average 60% in 5 subjects Pass MOHE Matriculation with min. CGPA 2.00 Pass Foundation (in other field) from other institutions recognised by MoHE Pass DIB or Diploma in other field from other institutions recognised by MoHE Other equivalent qualification recognised by Malaysian Government Application via APEL A is allowed Notes : Candidates without a pass in Mathematics and English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Matriculation / Foundation / Diploma programme contains subjects in Mathematics and English that are equivalent and achieved higher at SPM level. Malaysian students using English as the medium of instruction in their previous study or with at least Band 2 in MUET or equivalent can be exempted from a pass in English requirement. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"In this programme, you will build a strong foundation in business principles while developing specialised skills in international marketing. You will learn how to navigate global markets, understand diverse customer segm\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Accounting for Non-Specialists\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Business Economics\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Quantitative Methods for Business\", \"Human Resource Management\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Introduction to International Business\", \"Consumer Behaviour\"], \"ms\": [\"In this programme, you will build a strong foundation in business principles while developing specialised skills in international marketing. You will learn how to navigate global markets, understand diverse customer segm\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Accounting for Non-Specialists\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Business Economics\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Quantitative Methods for Business\", \"Human Resource Management\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Introduction to International Business\", \"Consumer Behaviour\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Business in International Business and Marketing programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Digital Marketing Specialist\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Export & Import Manager\", \"Global Brand Manager\", \"International Brand Manager\", \"International Business Consultant\", \"International Trader\", \"Foreign Trade Consultant\", \"Market Research Analyst\", \"Marketing Communication Manager\", \"Product Manager\", \"Public R