st\", \"Financial Consultant\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Investment Analyst\", \"Market Analyst\", \"Tax Consultant\"], \"ms\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Accounting (Finance) (Honours) programme you can embark on these exciting careers:\", \"Accountant\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Financial Consultant\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Investment Analyst\", \"Market Analyst\", \"Tax Consultant\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"This Bachelor of Accounting (Finance) (Honours) programme is designed to provide you with a comprehensive understanding of all areas of accounting and finance, with the goal of nurturing the next generation of experts in taxation, assurance, financial accounting, corporate finance, and financial management. A distinctive feature of this programme is the integration of the Bloomberg Market Concepts (BMC) certification within the Investment Management module. This certification offers students practical exposure to real-world financial tools and data analytics, enhancing their industry readiness and employability. Given the programme’s unique curriculum and the added advantage of industry-recognised certifications, early application is encouraged to secure your place and begin your journey towards making a meaningful impact in the field of accounting and finance.\", \"ms\": \"This Bachelor of Accounting (Finance) (Honours) programme is designed to provide you with a comprehensive understanding of all areas of accounting and finance, with the goal of nurturing the next generation of experts in taxation, assurance, financial accounting, corporate finance, and financial management. A distinctive feature of this programme is the integration of the Bloomberg Market Concepts (BMC) certification within the Investment Management module. This certification offers students practical exposure to real-world financial tools and data analytics, enhancing their industry readiness and employability. Given the programme’s unique curriculum and the added advantage of industry-recognised certifications, early application is encouraged to secure your place and begin your journey towards making a meaningful impact in the field of accounting and finance.\", \"zh-CN\": \"会计与金融荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"会計與金融榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-and-finance.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-and-finance.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-and-finance.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-and-finance.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable t