-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 6.0 Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Notes : International students may join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.5, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Join our programme which offers exciting opportunities in the world of banking and finance. Check out the entry requirements below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits (including credits in Mathematics and pass in English) for entry with pre-university/ foundation qualification (Except for UEC) SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor\'s Foundation Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation programme with minimum CGPA 2.50 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass any Taylor\'s Diploma in Finance, Banking, Insurance or related field with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Minimum Grade C+ (GPA 2.33) in any two subjects Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Minimum 5Bs with a maximum of 26 points including Mathematics and a pass in English. Candidates without a Grade B in UEC Mathematics and a pass in UEC English may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Mathematics and a pass in English at SPM or equivalent A Level Minimum DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Minimum ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Minimum average of 55% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Minimum 26 points and above for 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 60% Other Equivalent Qualifications Business Foundation from other accredited institutions with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 Diploma in Finance, Banking, Insurance or a related field from an accredited institution with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 Other foundation, matriculation/high school certificates/ diploma (Year 12) from other accredited institution with minimum CGPA of 2.50 Application via APEL A is allowed Notes : Candidates without a credit in Mathematics and pass in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Matriculation / Foundation programme contains subjects in Mathematics and English that are equivalent and achieved higher at SPM level. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"In the Bachelor of Banking and Finance (Honours) degree programme, you will embark on an exhilarating journey of unleashing your analytical skills to seek solutions through creative ideas. You will also polish your inter\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which provide in-depth fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Accounting\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Business Communication\", \"Business Economics\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Quantitative Methods for Business\", \"Business Law\", \"Personal Financial Planning and Wealth Management\", \"Bank Management\", \"Money and Banking\"], \"ms\": [\"In the Bachelor of Banking and Finance (Honours) degree programme, you will embark on an exhilarating journey of unleashing your analytical skills to seek solutions through creative ideas. You will also polish your inter\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which provide in-depth fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Accounting\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Business Communication\", \"Business Economics\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Quantitative Methods for Business\", \"Business Law\", \"Personal Financial Planning and Wealth Management\", \"Bank Management\", \"Money and Banking\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Banking and Finance programme you can embark on these exciting careers:\", \"Credit Manager\", \"Credit Processing\", \"Corporate Trainer\", \"Finance Manager\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Financial Research Analyst\", \"Fund Manager\", \"Investment Analyst\", \"Mortgage Sales\", \"Risk Management Manager\"], \"ms\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Banking and Finance programme you can embark on these exciting careers:\", \"Credit Manager\", \"Credit Processing\", \"Corporate Trainer\", \"Finance Manager\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Financial Research Analyst\", \"Fund Manager\", \"Investment Analyst\", \"Mortgage Sales\", \"Risk Management Manager\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Carefully designed to provide a comprehensive background in banking and finance concepts, this programme aims to equip students with the knowledge and skills necessary for practical application in today\'s dynamic workplace by covering a wide range of topics including financial markets, investment analysis, risk management, banking operations, and regulatory frameworks. A distinctive feature of the programme is the integration of the Bloomberg Market Concepts (BMC) certification within the Portfolio Management module, offering students practical exposure to real-world financial tools and data analytics. This added dimension enhances their industry readiness and employability, making the programme especially attractive to those seeking to build expertise across key areas of banking and finance. To begin your journey towards a rewarding career in the financial sector, we encourage early application to ensure a seamless transition into this transformative academic experience.\", \"ms\": \"Carefully designed to provide a comprehensive background in banking and finance concepts, this programme aims to equip students with the knowledge and skills necessary for practical application in today\'s dynamic workplace by covering a wide range of topics including financial markets, investment analysis, risk management, banking operations, and regulatory frameworks. A distinctive feature of the programme is the integration of the Bloomberg Market Concepts (BMC) certification within the Portfolio Management module, offering students practical exposure to real-world financial tools and data analytics. This added dimension enhances their industry readiness and employability, making the programme especially attractive to those seeking to build expertise across key areas of banking and finance. To begin your journey towards a rewarding career in the financial sector, we encourage early application to ensure a seamless transition into this transformative academic experience.\", \"zh-CN\": \"银行与金融荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"银行與金融榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-banking-and-finance.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-banking-and-finance.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-banking-and-finance.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-banking-and-finance.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be r