a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits including Mathematics and a pass in English for entry with pre-university/ foundation qualification (Except for UEC) SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits including Mathematics and a pass in English for entry with Diploma qualification Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor\'s Foundation Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation programme with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass any Taylor\'s Diploma programme with min. CGPA 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Minimum CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including Mathematics and minimum pass in English. Candidates without a Grade B in UEC Mathematics and a pass in UEC English may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Mathematics and a pass in English at SPM or equivalent A Level Minimum DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Minimum ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Minimum average of 60% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Minimum of 24 points for 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Equivalent Qualifications Pass Business Foundation from any other HEI HSC (Yr 12), New South Wales with min. average 60% in 5 subjects Pass MOHE Matriculation with a CGPA of 2.00 Pass Foundation (in other fields) from other institutions recognised by MoHE Pass DIB or Diploma in other fields from other institutions recognised by MoHE Application via APEL A is allowed Other equivalent qualifications recognised by the Malaysian Government Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"This degree programme is designed to equip you with powerful analytical problem-solving skills and specialised training in calculating and effectively managing financial risks for businesses. We\'re dedicated to enriching\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Programming\", \"Microeconomics*\", \"Probability Theory*\", \"Mathematics of Finance*\", \"Advanced Calculus\", \"Mathematical Statistics*\", \"Introduction to Accounting\", \"Life Contingencies I*\", \"Applied Statistical Methods*\", \"Introduction to Finance\"], \"ms\": [\"This degree programme is designed to equip you with powerful analytical problem-solving skills and specialised training in calculating and effectively managing financial risks for businesses. We\'re dedicated to enriching\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Programming\", \"Microeconomics*\", \"Probability Theory*\", \"Mathematics of Finance*\", \"Advanced Calculus\", \"Mathematical Statistics*\", \"Introduction to Accounting\", \"Life Contingencies I*\", \"Applied Statistical Methods*\", \"Introduction to Finance\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Actuarial Studies programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Actuarial Analyst\", \"Accountants\", \"Budget Analyst\", \"Economist\", \"Mathematician\", \"Statistician\", \"Personal Financial Advisor\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Chartered Accountant\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Actuarial Studies programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Actuarial Analyst\", \"Accountants\", \"Budget Analyst\", \"Economist\", \"Mathematician\", \"Statistician\", \"Personal Financial Advisor\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Chartered Accountant\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"This Bachelor of Actuarial Studies (Honours) programme equips you with a strong foundation in mathematics, statistics, and financial theory to navigate complex financial and business environments. From risk assessment and insurance to financial planning and investment analysis, students are exposed to a wide spectrum of actuarial applications. With access to experiential learning opportunities that enrich your academic experience, you will graduate with strong analytical and problem-solving skills to make informed decisions in high-stakes, data-driven settings. For those aspiring to a future in financial risk management, insurance, or actuarial consultancy, early application is encouraged to ensure a smooth and purposeful start to this forward-looking academic journey.\", \"ms\": \"This Bachelor of Actuarial Studies (Honours) programme equips you with a strong foundation in mathematics, statistics, and financial theory to navigate complex financial and business environments. From risk assessment and insurance to financial planning and investment analysis, students are exposed to a wide spectrum of actuarial applications. With access to experiential learning opportunities that enrich your academic experience, you will graduate with strong analytical and problem-solving skills to make informed decisions in high-stakes, data-driven settings. For those aspiring to a future in financial risk management, insurance, or actuarial consultancy, early application is encouraged to ensure a smooth and purposeful start to this forward-looking academic journey.\", \"zh-CN\": \"精算学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"精算學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-actuarial-studies.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-actuarial-studies.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-actuarial-studies.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-actuarial-studies.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requireme