s a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS MUET/ IELTS/ TOEFL/ UEC Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2 - Grade C Pre-University/ Diploma Complete Pre-University/ Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English/ELS also recognised; the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS MUET Min. band 3 CEFR Min. Low B2 Pre-University/ Diploma Complete Pre-University/ Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Join our Bachelor of Entrepreneurship (Honours) in Team Entrepreneurship programme that opens doors to even more exciting opportunities. Check out the entry requirements below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits including a pass in English and Mathematics for entry with pre-university/ foundation qualification (Except for UEC) SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits including a pass in English and Mathematics for entry with Diploma qualification Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor\'s Foundation Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation programme with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass any Taylor\'s Diploma programme with min. CGPA 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Minimum CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including minimum pass in English and Mathematics. Candidates without a Pass in UEC Mathematics and English may be admitted if the candidate has a Pass in Mathematics and English at SPM or equivalent A Level Minimum DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Minimum ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Average of 60% or above in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) A minimum of 24 points for 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Equivalent Qualifications Pass MOHE Matriculation with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 Pass Foundation with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 from other institutions recognised by MoHE Pass Diploma or Advanced Diploma with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 Other equivalent qualifications recognised by the Malaysian Government HSC (year 12), New South Wales with a minimum average 60% in 5 subjects Application via APEL A is allowed Notes : Candidates without a pass in Mathematics and English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Matriculation / Foundation / Diploma programme contains subjects in Mathematics and English that are equivalent and achieved higher at SPM level. Malaysian students using English as the medium of instruction in their previous study or with at least Band 2 in MUET or equivalent can be exempted from a pass in English requirement. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Entrepreneurship in Team Entrepreneurship degree programme equips students with a range of valuable skills, including analytical problem-solving and financial risk management, essential for success in business ventur\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Venture Creation\", \"Decision Making in Accounting and Finance\", \"Working In Teams\", \"Decision Making In Marketing\", \"Management in Entrepreneurship\", \"Personal Learning and Development*\", \"Developing Venture*\", \"Growing a Venture\", \"Introduction to Economics\", \"Managing Human Capital\"], \"ms\": [\"The Entrepreneurship in Team Entrepreneurship degree programme equips students with a range of valuable skills, including analytical problem-solving and financial risk management, essential for success in business ventur\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Venture Creation\", \"Decision Making in Accounting and Finance\", \"Working In Teams\", \"Decision Making In Marketing\", \"Management in Entrepreneurship\", \"Personal Learning and Development*\", \"Developing Venture*\", \"Growing a Venture\", \"Introduction to Economics\", \"Managing Human Capital\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Entrepreneurship in Team Entrepreneurship programme you can embark on these exciting careers:\", \"Business Consultant\", \"Commercialisation Manager\", \"Business Development Manager\", \"Business Management\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"General Manager\", \"Government or Corporate Policy Adviser\", \"Innovation Manager\", \"Sole Trader\"], \"ms\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Entrepreneurship in Team Entrepreneurship programme you can embark on these exciting careers:\", \"Business Consultant\", \"Commercialisation Manager\", \"Business Development Manager\", \"Business Management\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"General Manager\", \"Government or Corporate Policy Adviser\", \"Innovation Manager\", \"Sole Trader\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"If you learn best by doing rather than sitting through traditional classroom lectures, this programme is built for you. Drawing inspiration from Finland’s renowned Team Academy model, it offers a fully hands-on learning experience that places real entrepreneurial practice from day one. You won’t just analyse case studies. You’ll build your own business, test your ideas in the real world, and learn through trial, teamwork and action. From solving real challenges to pitching ideas, everything you do here shapes your mindset as a future entrepreneur. As part of your journey, you’ll also have the opportunity to receive funding support to kickstart your venture, turning your dream business into a reality while you’re still studying. With a highly personalised and team-based approach, this programme is for bold thinkers ready to turn ideas into action.\", \"ms\": \"If you learn best by doing rather than sitting through traditional classroom lectures, this programme is built for you. Drawing inspiration from Finland’s renowned Team Academy model, it offers a fully hands-on learning experience that places real entrepreneurial practice from day one. You won’t just analyse case studies. You’ll build your own business, test your ideas in the real world, and learn through trial, teamwork and action. From solving real challenges to pitching ideas, everything you do here shapes your mindset as a future entrepreneur. As part of your journey, you’ll also have the opportunity to receive funding support to kickstart your venture, turning your dream business into a reality while you’re still studying. With a highly personalised and team-based approach, this programme is for bold thinkers ready to turn ideas into action.\", \"zh-CN\": \"团队创业荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"团队創業榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-entrepreneurship-in-team-enterpreneurship.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-entrepreneurship-in-team-enterpreneurship.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore