l fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": 3.5, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS MUET Band 2 Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS MUET Band 3.5 IELTS Band 5.0 Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Notes : International students may join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.5, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; ATAR 60; 55%; 60%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Join our programme which offers exciting opportunities in Accounting (Fintech). Check out the entry requirements below. Prerequisites SPM/ O-Level with Pre-U/ Foundation Pass SPM/ O-Level or equivalent to 5 credits (including mathematics) for entry with pre-university/ foundation qualification (except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits (including credit in Mathematics) for entry with Diploma and Advanced Diploma qualification. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation programme with a minimum CGPA of 2.50. Taylor\'s Diploma Pass Diploma in Accounting or related field with a minimum CGPA of 2.50. Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Pass with minimum Grade C+ with GPA 2.33 in any 2 subjects. Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with minimum 5Bs, maximum 26 points including Mathematics. Candidates without a Grade B in UEC Mathematics may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Mathematics at SPM or equivalent A Level Minimum DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Minimum ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Minimum average of 55% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Minimum 26 points and above in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 60% Other Equivalent Qualifications Pass Business Foundation from other accredited institutions with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 Pass a Diploma in Accounting or a related field from an accredited institution with a minimum CGPA of 2.50. Candidates with a CGPA below 2.50 but more than 2.00 may be admitted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment Pass in Diploma (Level 4, MQF) with minimum of CGPA of 2.50 or Advanced Diploma (Level 5, MQF) in accounting or related field with a least a CGPA of 2.50 Other foundation, matriculation, high school certificates /diploma (Year 12) from other accredited institutions with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 Application via APEL A is allowed Note : Candidates with a pass in Mathematics at SPM level need to take and pass the enhancement Mathematics subject that equivalent to the SPM level. The enhancement Mathematics subject must be offered in first semester. Candidates without a credit in Mathematics at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Matriculation / Foundation / Diploma / Advanced Diploma programme contains subjects in Mathematics that are equivalent and achieved higher at SPM level. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Transform your future through comprehensive accounting and financial technology knowledge in areas such as blockchain, big data & analytics, cloud computing, and Al, with the support of our academics and industry partner\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Accounting\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Microeconomics\", \"Macroeconomics\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Language Use and Society\", \"Introduction to Management Accounting\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Corporate Finance\", \"Financial Reporting\"], \"ms\": [\"Transform your future through comprehensive accounting and financial technology knowledge in areas such as blockchain, big data & analytics, cloud computing, and Al, with the support of our academics and industry partner\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Accounting\", \"Introduction to Management\", \"Microeconomics\", \"Macroeconomics\", \"Introduction to Finance\", \"Language Use and Society\", \"Introduction to Management Accounting\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Corporate Finance\", \"Financial Reporting\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Accounting with FinTech programme you can embark on these exciting careers:\", \"Accounting Software / Financial Product Developer\", \"Applications Developer\", \"Blockchain Developer\", \"Accountant\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Financial Controller\", \"Financial Consultant\", \"Tax Officer\", \"Tax Consultant\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Investment Analyst\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Cybersecurity Analyst\"], \"ms\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Accounting with FinTech programme you can embark on these exciting careers:\", \"Accounting Software / Financial Product Developer\", \"Applications Developer\", \"Blockchain Developer\", \"Accountant\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Financial Controller\", \"Financial Consultant\", \"Tax Officer\", \"Tax Consultant\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Investment Analyst\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Cybersecurity Analyst\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Transform your future through comprehensive accounting and financial technology knowledge in areas such as blockchain, big data & analytics, cloud computing, and Al, with the support of our academics and industry partner\"], \"ms\": [\"Transform your future through comprehensive accounting and financial technology knowledge in areas such as blockchain, big data & analytics, cloud computing, and Al, with the support of our academics and industry partner\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"This Bachelor of Accounting with FinTech (Honours) programme is designed to prepare you for the future of finance by combining core accounting knowledge with emerging financial technologies. You’ll explore key areas such as financial and management accounting, audit and assurance, corporate governance, taxation, blockchain, financial innovation, and information systems. A distinctive feature of this programme is the integration of the Bloomberg Market Concepts (BMC) certification upon completing the Corporate Finance module. This gives you hands-on experience with industry tools and real-time data analytics, enhancing your career readiness. With a future-focused curriculum and industry-recognised certifications, this programme sets you apart—apply early and lead the next wave of financial transformation.\", \"ms\": \"This Bachelor of Accounting with FinTech (Honours) programme is designed to prepare you for the future of finance by combining core accounting knowledge with emerging financial technologies. You’ll explore key areas such as financial and management accounting, audit and assurance, corporate governance, taxation, blockchain, financial innovation, and information systems. A distinctive feature of this programme is the integration of the Bloomberg Market Concepts (BMC) certification upon completing the Corporate Finance module. This gives you hands-on experience with industry tools and real-time data analytics, enhancing your career readiness. With a future-focused curriculum and industry-recognised certifications, this programme sets you apart—apply early and lead the next wave of financial transformation.\", \"zh-CN\": \"会计与金融科技荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"会計與金融科技榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-fintech.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-fintech.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-fintech.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/undergraduate/bachelor-of-accounting-fintech.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effec