, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 35,436 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.090729','2026-06-21 01:09:06.090729',35436.00,'bachelor'),(7452,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-022-master-of-business-administration','TSU-MA-022','{\"en\": \"Master of Business Administration\", \"ms\": \"Master of Business Administration\", \"zh-CN\": \"工商管理硕士\", \"zh-TW\": \"工商管理碩士\"}','Master of Business Administration','business','{\"en\": \"Taylor\'s Business School\", \"ms\": \"Taylor\'s Business School\", \"zh-CN\": \"泰莱商学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"泰萊商學院\"}','泰莱商学院','coursework / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',1.0,'1-year (Full Time); 2 to 5-year (Part Time)',129269,'USD','USD 17,954 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-business-administration-and-master-of-management-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"November\"]','February, April, June, September and November','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6, \"toefl\": null}','International Students IELTS 6.0 (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score). Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL) The following criteria shall apply for working adults applying for Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL): Applicants must meet the requirements set by the Malaysian Qualifications Agency (MQA) A minimum of 2 years\' managerial or supervisory experience is required If Your Bachelor Degree Are From Different Fields 1. Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. 2. Students without a qualification in the related field but with relevant working experience requires to fulfil the following conditions: CGPA above 2.50 must have at least two (2) years of relevant working experience; or CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; 3. In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.75, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.5; CGPA between 2.75 and 2.50\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.5; CGPA between 2.75 and 2.50\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.5; CGPA between 2.75 and 2.50。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.5; CGPA between 2.75 and 2.50。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Master of Business Administration (MBA). To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Fulfilling one of the requirements listed below: Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with CGPA above 2.75; OR Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with CGPA between 2.75 and 2.50 with 2 years working experience and an interview; OR Bachelor\'s degree in the field or relevant fields with CGPA less than 2.5 and minimum 5 years working experience OR Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL) in accordance to Malaysian Qualification Agency requirement and 2 years managerial/ supervisory experience; OR Other academic qualification that are equivalent to the above and recognized by the Malaysian Qualification Agency (MQA) and the Malaysian Ministry of Education.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, supervisor, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"If you are a working adult seeking to enhance your career prospects, the Taylor\'s MBA offers the flexibility and structure you need. With a minimum duration of 12 months, the programme is built to accommodate the demandi\", \"It is designed to address the latest challenges faced by businesses and incorporates up to date insights from industry experts. The elective courses are reviewed regularly to reflect current market trends, ensuring that \", \"In addition, the\", \"curriculum integrates Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) principles across various modules, giving you critical insights into sustainable and responsible business practices\", \"Core (28 credits - 7 modules)\", \"Strategy & Innovation\", \"Market Dynamics & Digital Disruption\", \"Design Thinking\", \"Business Analytics\", \"Delivering Value to Customers\", \"Managing People for Performance\", \"Managing Decision\", \"Elective Modules (4 credits - 1 module)\", \"You will need to choose 1 module from the list below:\"], \"ms\": [\"If you are a working adult seeking to enhance your career prospects, the Taylor\'s MBA offers the flexibility and structure you need. With a minimum duration of 12 months, the programme is built to accommodate the demandi\", \"It is designed to address the latest challenges faced by businesses and incorporates up to date insights from industry experts. The elective courses are reviewed regularly to reflect current market trends, ensuring that \", \"In addition, the\", \"curriculum integrates Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) principles across various modules, giving you critical insights into sustainable and responsible business practices\", \"Core (28 credits - 7 modules)\", \"Strategy & Innovation\", \"Market Dynamics & Digital Disruption\", \"Design Thinking\", \"Business Analytics\", \"Delivering Value to Customers\", \"Managing People for Performance\", \"Managing Decision\", \"Elective Modules (4 credits - 1 module)\", \"You will need to choose 1 module from the list below:\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：1-year (Full Time); 2 to 5-year (Part Time)。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：1-year (Full Time); 2 to 5-year (Part Time)。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Business Administration programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Management Consultant\", \"Marketing Manager\", \"Investment Banker\", \"Operations Manager\", \"Financial Advisor\", \"Data Analyst\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Investment Fund Manager\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Business Administration programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Management Consultant\", \"Marketing Manager\", \"Investment Banker\", \"Operations Manager\", \"Financial Advisor\", \"Data Analyst\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Investment Fund Manager\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Our highly sought-after Master of Business Administration (MBA) curriculum combines personalised leadership development with a strategic multidisciplinary approach, offering you a unique and comprehensive learning experience. This programme is crafted to provide you with a strong foundation in business knowledge, insights, and skills that are relevant and applicable across the globe. Whether your goal is to lead in a multinational corporation, launch your own startup, or create meaningful change in the public sector, our MBA equips you with the tools and perspectives needed to make an impact and succeed at the highest levels. What makes our MBA even more accessible is that it does not require prior work experience, making it the ideal opportunity for both aspiring professionals and those looking to fast-track their careers. Apply early to secure the skills and confidence needed to thrive in today’s competitive business landscape.\", \"ms\": \"Our highly sought-after Master of Business Administration (MBA) curriculum combines personalised leadership development with a strategic multidisciplinary approach, offering you a unique and comprehensive learning experience. This programme is crafted to provide you with a strong foundation in business knowledge, insights, and skills that are relevant and applicable across the globe. Whether your goal is to lead in a multinational corporation, launch your own startup, or create meaningful change in the public sector, our MBA equips you with the tools and perspectives needed to make an impact and succeed at the highest levels. What makes our MBA even more accessible is that it does not require prior work experience, making it the ideal opportunity for both aspiring professionals and those looking to fast-track their careers. Apply early to secure the skills and confidence needed to thrive in today’s competitive business landscape.\", \"zh-CN\": \"工商管理硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"工商管理碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-business-administration.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-business-administration.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-business-administration.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-business-administration.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-business-administration-and-master-of-management-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured se