the following conditions: CGPA above 2.50 must have at least one (1) year of relevant working experience; or CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; 3. In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 0, \"note\": {\"en\": \"Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or above 2; Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or below 2; Level 7 in same field recognised by the Malaysian Government, with credit transfer\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or above 2; Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or below 2; Level 7 in same field recognised by the Malaysian Government, with credit transfer\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or above 2; Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or below 2; Level 7 in same field recognised by the Malaysian Government, with credit transfer。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or above 2; Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or below 2; Level 7 in same field recognised by the Malaysian Government, with credit transfer。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Master of Management. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Fulfilling one of the requirements listed below: A Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or above 2.50, recognised by the Malaysian or National Government; OR A Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA equal or below 2.50 but above 2.00, recognised by the Malaysian Government or National Government, AND a minimum 5 years related work experience; OR Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL) as approved by MoHE; OR Postgraduate Diploma Level 7 in same field recognised by the Malaysian Government, with credit transfer; OR Any other equivalent qualification recognised by the Malaysian Government.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The programme aims to enhance graduates\' capabilities through strategic and critical thinking approaches to developing solutions, comprehensive knowledge in core areas of management, critical evaluation of evidence to su\", \"Core (7 modules)\", \"Strategic Management\", \"Organisational Management\", \"Leadership and Management of Change\", \"Design Thinking\", \"Leading Future Organisation\", \"Project Management and Consultancy\", \"Quality Management for Organisational Excellence\", \"Elective Modules (1 module)\", \"You will need to choose ONE (1) elective from a list of modules which reflect contemporary trends in business:\", \"Social Commerce and Digital Marketing\", \"Marketing Management\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\"], \"ms\": [\"The programme aims to enhance graduates\' capabilities through strategic and critical thinking approaches to developing solutions, comprehensive knowledge in core areas of management, critical evaluation of evidence to su\", \"Core (7 modules)\", \"Strategic Management\", \"Organisational Management\", \"Leadership and Management of Change\", \"Design Thinking\", \"Leading Future Organisation\", \"Project Management and Consultancy\", \"Quality Management for Organisational Excellence\", \"Elective Modules (1 module)\", \"You will need to choose ONE (1) elective from a list of modules which reflect contemporary trends in business:\", \"Social Commerce and Digital Marketing\", \"Marketing Management\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：1-year (Full Time); 2 to 5-year (Part Time)。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：1-year (Full Time); 2 to 5-year (Part Time)。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Management Consultant\", \"Management Analyst\", \"Operations Manager\", \"Human Resource Administrator\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Industry Relations Specialist\", \"Marketing Manager\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Management Consultant\", \"Management Analyst\", \"Operations Manager\", \"Human Resource Administrator\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Industry Relations Specialist\", \"Marketing Manager\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The programme aims to enhance graduates\' capabilities through strategic and critical thinking approaches to developing solutions, comprehensive knowledge in core areas of management, critical evaluation of evidence to su\"], \"ms\": [\"The programme aims to enhance graduates\' capabilities through strategic and critical thinking approaches to developing solutions, comprehensive knowledge in core areas of management, critical evaluation of evidence to su\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"The Master of Management programme is tailored for those who aspire to lead, manage, and innovate in today’s fast-paced business world. It equips you with essential management skills and strategic insights to excel in managerial roles across diverse industries. By blending theoretical knowledge with practical application, our curriculum helps you develop leadership, decision-making, and problem-solving abilities to navigate complex business challenges and drive success. You can choose between two tracks: Consultancy or Entrepreneurship. The consultancy track offers hands-on projects with industry partners, allowing you to address real-world business challenges with innovative solutions while building valuable connections. Alternatively, the entrepreneurial track provides expert mentorship to help transform your inspiring business ideas into reality. Whether your goal is to take on senior leadership roles in multinational corporations or to lead your own business venture, this programme equips you with the expertise and qualifications to thrive in the field.\", \"ms\": \"The Master of Management programme is tailored for those who aspire to lead, manage, and innovate in today’s fast-paced business world. It equips you with essential management skills and strategic insights to excel in managerial roles across diverse industries. By blending theoretical knowledge with practical application, our curriculum helps you develop leadership, decision-making, and problem-solving abilities to navigate complex business challenges and drive success. You can choose between two tracks: Consultancy or Entrepreneurship. The consultancy track offers hands-on projects with industry partners, allowing you to address real-world business challenges with innovative solutions while building valuable connections. Alternatively, the entrepreneurial track provides expert mentorship to help transform your inspiring business ideas into reality. Whether your goal is to take on senior leadership roles in multinational corporations or to lead your own business venture, this programme equips you with the expertise and qualifications to thrive in the field.\", \"zh-CN\": \"管理学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"管理學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-management.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/master-coursework/master-of-management.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/online-postgraduate-programme/taylors-fees-schedule-online-postgraduate-programme-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-M-005. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 17,954 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.102605','2026-06-21 01:09:06.102605',17954.00,'master'),(7454,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-024-master-of-business-administration-100-online','TSU-MA-024','{\"en\": \"Master of Business Administration (100% Online)\", \"ms\": \"Master of Business Administration (100% Online)\", \"zh-CN\": \"工商管理硕士（100% 在线）\", \"zh-TW\": \"工商管理碩士（100% 在線）\"}','Master of Business Administratio