ons Agency (MQA) The APEL provision is only to be applied to Malaysian nationalities If Your Bachelor Degree Are From Different Fields 1. Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. 2.Students without a qualification in the related field but with relevant working experience requires to fulfil the following conditions: CGPA above 2.50 must have at least one (2) years of relevant working experience; or CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; 3. In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.75, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Master of Business Administration. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Fulfilling one of the requirements listed below: A Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with CGPA above 2.75; OR A Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75 with 2 years working experience and an interview; OR A Bachelor\'s degree in the field or relevant fields with a CGPA below 2.50 and a minimum of 5 years of working experience; OR Any other academic qualification that are equivalent to the above and recognised by the Malaysian Qualification Agency (MQA) and the Malaysian Ministry of Education. International Students','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Taylor\'s 100% Online MBA, offered by our AACSB-accredited business school makes this an ideal option for working adults like you who aim to meet the rigorous professional qualification standards required in today\'s busin\", \"Core Modules\", \"Strategy and Innovation\", \"Business Analytics\", \"Market Dynamics and Digital Disruption\", \"Design Thinking\", \"Managing Decisions\", \"Delivering Value to Customers\", \"Managing People for Performance\", \"Research Methodology for Executive\", \"Business Management Project\", \"1 Elective Module\", \"Research Methodology for Executive is a prerequisite to Business Management Project.\", \"Elective Modules\"], \"ms\": [\"Taylor\'s 100% Online MBA, offered by our AACSB-accredited business school makes this an ideal option for working adults like you who aim to meet the rigorous professional qualification standards required in today\'s busin\", \"Core Modules\", \"Strategy and Innovation\", \"Business Analytics\", \"Market Dynamics and Digital Disruption\", \"Design Thinking\", \"Managing Decisions\", \"Delivering Value to Customers\", \"Managing People for Performance\", \"Research Methodology for Executive\", \"Business Management Project\", \"1 Elective Module\", \"Research Methodology for Executive is a prerequisite to Business Management Project.\", \"Elective Modules\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：online；官方学制：2-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：online；官方學制：2-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Business Administration programme, you could embark on any of these exci