s。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the Doctor of Business Administration (DBA). To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Fulfilling one of the requirements listed below: i. A Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in Business Administration, as accepted by the HEP Senate; OR ii. A Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-related fields, accepted by the HEP Senate, subject to having relevant working experience and rigorous internal assessment; OR iii. A Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-related fields, without relevant working experience, accepted by the HEP Senate, subject to passing prerequisite courses; OR iv. Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) recognised by the Malaysian Government. Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL) The following criteria shall apply for working adults applying for Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL): All applicants are subjected to appropriate APEL assessments conducted by the Malaysian Qualifications Agency (MQA) The APEL provision is only to be applied to Malaysian nationalities Working Experience Experience can be cumulative experience even before acquiring required qualification for a particular level of study. However, the experience must be relevant to the level of study as well as the content. Rigorous Internal Assessment Rigorous assessment to evaluate the suitability of an applicant for a programme through statement of purpose, interview and other methods may cover the following criteria: Demonstration of strong business experience, and that you have held significant managerial responsibilities. Evidence of any achievements in your professional life, for example, consistently performing at a high level, consistent career progression and any impact that you have had on your organisation. Professional skills that you have developed, for example, teamwork, leadership, problem-solving, negotiating and analytical skills. How you will contribute to your class and what experiences you can bring to the institution. (Lancaster University, 2021) Prerequisite Courses The prerequisite courses must equip the applicant with necessary business knowledge of one level lower than the programme level: Managing People Managing Financial Resources Understanding Customers Understanding Environments and Strategic Planning','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Combining guided coursework, action research, and networking opportunities through conferences and retreats, this programme equips learners with the advanced skills required to contribute to the advancement of business k\", \"Leading People, Work and Organisations\", \"Strategic Marketing Decision for Value Creation\", \"Fintech and Financial Strategy for Decision Making\", \"Managing Dynamic Business Environment\", \"Driving Strategy, Innovation and Entrepreneurship\", \"Digital Transformation\", \"Managing Responsible Business\", \"Doctoral Research and Literature Review\", \"Quantitative Research\", \"Qualitative Research\", \"Research Proposal\", \"Dissertation in Practice\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\"], \"ms\": [\"Combining guided coursework, action research, and networking opportunities through conferences and retreats, this programme equips learners with the advanced skills required to contribute to the advancement of business k\", \"Leading People, Work and Organisations\", \"Strategic Marketing Decision for Value Creation\", \"Fintech and Financial Strategy for Decision Making\", \"Managing Dynamic Business Environment\", \"Driving Strategy, Innovation and Entrepreneurship\", \"Digital Transformation\", \"Managing Responsible Business\", \"Doctoral Research and Literature Review\", \"Quantitative Research\", \"Qualitative Research\", \"Research Proposal\", \"Dissertation in Practice\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3-year (Full Time); 4-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3-year (Full Time); 4-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Business Administration (DBA), you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academician\", \"Consultant\", \"C-level Executive\", \"Management Analyst\", \"Economist\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Project Director\", \"Strategic Planner\", \"Director of Human Resources\", \"Senior Market Research Analyst\", \"Leadership in Government Agencies\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Business Administration (DBA), you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academician\", \"Consultant\", \"C-level Executive\", \"Management Analyst\", \"Economist\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Project Director\", \"Strategic Planner\", \"Director of Human Resources\", \"Senior Market Research Analyst\", \"Leadership in Government Agencies\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 12 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 12 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Combining guided coursework, action research, and networking opportunities through conferences and retreats, this programme equips learners with the advanced skills required to contribute to the advancement of business k\", \"Doctoral Research and Literature Review\", \"Quantitative Research\", \"Qualitative Research\", \"Research Proposal\"], \"ms\": [\"Combining guided coursework, action research, and networking opportunities through conferences and retreats, this programme equips learners with the advanced skills required to contribute to the advancement of business k\", \"Doctoral Research and Literature Review\", \"Quantitative Research\", \"Qualitative Research\", \"Research Proposal\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Designed for mid-level executives, senior leaders, and aspiring entrepreneurs, this programme offers an in-depth exploration of advanced business strategies, helping you elevate your strategic decision-making and leadership capabilities. It empowers you to tackle complex, real-world challenges with innovative, actionable solutions. Through collaboration with academics, industry experts, and goal-oriented peers, you will expand your global network while gaining the insights and expertise needed to address today’s business complexities. Whether you are aiming for senior leadership roles or seeking to drive transformative change in your own venture, this programme provides you with the qualifications and strategic vision to succeed in the global business landscape. Apply early to join our elite community of learners.\", \"ms\": \"Designed for mid-level executives, senior leaders, and aspiring entrepreneurs, this programme offers an in-depth exploration of advanced business strategies, helping you elevate your strategic decision-making and leadership capabilities. It empowers you to tackle complex, real-world challenges with innovative, actionable solutions. Through collaboration with academics, industry experts, and goal-oriented peers, you will expand your global network while gaining the insights and expertise needed to address today’s business complexities. Whether you are aiming for senior leadership roles or seeking to drive transformative change in your own venture, this programme provides you with the qualifications and strategic vision to succeed in the global business landscape. Apply early to join our elite community of learners.\", \"zh-CN\": \"工商管理博士（DBA） 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"工商管理博士（DBA） 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-coursework/doctor-of-business-administration.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-coursework/doctor-of-business-administration.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-coursework/doctor-of-business-administration.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-coursework/doctor-of-business-administration.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-003. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 23,227 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.120631','2026-06-21 01:09:06.120631',23227.00,'phd'),(7457,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-027-doctor-of-philosophy-phd-in-business','TSU-PHD-027','{\"en\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Business\", \"ms\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Business\", \"zh-CN\": \"Business哲学博士（PhD）\", \"zh-TW\": \"Business哲學博士（PhD）\"}','Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Business','business','{\"en\": \"Taylor\'s Business School\", \"ms\": \"Taylor\'s Business School\", \"zh-CN\": \"泰莱商学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"泰萊商學院\"}','泰莱商学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',16307,'USD','USD 13,589 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6.5, \"toefl\": null}','International Students IELTS 6.5 (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) Accelerated PhD Programme Bachelor\'s degree candidates who are registered for master\'s degree programmes may apply to convert to the doctoral degree programmes subjected to the following conditions: Within 1 year for full time and within 2 years for part-time candidates Having shown competency and capability in conducting research at doctoral level through rigorous internal evaluation Approval of the Taylor’s University Senate If Your Bachelor Degree Are From Different Fields Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. Students without a qualification in the related field but with relevant working experience requires to fulfil the following conditions: CGPA above 2.50 must have at least one (1) year of relevant working experience; or CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below: Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field A list of scholarly published work The minimum language proficiency of the candidates must be determined by the HEP consistent with applicable programme standards or based on the needs of the programme, i.e., learning outcomes and the medium of instruction. A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications must be published within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications, the candidate must be the principal author with the contributions of others clearly defined. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 3.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements We offered two entry pathway for this PhD programme, which is normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode You need to fulfil one of the requirements below: Masters in the related discipline; OR Passed Bachelor\'s degree with min. CGPA 3.67 and Registered as a Masters candidate and passed related qualifying assessment OR Any other equivalent qualification recognized by Malaysian government or accepted by the Taylor\'s University Senate and any of condition of the above would require student\'s research proposal to be approved. Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL) The following criteria shall apply for working adults applying for Accreditation of Prior Experiential Learning (APEL): All applicants are subjected to appropriate APEL assessments conducted by the Malaysian Qualifications Agency (MQA) The APEL provision is only to be applied to Malaysian nationalities','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in business, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with a s\", \"Full time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Part time\", \"4 – 8 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Social Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Accounting\", \"Accounting Information Systems and Risk Management\", \"Corporate Governance\", \"Financial Reporting\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in business, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with a s\", \"Full time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Part time\", \"4 – 8 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Social Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Accounting\", \"Accounting Information Systems and Risk Management\", \"Corporate Governance\", \"Financial Reporting\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Business programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Product Manager\", \"Economist\", \"Investment Fund Manager\", \"Statistician\", \"Corporate Treasurer\", \"Personal Financial Advisor\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Chartered Accountant\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Business programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Financial Analyst\", \"Product Manager\", \"Economist\", \"Investment Fund Manager\", \"Statistician\", \"Corporate Treasurer\", \"Personal Financial Advisor\", \"Forensic Accountant\", \"Chartered Accountant\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in business, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with a s\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Social Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in business, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with a s\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Social Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy in Business is specifically designed for individuals who aspire to acquire advanced research skills and explore scientific knowledge in various functional areas of business. We provide you with the opportunity to cultivate expansive intellectual thinking, enhancing the body of knowledge in business disciplines such as entrepreneurship, human capital, financial economics, investment, supply chain, marketing, and managerial leadership. As a doctoral student in our programme, you will have the freedom to delve deep into your chosen research area. We believe in empowering you to contribute to the advancement of business knowledge through rigorous research, critical analysis, and the generation of new insights. To ensure quality supervision, only a select number of students are admitted each intake. We recommend applying early to join our impactful community of research professionals.\", \"ms\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy in Business is specifically designed for individuals who aspire to acquire advanced research skills and explore scientific knowledge in various functional areas of business. We provide you with the opportunity to cultivate expansive intellectual thinking, enhancing the body of knowledge in business disciplines such as entrepreneurship, human capital, financial economics, investment, supply chain, marketing, and managerial leadership. As a doctoral student in our programme, you will have the freedom to delve deep into your chosen research area. We believe in empowering you to contribute to the advancement of business knowledge through rigorous research, critical analysis, and the generation of new insights. To ensure quality supervision, only a select number of students are admitted each intake. We recommend applying early to join our impactful community of research professionals.\", \"zh-CN\": \"Business哲学博士（PhD） 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱商学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"Business哲學博士（PhD） 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱商學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-business.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-business.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-business.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/business/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-business.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-business-school/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-business-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-004. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,589 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.124541','2026-06-21 01:09:06.124541',13589.00,'phd'),(7458,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-028-bachelor-of-patisserie-arts-honours','TSU-UG-028','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Patisserie Arts (Honours)\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Patisserie Arts (Honours)\", \"zh-CN\": \"西点艺术荣誉学士\", \"zh-TW\": \"西点藝術榮譽學士\"}','Bachelor of Patisserie Arts (Honours)','business','{\"en\": \"Taylor\'s Culinary Institute\", \"ms\": \"Taylor\'s Culinary Institute\", \"zh-CN\": \"泰莱烹饪学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"泰萊烹飪學院\"}','泰莱烹饪学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',85865,'USD','USD 35,777 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-tci-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS, TOEFL, MUET, UEC English Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2 - Grade C Pre-University/Diploma Complete Pre-University/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS 5.0 Pre-University/Diploma Complete Pre-University/Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 55; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 55; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 55; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 55; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Patisserie Arts. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits for entry with Pre-University / Foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : 1. Candidates need to pass BM and History at SPM level. 2. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation / Diploma Pass with min. CGPA 2.00; or Pass Diploma in Culinary Arts Pass Advanced Diploma in Patisseries & Gastronomic Cuisine Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs A Level Min. DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 50% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% MOHE Matriculation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 DKM/DKLM/DVM Pass with a minimum CGPA 2.50 subject to Senate approval of the relevant institutions; or Graduated with a minimum CGPA 2.00 with a minimum of two (2) years of work experience in the related field. Other Equivalent Qualification Pass Foundation/Diploma/ Higher Diploma/ Advanced Diploma from any other institution recognised by Malaysian Government with min.CGPA 2.00; or Application via APEL A is allowed; or Any other equiv. qualification recognized by the M\'sian Government. Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Bachelor of Patisserie Arts at Taylor\'s University is a premier programme designed for aspiring pastry chefs and dessert artists. Students gain hands-on experience in well-equipped kitchens, guided by industry expert\", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Business of Hospitality, Food and Leisure Management\", \"Food Safety and Sanitation\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Principles of Culinary\", \"Principles of Pastry and Baking\", \"Celebration and Designer Cakes\", \"Advanced Boulangerie\", \"Science of Baking\", \"Asian Patisserie and Desserts\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\"], \"ms\": [\"The Bachelor of Patisserie Arts at Taylor\'s University is a premier programme designed for aspiring pastry chefs and dessert artists. Students gain hands-on experience in well-equipped kitchens, guided by industry expert\", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Business of Hospitality, Food and Leisure Management\", \"Food Safety and Sanitation\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Principles of Culinary\", \"Principles of Pastry and Baking\", \"Celebration and Designer Cakes\", \"Advanced Boulangerie\", \"Science of Baking\", \"Asian Patisserie and Desserts\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Patisserie Arts programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Executive Pastry Chef\", \"Pastry Production Manager\", \"Food Service Manager\", \"Pastry Stylist\", \"Pastry Kitchen Consultant\", \"Pastry Chef\", \"Pastry Sous Chef\", \"Restaurant Owner\", \"Celebrity Chef\", \"F&B Consultant\", \"Business Entrepreneur\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Patisserie Arts programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Executive Pastry Chef\", \"Pastry Production Manager\", \"Food Service Manager\", \"Pastry Stylist\", \"Pastry Kitchen Consultant\", \"Pastry Chef\", \"Pastry Sous Chef\", \"Restaurant Owner\", \"Celebrity Chef\", \"F&B Consultant\", \"Business Entrepreneur\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 12 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 12 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"The Bachelor of Patisserie Arts (Honours) is designed specifically for individuals like you who are passionate about pastry and baking. This specialised degree programme focuses on equipping you with the necessary skills, techniques, and technological knowledge that are in high demand in today\'s industry. Seeing the high interest in this sought-after programme, applicants are advised to apply early, as each intake has a limited number of placements. Throughout your journey in this programme, you will have the opportunity to master various pastry and baking disciplines, from creating exquisite pastries and cakes to perfecting bread and dessert making. Our experienced faculty members, who are industry professionals themselves, will guide you in honing your craft and provide you with invaluable insights into the industry.\", \"ms\": \"The Bachelor of Patisserie Arts (Honours) is designed specifically for individuals like you who are passionate about pastry and baking. This specialised degree programme focuses on equipping you with the necessary skills, techniques, and technological knowledge that are in high demand in today\'s industry. Seeing the high interest in this sought-after programme, applicants are advised to apply early, as each intake has a limited number of placements. Throughout your journey in this programme, you will have the opportunity to master various pastry and baking disciplines, from creating exquisite pastries and cakes to perfecting bread and dessert making. Our experienced faculty members, who are industry professionals themselves, will guide you in honing your craft and provide you with invaluable insights into the industry.\", \"zh-CN\": \"西点艺术荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱烹饪学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"西点藝術榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱烹饪學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/bachelor-of-patisserie-arts.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/bachelor-of-patisserie-arts.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/bachelor-of-patisserie-arts.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/bachelor-of-patisserie-arts.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-tci-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject t