0%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Qualification Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Culinary Management. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits for entry with Pre-University / Foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Notes : 1. Candidates need to pass BM and History at SPM level. 2. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Requirements Taylor’s Foundation / Diploma programme Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation / Diploma programme with CGPA 2.00 Pass Diploma in Culinary Arts Pass Advanced Diploma in Patisseries and Gastronomic Cuisine Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs A Level Min. DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 50% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% MOHE Matriculation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 DKM/DKLM/DVM Pass with a minimum CGPA 2.50 subject to Senate approval of the relevant institutions; or Graduated with a minimum CGPA 2.00 with a minimum of two (2) years of work experience in the related field. Other Equivalent Qualification Pass Foundation/Diploma/ Higher Diploma/ Advanced Diploma from any other institution recognised by Malaysian Government with min.CGPA 2.00; or Application via APEL A is allowed; or Any other equiv. qualification recognized by the M\'sian Government. Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Through this degree programme, we produce professionals in the field of culinary management who can take their productive place as leaders in the global food and beverage industries, and being equipped with management an\", \"Primary Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Business of Hospitality, Food and Leisure Management\", \"Food Safety and Sanitation\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Principles of Culinary\", \"Principles of Pastry and Baking\", \"International Cuisine\", \"Restaurant Service and Productions\", \"Advanced Pastry and Baking\", \"Food Sociology\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"French – Basic\"], \"ms\": [\"Through this degree programme, we produce professionals in the field of culinary management who can take their productive place as leaders in the global food and beverage industries, and being equipped with management an\", \"Primary Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Business of Hospitality, Food and Leisure Management\", \"Food Safety and Sanitation\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Principles of Culinary\", \"Principles of Pastry and Baking\", \"International Cuisine\", \"Restaurant Service and Productions\", \"Advanced Pastry and Baking\", \"Food Sociology\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"French – Basic\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Culinary Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers:\", \"Executive Chef\", \"Food & Beverage Manager\", \"Food Production Manager\", \"Food Service Manager\", \"Food Stylist\", \"Kitchen Consultant\", \"Pastry Chef\", \"Sous Chef\", \"Restaurant Owner\", \"Celebrity Chef\"], \"ms\": [\"Upon completing this Bachelor of Culinary Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers:\", \"Executive Chef\", \"Food & Beverage Manager\", \"Food Production Manager\", \"Food Service Manager\", \"Food Stylist\", \"Kitchen Consultant\", \"Pastry Chef\", \"Sous Chef\", \"Restaurant Owner\", \"Celebrity Chef\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Licence Professionnelle Hôtellerie et Tourisme Dans le domaine des Sciences sociales Spécialité Ingénierie, Conception, Organisation des Systèmes Alimentaires Embark on a transformative journey in our Culinary Management degree programme. Designed to provide you with practical knowledge and skills in food service management and culinary arts, this programme prepares you for a rewarding career in the global food and beverage industry. For those who envision themselves orchestrating unforgettable dining experiences and leading the future of culinary innovation, our highly sought-after programme is your stepping stone. Our comprehensive curriculum focuses on culinary expertise, management proficiency, pastry skills, and business acumen, we empower you to thrive in this dynamic field. With limited batch sizes, apply your spot early to be among tomorrow\'s culinary innovators whose hands and hearts will shape how the world experiences food.\", \"ms\": \"Licence Professionnelle Hôtellerie et Tourisme Dans le domaine des Sciences sociales Spécialité Ingénierie, Conception, Organisation des Systèmes Alimentaires Embark on a transformative journey in our Culinary Management degree programme. Designed to provide you with practical knowledge and skills in food service management and culinary arts, this programme prepares you for a rewarding career in the global food and beverage industry. For those who envision themselves orchestrating unforgettable dining experiences and leading the future of culinary innovation, our highly sought-after programme is your stepping stone. Our comprehensive curriculum focuses on culinary expertise, management proficiency, pastry skills, and business acumen, we empower you to thrive in this dynamic field. With limited batch sizes, apply your spot early to be among tomorrow\'s culinary innovators whose hands and hearts will shape how the world experiences food.\", \"zh-CN\": \"烹饪管理荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱烹饪学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"烹饪管理榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱烹饪學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim i