GPA 2.00。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in the field or related fields with a minimum CGPA of 2.50, or its equivalent, as accepted by the HEP Senate; OR A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in the field or related fields or its equivalent but not meeting a CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to a minimum of five (5) years of working experience in a related field; OR Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module; OR Students without a related degree but with relevant working experience requires to fulfil the following conditions: a) CGPA above 2.50 must have at least one (1) year of relevant working experience; or b) CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Core Modules\", \"The Master in Food Studies and Gastronomy is a coursework programme inclusive of 9 modules, a research/dissertation project, and an internship.\", \"Food Studies and Gastronomy: Theories and Practices\", \"Research Methods for Food Studies\", \"Food Systems: Social Organisation and Design\", \"Gastronomy, Heritage and Tourism\", \"Modernisation of Food and Gastronomy\", \"Food Consumer Studies\", \"Data Collection and Analysis for Food Studies\", \"Food Cultures and Health\", \"Food Globalisation\", \"Global Immersion Field trip in Food & Cultures\", \"Dissertation\", \"Internship\"], \"ms\": [\"Core Modules\", \"The Master in Food Studies and Gastronomy is a coursework programme inclusive of 9 modules, a research/dissertation project, and an internship.\", \"Food Studies and Gastronomy: Theories and Practices\", \"Research Methods for Food Studies\", \"Food Systems: Social Organisation and Design\", \"Gastronomy, Heritage and Tourism\", \"Modernisation of Food and Gastronomy\", \"Food Consumer Studies\", \"Data Collection and Analysis for Food Studies\", \"Food Cultures and Health\", \"Food Globalisation\", \"Global Immersion Field trip in Food & Cultures\", \"Dissertation\", \"Internship\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：1 to 2-year (Full Time); 2 to 3-year (Part Time)。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：1 to 2-year (Full Time); 2 to 3-year (Part Time)。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Graduates are expected to venture in the academia, industry, government and non-governmental organisations, or major food industries at the local, regional or global level. Dependent on their initial background, when suc\", \"Food & Beverage business and market analysts\", \"Training and consultancy in food organisations\", \"Food & Beverage consultant and advisor\", \"Media, social, and cultural analysts\", \"Operation and management in the Food & Beverage industry\", \"Food and gastronomy researchers in think tanks, research centres\", \"Regulatory affairs officer, and quality assurance professionals\", \"Research Departments of governmental or non-governmental organisations\"], \"ms\": [\"Graduates are expected to venture in the academia, industry, government and non-governmental organisations, or major food industries at the local, regional or global level. Dependent on their initial background, when suc\", \"Food & Beverage business and market analysts\", \"Training and consultancy in food organisations\", \"Food & Beverage consultant and advisor\", \"Media, social, and cultural analysts\", \"Operation and management in the Food & Beverage industry\", \"Food and gastronomy researchers in think tanks, research centres\", \"Regulatory affairs officer, and quality assurance professionals\", \"Research Departments of governmental or non-governmental organisations\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Master in Food Studies and Gastronomy is a coursework programme inclusive of 9 modules, a research/dissertation project, and an internship.\", \"Research Methods for Food Studies\"], \"ms\": [\"The Master in Food Studies and Gastronomy is a coursework programme inclusive of 9 modules, a research/dissertation project, and an internship.\", \"Research Methods for Food Studies\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Offered in partnership with the University of Toulouse - Jean Jaures, School of Tourism, Hospitality Management and Food Studies (France), this Master of Food Studies and Gastronomy enables students from diverse backgrounds to incorporate the social and cultural aspects of food into their professional practices. This exciting and dynamic programme encompasses a wide range of disciplines, including humanities, social sciences, nutrition, public health, gastronomy, cultural heritage, tourism, food security, sustainability, and food safety. With our exceptional reputation, this programme consistently attracts applicants who are ready to redefine food systems, preserve cultural heritage, and pioneer sustainable policies that address humanity\'s most pressing nutritional challenges. This reflects not only the programme\'s academic excellence but also its unique ability to transform passionate food enthusiasts into influential professionals.\", \"ms\": \"Offered in partnership with the University of Toulouse - Jean Jaures, School of Tourism, Hospitality Management and Food Studies (France), this Master of Food Studies and Gastronomy enables students from diverse backgrounds to incorporate the social and cultural aspects of food into their professional practices. This exciting and dynamic programme encompasses a wide range of disciplines, including humanities, social sciences, nutrition, public health, gastronomy, cultural heritage, tourism, food security, sustainability, and food safety. With our exceptional reputation, this programme consistently attracts applicants who are ready to redefine food systems, preserve cultural heritage, and pioneer sustainable policies that address humanity\'s most pressing nutritional challenges. This reflects not only the programme\'s academic excellence but also its unique ability to transform passionate food enthusiasts into influential professionals.\", \"zh-CN\": \"食品研究与美食学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱烹饪学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"食品研究與美食學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱烹饪學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/master-coursework/master-of-food-studies-and-gastronomy.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/master-coursework/master-of-food-studies-and-gastronomy.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/master-coursework/master-of-food-studies-and-gastronomy.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/master-coursework/master-of-food-studies-and-gastronomy.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026