Philosophy (PhD) In Food Studies\", \"zh-CN\": \"食品研究哲学博士（PhD）\", \"zh-TW\": \"食品研究哲學博士（PhD）\"}','Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) In Food Studies','business','{\"en\": \"Taylor\'s Culinary Institute\", \"ms\": \"Taylor\'s Culinary Institute\", \"zh-CN\": \"泰莱烹饪学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"泰萊烹飪學院\"}','泰莱烹饪学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',17178,'USD','USD 14,315 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-tci-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6.5, \"toefl\": 79}','For international students: IELTS 6.5 / TOEFL 79 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score). The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Bachelor\'s degree candidates who are registered for master\'s degree programmes may apply to convert to the doctoral degree programmes subjected to the following conditions: Within 1 year for full time and within 2 years for part-time candidates; Having shown competency and capability in conducting research at doctoral level through rigorous internal evaluation. Approval of the Taylor’s University Senate. Notes Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. Any of the above conditions would require student\'s research proposal to be approved. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department. Entry Requirements (Prior Publication Mode) You will need to fulfil one of the below: Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP; In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation; An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field; A list of scholarly published work; For international candidates, evidence of English Language Proficiency as determined by the intake standards approved by the Senate A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications must be published within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications, the candidate must be the principal author with the contributions of others clearly defined. Note: All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','{\"gpa\": 3.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Entry Requirements (Normal Mode) Masters Masters degree in the field or related fields (Level 7, MQF) or its equivalent as accepted by the Taylor\'s University Senate; OR Bachelor\'s Degree Passed Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with min. CGPA 3.67 and passed related qualifying assessment.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience, proposal, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Food Cultures & Health\", \"Contemplate conflicts between social and medical norms as well social interactions in constructing individual and collective identities, especially in multi-ethnic societies. Impact the tailoring of public health message\", \"Gastronomy, Heritage & Tourism\", \"Analyse the processes of defining food heritages and their relations with the construction of collective identities. Provide insights that help institutions & NGOs with territorial development and population-led initiati\", \"Food Security & Sustainability\", \"Examine food security in conjunction with global environmental and health issues, as well as controversies surrounding food production, processing, distribution and consumption of food. Provide insights on the potential \", \"Food Safety, Fraud & Risk\", \"Analyse the perception of food risk, the design of collective risk management schemes, and the conditions for food policies development. Follow food concerns and relook into the guidelines on food fraud mitigation in Asi\", \"Candidates without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by Taylor’s University and meet the minimum CGPA based on above.\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Food Cultures & Health\", \"Contemplate conflicts between social and medical norms as well social interactions in constructing individual and collective identities, especially in multi-ethnic societies. Impact the tailoring of public health message\", \"Gastronomy, Heritage & Tourism\", \"Analyse the processes of defining food heritages and their relations with the construction of collective identities. Provide insights that help institutions & NGOs with territorial development and population-led initiati\", \"Food Security & Sustainability\", \"Examine food security in conjunction with global environmental and health issues, as well as controversies surrounding food production, processing, distribution and consumption of food. Provide insights on the potential \", \"Food Safety, Fraud & Risk\", \"Analyse the perception of food risk, the design of collective risk management schemes, and the conditions for food policies development. Follow food concerns and relook into the guidelines on food fraud mitigation in Asi\", \"Candidates without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by Taylor’s University and meet the minimum CGPA based on above.\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Food Studies programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Food Marketing\", \"Product Manager in Food Industries\", \"Management in Foodservice\", \"Consultant in Foodservice Planning & Design\", \"Business & Market Analyst for Food Industries\", \"Food Health & Nutritional Counselors\", \"Food Anthropologist\", \"Food Journalist\", \"Food Engineer\", \"Academician\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Food Studies programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Food Marketing\", \"Product Manager in Food Industries\", \"Management in Foodservice\", \"Consultant in Foodservice Planning & Design\", \"Business & Market Analyst for Food Industries\", \"Food Health & Nutritional Counselors\", \"Food Anthropologist\", \"Food Journalist\", \"Food Engineer\", \"Academician\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Taylor\'s Doctor of Philosophy programme is designed to equip both researchers and practitioners like you with the necessary tools to address critical issues encompassing the cultural, social, economic, and political dimensions of food. Due to its renowned interdisciplinary approach, this doctoral programme consistently attracts an exceptional pool of applicants, reflecting the programme\'s academic prestige. Best to apply early to become part of our passionate cohort of doctoral candidates. As a doctoral candidate in Food Studies, you will engage in cutting-edge research, pushing the boundaries of knowledge in this interdisciplinary field. You will delve into topics that shape our food systems, exploring their impact on society and the environment. Whether your aspirations lie in academia, industry, government, or non-governmental organisations at the local, regional, or global level, our programme prepares you to make a meaningful impact in your chosen career path.\", \"ms\": \"Taylor\'s Doctor of Philosophy programme is designed to equip both researchers and practitioners like you with the necessary tools to address critical issues encompassing the cultural, social, economic, and political dimensions of food. Due to its renowned interdisciplinary approach, this doctoral programme consistently attracts an exceptional pool of applicants, reflecting the programme\'s academic prestige. Best to apply early to become part of our passionate cohort of doctoral candidates. As a doctoral candidate in Food Studies, you will engage in cutting-edge research, pushing the boundaries of knowledge in this interdisciplinary field. You will delve into topics that shape our food systems, exploring their impact on society and the environment. Whether your aspirations lie in academia, industry, government, or non-governmental organisations at the local, regional, or global level, our programme prepares you to make a meaningful impact in your chosen career path.\", \"zh-CN\": \"食品研究哲学博士（PhD） 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由泰莱烹饪学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"食品研究哲學博士（PhD） 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由泰莱烹饪學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-food-studies.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-food-studies.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-food-studies.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/taylors-culinary-institute/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-food-studies.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/taylors-culinary-institute/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-tci-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee s