ng information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Mass Communication in Advertising and Brand Management. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites Pass SPM//O-level or equivalent with 5 credits including English for entry with pre-university / foundation qualification (Except for UEC). Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits including English for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : Candidates without a credit in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma / Matriculation programme contains subjects in English that are equivalent or higher to English at SPM level. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor\'s Foundation/ Diploma Programme Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Foundation in Arts (FIA) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Diploma in Communication (DICM) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including English (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in UEC English may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in English at SPM or equivalent) A Level Min. DD (2 subjects) AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 55% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Pass Foundation / Pre-University from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0; or Pass Diploma from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0 or Pass Diploma in Media and Communication or its equivalent; or (Pre-requisite of credit in English at SPM level or equivalent is not required) Pass Matriculation from an institution recognised by MOHE; or Any other equiv. qualification recognized by M\'sian Government. Application via APEL A is allowed. For the requirements please refer to the index page. Note : Candidates without a credit in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma / Matriculation programme contains subjects in English that are equivalent or higher to English at SPM level. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Through our Professional Media Workshop module, you will have the opportunity to actively engage with the industry. This module provides a platform for you to interact with professionals, gaining invaluable insights and \", \"To further enhance your practical experience, you will undertake a 10 -12 week internship with reputable advertising agencies, media agencies, and marketing communication consultancies.\", \"Our degree programme is fully compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which offers you the flexibility to mix and match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"New Media and Society\", \"Innovative Media\"], \"ms\": [\"Through our Professional Media Workshop module, you will have the opportunity to actively engage with the industry. This module provides a platform for you to interact with professionals, gaining invaluable insights and \", \"To further enhance your practical experience, you will undertake a 10 -12 week internship with reputable advertising agencies, media agencies, and marketing communication consultancies.\", \"Our degree programme is fully compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which offers you the flexibility to mix and match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"New Media and Society\", \"Innovative Media\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Advertising and Brand Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Integrated Marketing Communication Specialist\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Branding Specialist\", \"Brand Developer\", \"Social Media Specialist/Coordinator\", \"Customer Engagement Associate\", \"Copywriter\", \"Creative Director\", \"Production Designer\", \"Media Buyer/Planner\", \"Web Designer\", \"Traffic Manager\", \"Digital Content Creator\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Advertising and Brand Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Integrated Marketing Communication Specialist\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Branding Specialist\", \"Brand Developer\", \"Social Media Specialist/Coordinator\", \"Customer Engagement Associate\", \"Copywriter\", \"Creative Director\", \"Production Designer\", \"Media Buyer/Planner\", \"Web Designer\", \"Traffic Manager\", \"Digital Content Creator\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"For this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Advertising and Brand Management programme, you will delve into the world of advertising creative strategy and brand management, gaining the expertise required to meet the growing market demands. We understand the evolving complexities of the advertising landscape and are committed to empowering you to navigate and lead within it. With a focus on real-world solutions, this programme is designed to nurture your creativity, enhance your design capabilities, and foster strategic thinking. You will learn to develop innovative advertising campaigns that create maximum visibility for organisations and their brands. Through a hands-on approach, you will receive training on industry-relevant equipment and cutting-edge software, ensuring you are well-prepared for the dynamic advertising industry. Because of this comprehensive learning structure, this programme gains interest among applicants who are eager to shape the future of brand storytelling in the media landscape. Submit your application early to benefit from personalised mentorship and career guidance, maximising your potential in this field.\", \"ms\": \"For this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Advertising and Brand Management programme, you will delve into the world of advertising creative strategy and brand management, gaining the expertise required to meet the growing market demands. We understand the evolving complexities of the advertising landscape and are committed to empowering you to navigate and lead within it. With a focus on real-world solutions, this programme is designed to nurture your creativity, enhance your design capabilities, and foster strategic thinking. You will learn to develop innovative advertising campaigns that create maximum visibility for organisations and their brands. Through a hands-on approach, you will receive training on industry-relevant equipment and cutting-edge software, ensuring you are well-prepared for the dynamic advertising industry. Because of this comprehensive learning structure, this programme gains interest among applicants who are eager to shape the future of brand storytelling in the media landscape. Submit your application early to benefit from personalised mentorship and career guidance, maximising your potential in this field.\", \"zh-CN\": \"广告与品牌管理大众传播荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由媒体与传播学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"广告與品牌管理大众傳播榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由媒體與傳播學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicat