a, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',90077,'USD','USD 37,532 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-media-and-communication/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-media-and-communication-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS, TOEFL, MUET, UEC English Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2 - Grade C Pre-University/Diploma Complete Pre-University/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS 5.0 Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.0; ATAR 55; 55%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Mass Communication. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits including English for entry with pre-university / foundation qualification (Except for UEC). Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits including English for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : Candidates without a credit in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma / Matriculation programme contains subjects in English that are equivalent or higher to English at SPM level. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor\'s Foundation/ Diploma Programme Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Foundation in Arts (FIA) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Diploma in Communication (DICM) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including English (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in UEC English may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in English at SPM or equivalent) A Level Min. DD (2 subjects) AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 55% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Pass Foundation / Pre-University from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0; or Pass Diploma from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0 or Pass Diploma in Media and Communication or its equivalent; or (Pre-requisite of credit in English at SPM level or equivalent is not required) Pass Matriculation from an institution recognised by MOHE; or Any other equiv. qualification recognized by M\'sian Government. Application via APEL A is allowed. For the requirements please refer to the index page. Note : Candidates without a credit in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma / Matriculation programme contains subjects in English that are equivalent or higher to English at SPM level. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Strategising is a crucial aspect of communication, and our programme will equip you with the tools to develop effective communication plans. You will learn how to identify communication objectives, devise strategies, and\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"Innovative Media\", \"Media Writing\", \"Media Analytics\", \"Media Law & Ethics\", \"New Media and Society\", \"Research Methods\"], \"ms\": [\"Strategising is a crucial aspect of communication, and our programme will equip you with the tools to develop effective communication plans. You will learn how to identify communication objectives, devise strategies, and\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"Innovative Media\", \"Media Writing\", \"Media Analytics\", \"Media Law & Ethics\", \"New Media and Society\", \"Research Methods\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Consumer Advocate\", \"Corporate Affairs Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Foreign Affairs Officer\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Publicist\", \"Art Director\", \"Special Correspondent\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Consumer Advocate\", \"Corporate Affairs Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Foreign Affairs Officer\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Publicist\", \"Art Director\", \"Special Correspondent\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methods\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methods\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Throughout this Bachelor of Mass Communication programme, you will develop the core skills required for effective communication. You will learn the art of researching, honing your ability to gather and analyse information, while our focus on writing will sharpen your written communication skills, enabling you to craft compelling messages tailored to different audiences and platforms. This programme attracts an exceptional number of qualified applicants, creating a vibrant competitive environment where only the most dedicated secure a place. This interest stems from our track record of producing graduates who excel in the industry who showcase both technical expertise and creative vision. Students who join our community find themselves immersed in a collaborative atmosphere, where they work alongside equally passionate peers and industry experts who recognise the distinctive quality that sets our programme apart. It is best to apply early for a spot in your preferred intake.\", \"ms\": \"Throughout this Bachelor of Mass Communication programme, you will develop the core skills required for effective communication. You will learn the art of researching, honing your ability to gather and analyse information, while our focus on writing will sharpen your written communication skills, enabling you to craft compelling messages tailored to different audiences and platforms. This programme attracts an exceptional number of qualified applicants, creating a vibrant competitive environment where only the most dedicated secure a place. This interest stems from our track record of producing graduates who excel in the industry who showcase both technical expertise and creative vision. Students who join our community find themselves immersed in a collaborative atmosphere, where they work alongside equally passionate peers and industry experts who recognise the distinctive quality that sets our programme apart. It is best to apply early for a spot in your preferred intake.\", \"zh-CN\": \"大众传播荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由媒体与传播学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"大众傳播榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由媒體與傳播學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-media-and-communication/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-media-and-communication-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Depo