ation (DICM) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including English (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in UEC English may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in English at SPM or equivalent) A Level Min. DD (2 subjects) AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 55% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Pass Foundation / Pre-University from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0; or Pass Diploma from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0 or Pass Diploma in Media and Communication or its equivalent; or (Pre-requisite of credit in English at SPM level or equivalent is not required) Pass Matriculation from an institution recognised by MOHE; or Any other equiv. qualification recognised by M\'sian Government. Application via APEL A is allowed. Note : Candidates without a credit in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma / Matriculation programme contains subjects in English that are equivalent or higher to English at SPM level. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"You will experience active engagement with the industry through the module Professional Media Workshop. This module will provide you with opportunities to participate in talks, workshops, forums, and practical sessions c\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which allows you to mix and match study modules according to your preferences\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"Innovative Media\", \"Media Writing\", \"Media Analytics\"], \"ms\": [\"You will experience active engagement with the industry through the module Professional Media Workshop. This module will provide you with opportunities to participate in talks, workshops, forums, and practical sessions c\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which allows you to mix and match study modules according to your preferences\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"Innovative Media\", \"Media Writing\", \"Media Analytics\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Public Relations and Event Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Corporate Affairs Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Event Manager\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Fashion Event Coordinator\", \"Wedding Planner\", \"Public Relations Manager\", \"Publicist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Public Relations and Event Management programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Corporate Affairs Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Event Manager\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Fashion Event Coordinator\", \"Wedding Planner\", \"Public Relations Manager\", \"Publicist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Our Bachelor of Mass Communication in Public Relations and Event Management programme is designed to cultivate communication strategists who possess the skills and expertise to enhance an organisation\'s image and competitive edge through seamlessly integrated PR plans and captivating event campaigns. We believe in nurturing your ability to think critically, encouraging you to challenge viewpoints, explore creative ideas and concepts, and examine issues from a multitude of perspectives. Through internships, industry collaborations, and hands-on projects, you will develop the practical skills and industry insights necessary to thrive in the professional world. This distinguished programme fosters an intellectually stimulating community where only the most dedicated communication visionaries secure admission. This exceptional demand reflects our commitment to producing graduates who don\'t just participate in the industry — they transform it with fresh perspectives and innovative actions. Find us on\", \"ms\": \"Our Bachelor of Mass Communication in Public Relations and Event Management programme is designed to cultivate communication strategists who possess the skills and expertise to enhance an organisation\'s image and competitive edge through seamlessly integrated PR plans and captivating event campaigns. We believe in nurturing your ability to think critically, encouraging you to challenge viewpoints, explore creative ideas and concepts, and examine issues from a multitude of perspectives. Through internships, industry collaborations, and hands-on projects, you will develop the practical skills and industry insights necessary to thrive in the professional world. This distinguished programme fosters an intellectually stimulating community where only the most dedicated communication visionaries secure admission. This exceptional demand reflects our commitment to producing graduates who don\'t just participate in the industry — they transform it with fresh perspectives and innovative actions. Find us on\", \"zh-CN\": \"公共关系与活动管理大众传播荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由媒体与传播学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"公共关系與活动管理大众傳播榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由媒體與傳播學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication-in-public-relations-and-event-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication-in-public-relations-and-event-management.html','https://university.t