Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Public Relations and Marketing. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits including English for entry with pre-university / foundation qualification (Except for UEC). Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits including English for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : Candidates without a credit in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma / Matriculation programme contains subjects in English that are equivalent or higher to English at SPM level. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor\'s Foundation/ Diploma Programme Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Foundation in Arts (FIA) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Diploma in Communication (DICM) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including English (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in UEC English may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in English at SPM or equivalent) A Level Min. DD (2 subjects) AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 55% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Pass Foundation / Pre-University from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0; or Pass Diploma from any other institution recognised by MOHE with min CGPA 2.0 or Pass Diploma in Media and Communication or its equivalent; or (Pre-requisite of credit in English at SPM level or equivalent is not required) Pass Matriculation from an institution recognised by MOHE; or Any other equiv. qualification recognized by M\'sian Government. Application via APEL A is allowed. For the requirements please refer to the index page. Note : Candidates without a credit in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma / Matriculation programme contains subjects in English that are equivalent or higher to English at SPM level. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Throughout this programme, you will acquire the skills to adeptly conceptualise and strategise a corporate communication plan, facilitating the business development of an organisation. You will engage in problem analysis\", \"You will have the opportunity to experience active engagement with the industry through the module Professional Media Workshop. This module will provide you with opportunities to participate in talks, workshops, forums, \", \"You will develop a strategic approach to campaign planning—choosing the right communication tools, targeting the right audiences, and delivering a clear brand message for a product or service. You will learn how marketin\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which allows you to mix and match study modules according to your preferences.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"Innovative Media\"], \"ms\": [\"Throughout this programme, you will acquire the skills to adeptly conceptualise and strategise a corporate communication plan, facilitating the business development of an organisation. You will engage in problem analysis\", \"You will have the opportunity to experience active engagement with the industry through the module Professional Media Workshop. This module will provide you with opportunities to participate in talks, workshops, forums, \", \"You will develop a strategic approach to campaign planning—choosing the right communication tools, targeting the right audiences, and delivering a clear brand message for a product or service. You will learn how marketin\", \"This degree programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which allows you to mix and match study modules according to your preferences.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Introduction to Mass Communication\", \"Visual Communication\", \"Intercultural Communication\", \"Communication Theory\", \"Innovative Media\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Public relations and Marketing programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Brand Manager\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Corporate Affairs Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Foreign Affairs Officer\", \"Market Researcher\", \"Public Relations & Marketing Consultant\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Publicist\", \"Strategy Planning Manager\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mass Communication in Public relations and Marketing programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Brand Manager\", \"Campaign Director\", \"Corporate Affairs Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Foreign Affairs Officer\", \"Market Researcher\", \"Public Relations & Marketing Consultant\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Publicist\", \"Strategy Planning Manager\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Our Bachelor of Mass Communication (Honours) in Public Relations and Marketing prepares you to thrive in the evolving media industry by adopting a strategic and integrated approach to marketing communications. The programme emphasises the development of a clear and consistent marketing message across advertising, public relations, and digital platforms. Through real-world campaigns and PR events, you will learn how to shape compelling brand narratives, strengthen brand loyalty, and connect with potential customers using an integrated marketing communications framework. The curriculum builds strong capabilities in digital marketing, social media strategy, and data-driven communication planning, enabling you to design effective marketing efforts across multiple marketing channels. You will also refine your skills in planning, strategising, and executing impactful marketing campaigns that respond to the demands of today’s convergent and fast-paced media landscape. With a selectively curated cohort, the programme focuses on developing versatile communication professionals with an integrated skill set that is highly sought after in the contemporary media environment. Early application is recommended to secure your place and gain access to cutting-edge resources, as well as collaborative projects with leaders from the media and communications industry.\", \"ms\": \"Our Bachelor of Mass Communication (Honours) in Public Relations and Marketing prepares you to thrive in the evolving media industry by adopting a strategic and integrated approach to marketing communications. The programme emphasises the development of a clear and consistent marketing message across advertising, public relations, and digital platforms. Through real-world campaigns and PR events, you will learn how to shape compelling brand narratives, strengthen brand loyalty, and connect with potential customers using an integrated marketing communications framework. The curriculum builds strong capabilities in digital marketing, social media strategy, and data-driven communication planning, enabling you to design effective marketing efforts across multiple marketing channels. You will also refine your skills in planning, strategising, and executing impactful marketing campaigns that respond to the demands of today’s convergent and fast-paced media landscape. With a selectively curated cohort, the programme focuses on developing versatile communication professionals with an integrated skill set that is highly sought after in the contemporary media environment. Early application is recommended to secure your place and gain access to cutting-edge resources, as well as collaborative projects with leaders from the media and communications industry.\", \"zh-CN\": \"公共关系与市场营销大众传播荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由媒体与传播学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"公共关系與市场营销大众傳播榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由媒體與傳播學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication-in-public-relations-and-marketing.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication-in-public-relations-and-marketing.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication-in-public-relations-and-marketing.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mass-communication-in-public-relations-and-marketing.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-media-and-communication/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-media-and-communication-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/undergraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-B-024. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 37,532 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.185591','2026-06-21 01:09:06.185591',37532.00,'bachelor'),(7469,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-039-master-of-communication','TSU-MA-039','{\"en\": \"Master of Communi