ed fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department.','{\"gpa\": 2.5, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Master of Communication. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Pre-Requisites A Bachelor’s Degree (Level 6, MQF) in Media and Communication with a minimum CGPA of 2.50, as accepted by the HEP Senate; or A Bachelor’s Degree (Level 6, MQF) in Media and Communication with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 and not meeting a CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to rigorous internal assessment as determined by the HEP; or Any other Bachelor’s Degree (Level 6, MQF) (Non-Media and Communication) with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 can be accepted, subject to a rigorous internal assessment and prerequisite courses determined by the HEP; or Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Media and Communication or related fields recognised by the Government of Malaysia must undergo rigorous internal assessment (the requirement of CGPA is based on item i – ii) Application via APEL A is allowed. Notes: Rigorous assessments can be done through interviews, portfolios, written tests, video resumes or any form of assessment as stipulated by the HEP. For candidates from non-media graduate backgrounds, a rigorous assessment should include an English proficiency test requirement. Candidates who have not passed the rigorous internal assessment, the HEP can determine for the candidate to be re-assessed for entry to the programme by passing preparatory courses as determined by the HEP before entering the programme. This process is subject to the HEP Senate / Academic Board’s approval. The prerequisite courses should cover a minimum of 6 to 9 credits of the common knowledge area in Media and Communication such as theories, media and society, or fundamentals of communication, that are equivalent to a level 6 in the MQF. The prerequisite courses are to be offered outside the curriculum structure For International Student','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, portfolio, workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"design portfolio or practical experience portfolio when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"design portfolio or practical experience portfolio when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"专业要求公布时提交设计作品集或实践经验证明\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"專業要求公布时提交設計作品集或实践經验證明\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"This programme will provide you with a balanced integration of communication theory and practical applications. You will be challenged to develop a well-rounded and reflective approach to communication strategy and pract\", \"The curriculum includes practical input from industry professionals and in-depth analysis of case studies and key issues in the constantly changing media landscape. This combination of theory and practical application wi\", \"Core Modules\", \"Advanced Communication Theories\", \"Global Communication\", \"Integrated Marketing Communication\", \"Issues in New Media\", \"Organisational Communication\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Research Project 1\", \"Research Project 2 (Max of 15,000 words for both semesters)\", \"Elective Modules\", \"Media Management\", \"Political Communication\"], \"ms\": [\"This programme will provide you with a balanced integration of communication theory and practical applications. You will be challenged to develop a well-rounded and reflective approach to communication strategy and pract\", \"The curriculum includes practical input from industry professionals and in-depth analysis of case studies and key issues in the constantly changing media landscape. This combination of theory and practical application wi\", \"Core Modules\", \"Advanced Communication Theories\", \"Global Communication\", \"Integrated Marketing Communication\", \"Issues in New Media\", \"Organisational Communication\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Research Project 1\", \"Research Project 2 (Max of 15,000 words for both semesters)\", \"Elective Modules\", \"Media Management\", \"Political Communication\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：1.5-year (Full Time); 2-year (Part Time)。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：1.5-year (Full Time); 2-year (Part Time)。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Communication programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Account Manager\", \"Brand Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Creative Director\", \"Marketing Communication Director\", \"Media Specialist\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Sales and Promotion Manager\", \"Senior Media Planner\", \"Strategic Corporate Communication Director\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Communication programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Account Manager\", \"Brand Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Creative Director\", \"Marketing Communication Director\", \"Media Specialist\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Sales and Promotion Manager\", \"Senior Media Planner\", \"Strategic Corporate Communication Director\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Research Project 1\", \"Research Project 2 (Max of 15,000 words for both semesters)\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Research Project 1\", \"Research Project 2 (Max of 15,000 words for both semesters)\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our Master of Communication programme offers a comprehensive understanding of communication in the dynamic information age, equipping you with the skills to become a proficient communication expert. Students will gain a better grasp of communication theory and craft narratives that inspire action in navigating the increasingly complex information landscape with both ethical sensitivity and strategic precision. Throughout this programme, you will engage in a wide range of subjects and explore various aspects of communication. We delve into topics such as interpersonal communication, mass media, digital communication, strategic communication, and communication research methods. By gaining expertise in these areas, you will develop a strong foundation to tackle contemporary communication issues. The growing recognition of our quality curriculum has drawn ambitious, forward-thinking individuals to apply for their spot in our programme. Maximise your chances of joining our community of learners by submitting your application early.\", \"ms\": \"Our Master of Communication programme offers a comprehensive understanding of communication in the dynamic information age, equipping you with the skills to become a proficient communication expert. Students will gain a better grasp of communication theory and craft narratives that inspire action in navigating the increasingly complex information landscape with both ethical sensitivity and strategic precision. Throughout this programme, you will engage in a wide range of subjects and explore various aspects of communication. We delve into topics such as interpersonal communication, mass media, digital communication, strategic communication, and communication research methods. By gaining expertise in these areas, you will develop a strong foundation to tackle contemporary communication issues. The growing recognition of our quality curriculum has drawn ambitious, forward-thinking individuals to apply for their spot in our programme. Maximise your chances of joining our community of learners by submitting your application early.\", \"zh-CN\": \"传播学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由媒体与传播学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"傳播學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由媒體與傳播學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/master-coursework/master-of-communication.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/master-coursework/master-of-communication.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/master-coursework/master-of-communication.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/master-coursework/master-of-communication.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-media-and-communication/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-communication-usd.pdf\", 