al-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 16,904 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.191363','2026-06-21 01:09:06.191363',16904.00,'master'),(7470,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-040-doctor-of-philosophy-phd-in-media-and-communication-studies','TSU-PHD-040','{\"en\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Media and Communication Studies\", \"ms\": \"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Media and Communication Studies\", \"zh-CN\": \"媒体与传播研究哲学博士（PhD）\", \"zh-TW\": \"媒體與傳播研究哲學博士（PhD）\"}','Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Media and Communication Studies','arts','{\"en\": \"School of Media and Communication\", \"ms\": \"School of Media and Communication\", \"zh-CN\": \"媒体与传播学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"媒體與傳播學院\"}','媒体与传播学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',17178,'USD','USD 14,315 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-media-and-communication/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-media-and-communication-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6.5, \"toefl\": 79}','IELTS 6.5 / TOEFL 79 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Note: Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. Any of the condition of the above would require student\'s research proposal to be approved. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department. Prior Publication Mode Pre-requisite Candidates must obtain a master’s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate; or Other qualifications equivalent to a master’s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia; or Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP. In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications in alignment with the theme of the specialisation; An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field; and A list of scholarly published work. The minimum language proficiency of the candidates must be determined by the HEP consistent with applicable programme standards or based on the needs of the programme, i.e., learning outcomes and the medium of instruction. A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications or productions must be published or produced within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications or productions, the candidate must be the principal author or creator with the contributions of others clearly defined. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 3, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements We offered two entry pathway for this PhD programme, which is normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Pre-Requisites A Master’s Degree (Level 7, MQF) in Media and Communication with a minimum CGPA of 3.00 or equivalent, as accepted by the HEP Senate; or A Master’s Degree (Level 7, MQF) in Media and Communication with a minimum CGPA of 2.75 can be accepted. The candidates must undergo rigorous internal assessment as determined by the HEP; or A Master’s Degree (Level 7, MQF) in Media and Communication with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to a minimum of FIVE years of working experience in the related fields and rigorous internal assessment as determined by the HEP; or Any other Master’s Degree (Level 7, MQF) (Non-Media and Communication) with a minimum CGPA of 2.75 can be accepted subject to a minimum FIVE years of working experience in the field of Media and Communication or related fields. The candidates must undergo prerequisite courses and rigorous internal assessment as determined by the HEP; or Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s Degree (Level 7, MQF) in the field of Media and Communication or related fields recognised by the Government of Malaysia must undergo rigorous internal assessment as determined by the HEP (the requirement of CGPA is based on item i – iv) Note: Working experience can be cumulative industry engagement even before acquiring the required qualification for a particular level of study. However, it must be related to the level and content of the study. For International Student','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in media and communication, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provi\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours), which have English as the medium of instruction, in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in media and communication, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provi\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours), which have English as the medium of instruction, in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Interested to know more?\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 8 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 8 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Media and Communication Studies programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Account Manager\", \"Brand Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Creative Director\", \"Marketing Communication Director\", \"Media Specialist\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Sales and Promotion Manager\", \"Senior Media Planner\", \"Strategic Corporate Communication Director\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Media and Communication Studies programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Account Manager\", \"Brand Manager\", \"Corporate Communication Manager\", \"Creative Director\", \"Marketing Communication Director\", \"Media Specialist\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Sales and Promotion Manager\", \"Senior Media Planner\", \"Strategic Corporate Communication Director\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in media and communication, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provi\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours), which have English as the medium of instruction, in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in media and communication, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provi\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the Research Methodology modules (6 credit hours), which have English as the medium of instruction, in the first year of their candidature.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy in Media and Communication Studies programme is designed to enrich your proficiency in the communication industries. It prioritises cultivating your research capabilities and fostering a profound understanding of communication theories, methodologies, and practices within media studies. You will actively engage in rigorous research, contributing significantly to advancing knowledge and ethics in the communication field. Through industrial training, you will identify and tackle intricate challenges, conducting cutting-edge studies that have meaningful implications for the field. Throughout your journey, you will be encouraged to critically analyse and evaluate existing theories and practices while generating fresh perspectives and ideas, such as in the social media context. This process will not only refine your analytical skills but also equip you with the ability to inspire and influence others. As a doctoral candidate, you will emerge with the prowess to communicate critically, objectively, and creatively, essential qualities demanded by academia. With the programme\'s reputation for producing impactful scholars and thought leaders, only selective cohort of aspiring researchers gains admission. This creates an environment of intellectual rigour and collaborative innovation, where student\'s research will truly making a difference.\", \"ms\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy in Media and Communication Studies programme is designed to enrich your proficiency in the communication industries. It prioritises cultivating your research capabilities and fostering a profound understanding of communication theories, methodologies, and practices within media studies. You will actively engage in rigorous research, contributing significantly to advancing knowledge and ethics in the communication field. Through industrial training, you will identify and tackle intricate challenges, conducting cutting-edge studies that have meaningful implications for the field. Throughout your journey, you will be encouraged to critically analyse and evaluate existing theories and practices while generating fresh perspectives and ideas, such as in the social media context. This process will not only refine your analytical skills but also equip you with the ability to inspire and influence others. As a doctoral candidate, you will emerge with the prowess to communicate critically, objectively, and creatively, essential qualities demanded by academia. With the programme\'s reputation for producing impactful scholars and thought leaders, only selective cohort of aspiring researchers gains admission. This creates an environment of intellectual rigour and collaborative innovation, where student\'s research will truly making a difference.\", \"zh-CN\": \"媒体与传播研究哲学博士（PhD） 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由媒体与传播学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"媒體與傳播研究哲學博士（PhD） 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由媒體與傳播學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-media-and-communication-studies.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-media-and-communication-studies.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-media-and-communication-studies.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/media-and-communication/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-media-and-communication-studies.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-media-and-communication/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-media-and-communication-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-006. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 14,315 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.202833','2026-06-21 01:09:06.202833',14315.00,'phd'),(7471,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-041-bachelor-of-computer-science-honours','TSU-UG-041','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Computer Science (Honours)\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Computer Science (Honours)\", \"zh-CN\": \"计算机科学荣誉学士\", \"zh-TW\": \"計算機科學榮譽學士\"}','Bachelor of Computer Science (Honours)','it','{\"en\": \"School of Computer Science\", \"ms\": \"School of Computer Science\", \"zh-CN\": \"计算机科学学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"電腦科學學院\"}','计算机科学学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',85841,'USD','USD 35,767 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-computer-science/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-computer-science-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5.5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS MUET/IELTS/TOEFL/UEC English Pass English Taylor’s EET Overall Score 5.0 Taylor’s IEN Level 2- Grade C Pre-University/Diploma Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS 5.5 Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.0\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.0\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.0。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.0。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Computer Science. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM/O-Level with Pre-University/Foundation Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits (including Additional Mathematics) for entry with Pre-U/Foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM/O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits (including Additional Mathematics) for entry with Diploma qualification. Note: Candidates without a credit in Additional Mathematics at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the Foundation program contains subjects in mathematics that are equivalent to Additional Mathematics at SPM level. As for Bachelor of Software Engineering (Honours) and Bachelor of Computer Science (Honours), students without a credit in Additional Mathematics at SPM level OR without Mathematics at a higher level (Pre-U, STPM, A Level, Foundation) but have obtained a credit in Mathematics and a credit in one of the subjects in Science / Technology / Engineering at SPM level is required to take and pass the reinforcement Mathematics equivalent to Additional Mathematics at the SPM level. The subject must be offered in the first semester or before enrollment with unconditional offer. Reinforcement Mathematics can be offered as part of or outside the curriculum structure. If Reinforcement Mathematics is offered as part of the curriculum structure, it should count as an addition to the total number of credits required for graduation. Note : Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Candidates must pass Bahasa Malaysia and History in SPM Entry Pathway AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 A Level Pass with min. DD Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 50% in 6 subjects Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) A pass in STPM (Science Stream) or its equivalent with a minimum grade of C (CGPA 2.00) in Mathematics subject and ONE (1) Science / ICT subject. (Pre-requisite of Credit in Additional Mathematics at SPM level or equivalent is not required); OR Pass with Grade C in any 2 subjects Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with minimum 5Bs, including Mathematics or Advanced Mathematics or Adv. Mathematics 1 or 2 (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in UEC subjects above may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in Additional Mathematics at SPM or equivalent) Foundation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Diploma in Information Technology (DIT) Pass with min. CGPA 2.50 (candidates with CGPA below 2.50 but above 2.00 may be admitted subject to internal evaluation process) (Pre-requisite of Credit in Additional Mathematics at SPM level or equivalent is not required) International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Diploma in Computing (Level 4, MQF) or its equivalent with a minimum CGPA of 2.50. Candidates with a CGPA below 2.50 but more than 2.00 may be admitted subject to a thorough internal evaluation process. (Pre-requisite of Credit in Additional Mathematics at SPM level or equivalent is not required) Any Diploma in Science and Technology (Level 4, MQF) with a minimum CGPA of 2.75. Candidates with a CGPA below 2.75 but more than 2.50 can be admitted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment. Pass Matriculation programs recognised by the Ministry of Education Malaysia in the relevant field with a minimum CGPA of 2.00. Pass ANY Foundation with a minimum CGPA of 2.0 from other institutions recognised by the Malaysian Government. Diploma Kemahiran Malaysia (DKM) / Diploma Vokasional Malaysia (DVM) / Diploma Lanjutan Kemahiran Malaysia (DLKM) in Computing fields with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 subjected to HEP Senate / Academic Board’s approval. (The institution need to ','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"In the Bachelor of Computer Science (Honours) programme, you will have the flexibility to choose between three tracks for the third year. The first option is the Conventional track, which provides valuable industry exper\", \"Work-based learning (WBL)\", \", provides hands-on experience with industry partners for a full year, allowing you to apply theoretical knowledge in real-world settings and gain relevant practical skills.\", \"The third option is the\", \"Technopreneurship\", \"track, which emphasises the entrepreneurial aspects of computer science. In this track, you will learn about technology-driven innovation, startup management, and business strategies in the digital era. This option is id\", \"Our degree programme is fully compatible with the\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which offers you the flexibility to mix and match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"• Database Systems\", \"• Computer Architecture and Organisation\"], \"ms\": [\"In the Bachelor of Computer Science (Honours) programme, you will have the flexibility to choose between three tracks for the third year. The first option is the Conventional track, which provides valuable industry exper\", \"Work-based learning (WBL)\", \", provides hands-on experience with industry partners for a full year, allowing you to apply theoretical knowledge in real-world settings and gain relevant practical skills.\", \"The third option is the\", \"Technopreneurship\", \"track, which emphasises the entrepreneurial aspects of computer science. In this track, you will learn about technology-driven innovation, startup management, and business strategies in the digital era. This option is id\", \"Our degree programme is fully compatible with the\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \", which offers you the flexibility to mix and match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"• Database Systems\", \"• Computer Architecture and Organisation\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Future Careers for Computer Science\", \"When you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Computer Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Applications Developer\", \"Database Designer\", \"E-Business Consultant\", \"IT Consultant\", \"Network Engineer\", \"Programmer\", \"Software Developer\", \"Software Engineer\", \"Systems Analyst\", \"Systems Developer\", \"Technical Support Engineer\"], \"ms\": [\"Future Careers for Computer Science\", \"When you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Computer Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Applications Developer\", \"Database Designer\", \"E-Business Consultant\", \"IT Consultant\", \"Network Engineer\", \"Programmer\", \"Software Developer\", \"Software Engineer\", \"Systems Analyst\", \"Systems Developer\", \"Technical Support Engineer\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 13 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 13 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Our competitive Bachelor of Computer Science programme trains you in both the science and practical application of computing. Students are required to engage with a comprehensive curriculum that blends scientific principles with industry-focused practice, equipping you with skills that are highly valued by employers worldwide — from algorithms and AI to data structures and software engineering. This Bachelor of Computer Science degree programme at Taylor’s University is a dual award programme offered in collaboration with the University of the West of England (UWE). With limited seats available for each intake, the programme ensures personalised guidance as you master core concepts, develop innovative computing solutions, and tackle real-world technical challenges. This foundation for lifelong learning prepares you to adapt to emerging technologies and contribute meaningfully across diverse industries.\", \"ms\": \"Our competitive Bachelor of Computer Science programme trains you in both the science and practical application of computing. Students are required to engage with a comprehensive curriculum that blends scientific principles with industry-focused practice, equipping you with skills that are highly valued by employers worldwide — from algorithms and AI to data structures and software engineering. This Bachelor of Computer Science degree programme at Taylor’s University is a dual award programme offered in collaboration with the University of the West of England (UWE). With limited seats available for each intake, the programme ensures personalised guidance as you master core concepts, develop innovative computing solutions, and tackle real-world technical challenges. This foundation for lifelong learning prepares you to adapt to emerging technologies and contribute meaningfully across diverse industries.\", \"zh-CN\": \"计算机科学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由计算机科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"計算機科學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由計算機科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/undergraduate/bachelor-of-computer-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/undergraduate/bachelor-of-computer-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/undergraduate/bachelor-of-computer-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/undergraduate/bachelor-of-computer-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-computer-science/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-computer-science-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/undergraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-B-025. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-tot