e Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-computer-science/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-computer-science-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"November\"]','February, April, June, September and November','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": null}','International Students English Requirement: Achieve a minimum of Band 4 in MUET or equivalent to CEFR (Low B2). If Your Bachelor\'s Degree is from a Different Field Students without experience in Computing will have to complete and pass a Bridging module (ITS70102 Fundamentals of IT) before undertaking the core modules of the programme. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.5, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Applied Computing. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Fulfilling one of the requirements listed below: A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Computing or related fields with a minimum CGPA of 2.50, as accepted by the HEP Senate; OR A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Computing or related fields with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 and not meeting a CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment as determined by the HEP; OR Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Computing or related fields recognisedby the Government of Malaysia must fulfil the requirement on item 1 or 2. Application via APEL A is allowed. For the requirements please refer to the index page. A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Non-Computing field with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 can be accepted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment as determined by the HEP to identify the appropriate prerequisite courses that equivalent to their working experience in Computing or related fields; OR A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Non-Computing field with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 can be accepted subject to appropriate prerequisite courses.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The programme focuses on developing critical reasoning and technical writing skills as well as professional presentation skills which is excellent preparation for seeking careers in software-related computing fields.\", \"Core Modules\", \"Principles of Programming\", \"Big Data Management\", \"Principles of Artificial Intelligence\", \"Principles of Data Science\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Dissertation\", \"Capstone Project I and II\", \"Specialisations\", \"Artificial Intelligence Specialisation\", \"Image and Text Processing\", \"Robotic Automation Using AI Techniques\", \"Data Analytics and Machine Learning\"], \"ms\": [\"The programme focuses on developing critical reasoning and technical writing skills as well as professional presentation skills which is excellent preparation for seeking careers in software-related computing fields.\", \"Core Modules\", \"Principles of Programming\", \"Big Data Management\", \"Principles of Artificial Intelligence\", \"Principles of Data Science\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Dissertation\", \"Capstone Project I and II\", \"Specialisations\", \"Artificial Intelligence Specialisation\", \"Image and Text Processing\", \"Robotic Automation Using AI Techniques\", \"Data Analytics and Machine Learning\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：1-year (Full Time); 2-year (Part Time)。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：1-year (Full Time); 2-year (Part Time)。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master in Applied Computing programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Artificial Intelligence Specialisation\", \"AI Researcher\", \"Intelligence Specialist\", \"Consultant\", \"AI Data Analyst\", \"Machine Learning Programmer\", \"Machine Learning Engineer\", \"Robotics R&D Engineer\", \"Machine Vision Engineer\", \"Artificial Intelligence Analyst\", \"Deep Learning Scientist\", \"Cybersecurity Specialisation\", \"Security Analyst\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master in Applied Computing programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Artificial Intelligence Specialisation\", \"AI Researcher\", \"Intelligence Specialist\", \"Consultant\", \"AI Data Analyst\", \"Machine Learning Programmer\", \"Machine Learning Engineer\", \"Robotics R&D Engineer\", \"Machine Vision Engineer\", \"Artificial Intelligence Analyst\", \"Deep Learning Scientist\", \"Cybersecurity Specialisation\", \"Security Analyst\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Specialisations\", \"Artificial Intelligence Specialisation\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Specialisations\", \"Artificial Intelligence Specialisation\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our Master in Applied Computing programme is designed to foster innovation and nurture future technology leaders. We are committed to developing critical talent for the knowledge economy while strengthening academic-industry partnerships across disciplines. This prestigious programme prepares you to lead through specialisations in Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, and our newest track in Cybersecurity. Artificial Intelligence explores the complexities of machine learning, deep learning, and natural language processing. Data Science delves into big data analytics, statistical modelling, and data visualisation, while Cybersecurity equips students to design, defend, and respond to evolving digital threats across systems and networks. With only a select cohort admitted each intake, you\'ll benefit from close mentorship by experienced faculty, going on to drive innovation at research labs and tech firms.\", \"ms\": \"Our Master in Applied Computing programme is designed to foster innovation and nurture future technology leaders. We are committed to developing critical talent for the knowledge economy while strengthening academic-industry partnerships across disciplines. This prestigious programme prepares you to lead through specialisations in Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, and our newest track in Cybersecurity. Artificial Intelligence explores the complexities of machine learning, deep learning, and natural language processing. Data Science delves into big data analytics, statistical modelling, and data visualisation, while Cybersecurity equips students to design, defend, and respond to evolving digital threats across systems and networks. With only a select cohort admitted each intake, you\'ll benefit from close mentorship by experienced faculty, going on to drive innovation at research labs and tech firms.\", \"zh-CN\": \"应用计算硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由计算机科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"應用計算碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由計算機科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-coursework/master-in-applied-computing.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-coursework/master-in-applied-computing.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-coursework/master-in-applied-computing.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-coursework/master-in-applied-computing.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-computer-science/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-computer-science-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. No IELTS-only scalar published; use official equivalent English-route wording during review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-M-011. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-unpublished. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 16,393 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.229364','2026-06-21 01:09:06.229364',16393.00,'master'),(7475,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-045-master-of-computer-science','TSU-MA-045','{\"en\": \"Master of Computer Science\", \"ms\": \"Master of Computer Science\", \"zh-CN\": \"计算机科学硕士\", \"zh-TW\": \"計算機科學碩士\"}','Master of Computer Science','it','{\"en\": \"School of Computer Science\", \"ms\": \"School of Computer Science\", \"zh-CN\": \"计算机科学学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"電腦科學學院\"}','计算机科学学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',4.0,'2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)',24577,'USD','USD 13,654 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-research-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": null}','International Students English Requirement: Achieve a minimum of Band 4 in MUET or equivalent to CEFR (Mid B2). Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 3, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.00; CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Computer Science. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Fulfilling one of the requirements listed below: A Bachelor\'s Degree (Level 6 MQF) of computing or related to computing, with a minimum CGPA of 3.00; OR A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Computing or related fields with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 and not meeting a CGPA of 3.00 can be accepted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment as determined by the HEP; OR Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Computing or related fields recognised by the Government of Malaysia must fulfil the requirement on item 1 or 2. A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Non-Computing field with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment as determined by the HEP to identify the appropriate prerequisite courses that equivalent to their working experience in the Computing or related fields; OR A Bachelor’s degree (Level 6, MQF) in Non-Computing field with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to appropriate prerequisite courses;','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"At Taylor\'s Master of Computer Science (Research) programme, practical learning takes centre stage. With access to state-of-the-art facilities and cutting-edge technologies, you can seamlessly apply your theoretical know\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to 