programme empowers you to become a leader in innovation and technology. You\'ll gain the expertise to design and develop advanced computing solutions by applying the principles of software engineering to tackle complex industry and societal challenges, building scalable and secure digital systems. Delivered in English, the programme supports high-impact research in areas such as cybersecurity, data systems and big data, and ICT, all aligned with both national and global priorities. Throughout your studies, you will push boundaries in cybersecurity, data systems, or ICT, while contributing research that influences real-world practices. You will also collaborate closely with technology leaders through the University’s strong industry network, gaining direct exposure to contemporary challenges and emerging opportunities in the digital economy.\", \"zh-CN\": \"计算机科学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由计算机科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"計算機科學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由計算機科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-research/master-of-computer-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-research/master-of-computer-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-research/master-of-computer-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-research/master-of-computer-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", 