nager\", \"Data Innovation Manager\", \"Machine Learning Scientist\", \"Business Process Engineer\", \"Data Wrangler / Munger / Miner\", \"Business Intelligence Manager\", \"Analytics & Reporting Manager\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Specialisation 1\", \"Specialisation 2\", \"Specialisation 3\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Specialisation 1\", \"Specialisation 2\", \"Specialisation 3\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"In the Master in Applied Computing (MAC) programme, we believe in equipping our students with the knowledge, skills, and mindset needed to thrive in today\'s rapidly evolving technological landscape. As a student in the online MAC programme at Taylor’s University, ranked World’s Top 100 for Data Science & AI (QS Subject Rankings 2025), you’ll access the same world-class curriculum as our on-campus programme. Designed for working professionals, you’ll build in-demand skills flexibly, without pausing your career. Our experienced faculty members, experts in their fields, will guide you through engaging coursework and hands-on projects that reflect real-world challenges. Note: Taylor\'s 100% Online Postgraduate Programmes are strictly available for students from countries which endorse Online Learning.\", \"ms\": \"In the Master in Applied Computing (MAC) programme, we believe in equipping our students with the knowledge, skills, and mindset needed to thrive in today\'s rapidly evolving technological landscape. As a student in the online MAC programme at Taylor’s University, ranked World’s Top 100 for Data Science & AI (QS Subject Rankings 2025), you’ll access the same world-class curriculum as our on-campus programme. Designed for working professionals, you’ll build in-demand skills flexibly, without pausing your career. Our experienced faculty members, experts in their fields, will guide you through engaging coursework and hands-on projects that reflect real-world challenges. Note: Taylor\'s 100% Online Postgraduate Programmes are strictly available for students from countries which endorse Online Learning.\", \"zh-CN\": \"应用计算硕士（100% 在线） 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由计算机科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"應用計算碩士（100% 在線） 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由計算機科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-online/master-in-applied-computing-online.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-online/master-in-applied-computing-online.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-online/master-in-applied-computing-online.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/master-online/master-in-applied-computing-online.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-computer-science/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-computer-science-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Securit