admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": null}','International Students Achieve a minimum of Band 4 in MUET or equivalent to CEFR (Mid B2). Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation; An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field; A list of scholarly published work; For international candidates, evidence of English Language Proficiency as determined by the intake standards approved by the Senate A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications must be published within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications, the candidate must be the principal author with the contributions of others clearly defined. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 0, \"note\": {\"en\": \"Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in the field of Computing or related fields as accepted by the HEP Senate; Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-Computing fields with a minimum of FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields \", \"ms\": \"Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in the field of Computing or related fields as accepted by the HEP Senate; Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-Computing fields with a minimum of FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields \", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in the field of Computing or related fields as accepted by the HEP Senate; Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-Computing fields with a minimum of FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields 。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in the field of Computing or related fields as accepted by the HEP Senate; Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-Computing fields with a minimum of FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields 。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Entry Requirements We offer two entry pathways for this PhD programme, which are normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Pre-requisites: A Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in the field of Computing or related fields as accepted by the HEP Senate; OR A Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-Computing fields with a minimum of FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses as determined by the HEP; OR A Master’s degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-Computing fields with less than FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses as determined by the HEP and subject to rigorous internal assessment; OR Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree in the field of Computing or related fields recognised by the Government of Malaysia must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses as determined by the HEP.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in computer science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you \", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in computer science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you \", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 7 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 7 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Computer Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Applications Developer\", \"Database Designer\", \"E-Business Consultant\", \"Computer Communications Specialists\", \"Games Developer\", \"Games Graphic Designer\", \"Analyst Programmer\", \"Client / Server Specialist\", \"Information Technology Officer\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Computer Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Applications Developer\", \"Database Designer\", \"E-Business Consultant\", \"Computer Communications Specialists\", \"Games Developer\", \"Games Graphic Designer\", \"Analyst Programmer\", \"Client / Server Specialist\", \"Information Technology Officer\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in computer science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you \", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research areas\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in computer science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you \", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research areas\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Computer Science programme is designed to support and challenge graduate students who are passionate about computing to develop a deep understanding of algorithmic foundations and engage in rigorous scientific research. This PhD programme builds a strong foundation in core computer science principles, while enabling exploration of advanced topics such as algorithms, data structures, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and more. Through this, you’ll gain the expertise to address complex challenges and drive meaningful innovation in a rapidly evolving field. With strong academic mentorship and a research-focused environment, the programme is well-regarded among aspiring scholars and computing professionals. As a PhD student, you’ll have the opportunity to conduct original research and sharpen your expertise in computer science or information technology, preparing you to deliver impactful solutions across academia, industry, or applied research.\", \"ms\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Computer Science programme is designed to support and challenge graduate students who are passionate about computing to develop a deep understanding of algorithmic foundations and engage in rigorous scientific research. This PhD programme builds a strong foundation in core computer science principles, while enabling exploration of advanced topics such as algorithms, data structures, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and more. Through this, you’ll gain the expertise to address complex challenges and drive meaningful innovation in a rapidly evolving field. With strong academic mentorship and a research-focused environment, the programme is well-regarded among aspiring scholars and computing professionals. As a PhD student, you’ll have the opportunity to conduct original research and sharpen your expertise in computer science or information technology, preparing you to deliver impactful solutions across academia, industry, or applied research.\", \"zh-CN\": \"计算机科学哲学博士（PhD） 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由计算机科学学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"計算機科學哲學博士（PhD） 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由計算機科學學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-computer-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-computer-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-computer-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/computer-science/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-computer-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-computer-science/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-computer-science-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. No IELTS-only scalar published; use official equivalent English-route wording during review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-007. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-unpublished. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,589 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.264887','2026-06-21 01:09:06.264887',13589.00,'phd'),(7478,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-048-bachelor-of-interactive-spatial-design-honours','TSU-UG-048','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Interactive Spatial Design (Honours)\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Interactive Spatial Design (Honours)\", \"zh-CN\": \"互动空间设计荣誉学士\", \"zh-TW\": \"互动空间設計榮譽學士\"}','Bachelor of Interactive Spatial Design (Honours)','it','{\"en\": \"The Design School at Taylor\'s\", \"ms\": \"The Design School at Taylor\'s\", \"zh-CN\": \"泰莱设计学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"泰萊設計學院\"}','泰莱设计学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',82277,'USD','USD 34,282 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/the-design-school-at-taylors/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-design-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS MUET/IELTS/TOEFL/UEC English Pass English Taylor’s EET Overall Score 4.0 Taylor’s IEN Level 2- Grade C Pre-University/Diploma Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS Achieve a minimum score of Band 3 in MUET or equivalent to CEFR Low B2. Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 55%; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 55%; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 55%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 55%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Interactive Spatial Design. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM/O-Level with Pre-University/Foundation Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits for entry with Pre-U/Foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM/O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Visual Test Pass Visual Test (Taylor’s FID, DID and FNBE are exempted from the Entrance Test) Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway AUSMAT (SACEi) ATAR 55 A Level Min. grades CDD Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Average of 55% in 6 subjects Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) A Pass with UEC with Min. 5 Bs Taylor\'s Foundation / Diploma Pass FNBE with min. CGPA 2.00 Pass FID with min. CGPA 2.00 Pass Taylor\'s Diploma with min. CGPA 2.00 Other Taylor\'s Foundation with min CGPA 2.00 International Baccalaureate (IB) Min 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Foundation from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 Diploma from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 MoE Matriculation with min. CGPA 2.00 Any other qualification recognised by the Malaysian govt. Notes : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our curriculum is designed to nurture your creativity and enhance your digital proficiency. You will develop interdisciplinary skills and processes that are essential for the future of spatial design. Our experienced fac\", \"Programme Core\", \"This component consists of Primary Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Spatial Design I\", \"Spatial Design II\", \"Environment Design\", \"3D Modelling\", \"Application Design I\", \"Application Design II\", \"Games Studies\", \"Programming\", \"Embedded Systems\", \"Lighting Interactive Design\", \"Specialisation modules\"], \"ms\": [\"Our curriculum is designed to nurture your creativity and enhance your digital proficiency. You will develop interdisciplinary skills and processes that are essential for the future of spatial design. Our experienced fac\", \"Programme Core\", \"This component consists of Primary Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Spatial Design I\", \"Spatial Design II\", \"Environment Design\", \"3D Modelling\", \"Application Design I\", \"Application Design II\", \"Games Studies\", \"Programming\", \"Embedded Systems\", \"Lighting Interactive Design\", \"Specialisation modules\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文