 Baccalaureate (IB) Min 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Foundation from institution recognised by Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 Diploma from institution recognised by Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 MoE Matriculation with min. CGPA 2.00 A pass in DKM/DKLM/DVM in suitable fields with a min. CGPA of 2.50 subject to Senate approval (Note: The HEPs are to conduct screening and provide necessary guidance specific to the discipline of the programme); OR A pass in DKM / DLKM / DVM with a min. CGPA of 2.00 and at least have two (2) years working experience in a related discipline. The institution need to conduct a bridging program in the duration of the student following the programme to support the existing curriculum. The duration of the bridging program shall not exceed one (1) year or two (2) Semesters of study. Any other qualification recognised by Malaysian govt. Application via APEL A is allowed. Notes : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference lette