00; ATAR 55; 55%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 55%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Creative Media. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM/O-Level with Pre-University/Foundation Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits for entry with Pre-U/Foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM/O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Visual Test Pass Visual Test (Taylor’s FID, DID and FNBE are exempted from the Entrance Test) Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 A Level Min. CDD Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 55% in 6 subjects Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs Taylor’s Foundation in Design (FID) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Foundation in Natural and Built Environments (FNBE) Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Other Taylor\'s Foundation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor\'s Diploma Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Other Qualifications Foundation from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 Diploma from an institution recognised by the Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00 MoE Matriculation with min. CGPA 2.00 Any other qualification recognised by the Malaysian govt. Application via APEL A is allowed. Notes : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our curriculum is carefully designed to ensure that you gain a comprehensive understanding of design principles and methodologies. You will learn to apply critical thinking and problem-solving skills to tackle design cha\", \"We believe in a holistic approach to design education, which is why our programme is designed to be compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \". This framework allows you to personalise your learning experience by mixing and matching study modules that align with your interests and career goals.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Typography\", \"Illustration and Visual Narrative\", \"Digital Photography and Imaging\", \"Design Research Methodology\", \"Video and Sound Production\", \"Interactive Design\", \"Advanced Typography\"], \"ms\": [\"Our curriculum is carefully designed to ensure that you gain a comprehensive understanding of desi