didate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,654 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.288702','2026-06-21 01:09:06.288702',13654.00,'master'),(7482,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-052-doctor-of-philosophy-in-design-management','TSU-PHD-052','{\"en\": \"Doctor of Philosophy In Design Management\", \"ms\": \"Doctor of Philosophy In Design Management\", \"zh-CN\": \"设计管理哲学博士\", \"zh-TW\": \"設計管理哲學博士\"}','Doctor of Philosophy In Design Management','business','{\"en\": \"The Design School at Taylor\'s\", \"ms\": \"The Design School at Taylor\'s\", \"zh-CN\": \"泰莱设计学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"泰萊設計學院\"}','泰莱设计学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',16307,'USD','USD 13,589 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/the-design-school-at-taylors/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-design-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": null}','International Students Required to achieve a minimum Malaysian University English Test (MUET) with Band 4 OR its equivalent score of 6.5 in IELTS. (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination.\\ *Students without a qualification in the related field but with relevant working experience requires to fulfil the following conditions: a) CGPA above 2.50 must have at least one (1) year of relevant working experience; or b) CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment Bachelor to PhD Track A Bachelor\'s degree with the following conditions: A Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with first-class (CGPA of 3.67 or higher) or its equivalent from academic or Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) programme; Undergo internal assessment; AND Any other requirement of the HEP Note : Bachelor\'s degree candidates who are registered for master\'s degree programmes may apply to convert to the doctoral degree programmes subjected to the following conditions: Within 1 year for full time and within 2 years for part-time candidates; Having shown competency and capability in conducting research at doctoral level through rigorous internal evaluation, and approval of the Taylor\'s University Senate. Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. Any of the condition of the above would require student’s research proposal to be approved. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department. Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation; An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field; A list of scholarly published work; For international candidates, evidence of English Language Proficiency as determined by the intake standards approved by the Senate A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications must be published within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications, the candidate must be the principal author with the contributions of others clearly defined. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 0, \"note\": {\"en\": \"Master\'s Degree preferably in Art and Design or a relevant field Equivalent qualification and / or experience which is recognised by the Senate / institution Candidates are required to submit a research proposal\", \"ms\": \"Master\'s Degree preferably in Art and Design or a relevant field Equivalent qualification and / or experience which is recognised by the Senate / institution Candidates are required to submit a research proposal\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：Master\'s Degree preferably in Art and Design or a relevant field Equivalent qualification and / or experience which is recognised by the Senate / institution Candidates are required to submit a research proposal。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：Master\'s Degree preferably in Art and Design or a relevant field Equivalent qualification and / or experience which is recognised by the Senate / institution Candidates are required to submit a research proposal。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','We offered two entry pathway for this PhD programme, which is normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognize the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Pre-requisites: A Recognised Master\'s Degree preferably in Art and Design or a relevant field Equivalent qualification and / or experience which is recognised by the Senate / institution Candidates are required to submit a research proposal; and A Pass in an interview.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As you progress through the PhD in Design Management programme, you will have the opportunity to specialize in specific areas of design management that align with your research interests and career goals. Our flexible cu\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As you progress through the PhD in Design Management programme, you will have the opportunity to specialize in specific areas of design management that align with your research interests and career goals. Our flexible cu\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 7 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 7 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Design Management programme, you could advance to any of these exciting careers in design management and design innovation, including:\", \"Transdisciplinary Design Leadership Academicians\", \"Design Leadership\", \"Creative Director\", \"Design Historians\", \"Design Journalist\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Sales and Promotion Manager\", \"Senior Media Planner\", \"Strategic Corporate Communication Director\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Design Management programme, you could advance to any of these exciting careers in design management and design innovation, including:\", \"Transdisciplinary Design Leadership Academicians\", \"Design Leadership\", \"Creative Director\", \"Design Historians\", \"Design Journalist\", \"Public Relations Consultant\", \"Sales and Promotion Manager\", \"Senior Media Planner\", \"Strategic Corporate Communication Director\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As you progress through the PhD in Design Management programme, you will have the opportunity to specialize in specific areas of design management that align with your research interests and career goals. Our flexible cu\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research areas\", \"More than 300 postgraduat