 the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-education/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-education-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS, TOEFL, MUET, UEC English Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2 - Grade C Pre-University/Diploma Complete Pre-University/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS 5.0 Pre-University/Diploma Complete Pre-University/Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 60; 60%; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Education. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM//O-level or equivalent with 5 Credits for entry with pre-university/ foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : 1. Candidates need to pass BM and History at SPM level. 2. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation / Diploma programme Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation /Diploma programme with CGPA 2.00. Sijil Tinggi Pelajaran Malaysia (STPM) Min. GPA 2.00 in 2 subjects Unified Examination Certification (UEC) A Pass with Minimum 5Bs. A Level Pass with min. Grade C in 2 subjects. AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 60 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Average 60% in 6 subjects. International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 26 points in 6 subjects. Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50%. MOHE Matriculation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Other Equivalent Qualification Foundation/Pre U from other recognised institutions with CGPA 2.00; OR Ministry of Education Matriculation CGPA 2.00; OR Diploma from other recognised institutions with CGPA 2.00; OR Higher School Cert from New South Wales (Yr 12) min 60% OR Other equivalent qualifications recognised by the Malaysian Government Application via APEL A is allowed Notes : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, p