GPA 2.00\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Pre-Requisites A Bachelor’s degree in education field (Level 6, MQF) with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 or its equivalent as accepted by the HEP Senate; or A Bachelor’s degree in education field with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 can be accepted subject to rigorous internal assessment; or A Bachelor’s degree with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 must undergo prerequisite courses; or A Bachelor’s degree with a minimum CGPA of 2.00, can be accepted subject to rigorous internal assessment AND must undergo prerequisite courses; or Other relevant equivalent qualifications recognised by Malaysian government as equivalent to the above requirements. Application via APEL A is allowed. For International Student','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Primary Modules\", \"The programme is well grounded in theory, practice and functionality. The curricular experience will take students through three domains of knowledge. Master core subjects in the sciences of teaching and learning, pedago\", \"Philosophy and Schooling\", \"Learning and Assessment\", \"Seminar in Education\", \"Research Methods in Education\", \"Choose 4-5 electives\", \"Choose 2 modules from learning areas\", \"Research in Education I\", \"Research in Education II\", \"Choice of Electives\", \"Customise your learning experience by completing 10 credits from our diverse range of electives. Choose 4-5 modules below that best align with your interests and career goals\", \"Technology in Education\", \"Teaching 21st Century Learners\"], \"ms\": [\"Primary Modules\", \"The programme is well grounded in theory, practice and functionality. The curricular experience will take students through three domains of knowledge. Master core subjects in the sciences of teaching and learning, pedago\", \"Philosophy and Schooling\", \"Learning and Assessment\", \"Seminar in Education\", \"Research Methods in Education\", \"Choose 4-5 electives\", \"Choose 2 modules from learning areas\", \"Research in Education I\", \"Research in Education II\", \"Choice of Electives\", \"Customise your learning experience by completing 10 credits from our diverse range of electives. Choose 4-5 modules below that best align with your interests and career goals\", \"Technology in Education\", \"Teaching 21st Century Learners\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：1.5 to 5-year (Full Time)。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：1.5 to 5-year (Full Time)。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Teaching and Learning programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Community education officer\", \"Early years teacher\", \"Education administrator\", \"English as a foreign language teacher\", \"Further education teacher\", \"Learning mentor\", \"Special educational needs teacher\", \"Teaching assistant\", \"Careers adviser\", \"Counsellor\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Teaching and Learning programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Community education officer\", \"Early years teacher\", \"Education administrator\", \"English as a foreign language teacher\", \"Further education teacher\", \"Learning mentor\", \"Special educational needs teacher\", \"Teaching assistant\", \"Careers adviser\", \"Counsellor\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 11 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 11 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methods in Education\", \"Choose 2 modules fro