 and support your research, in a collaborative environment where your ideas can flourish.\", \"zh-CN\": \"教育学哲学博士 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由教育学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"教育學哲學博士 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由教育學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/education/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-education.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/education/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-education.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/education/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-education.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/education/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-education.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-phd-research-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured 