ion Systems\", \"Microprocessors and Computer Architecture\"], \"ms\": [\"Throughout the programme, you will delve into the intricacies of electrical and electronic engineering. You will gain a comprehensive understanding of key concepts, theories, and principles that form the backbone of the \", \"You will have the opportunity to work on sophisticated scientific and industrial technology projects, gaining first-hand experience in creating, designing, and implementing electrical and electronic systems.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Engineering Mathematics and Modelling I\", \"Engineering Design and Analysis\", \"Circuits and Signals\", \"Programming Techniques\", \"Electromagnetic Fields & Waves\", \"Engineering Mathematics and Modelling II\", \"Digital and Analogue Electronics\", \"Communication Systems\", \"Microprocessors and Computer Architecture\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：4-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：4-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Electrical and Electronic Engineering programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Appliances Engineer\", \"Communication Engineer\", \"Computer Engineer\", \"Construction Engineer\", \"Control Engineer\", \"Electrical and Electronics Engineer\", \"Instrumentation Engineer\", \"Mechatronic Engineer\", \"Medical Engineer\", \"Microelectronics Engineer\", \"Power Engineer\", \"Signal Processing Engineer\", \"Software Engineer\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Electrical and Electronic Engineering programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Appliances Engineer\