dation in Science with min CGPA of 2.00 including Mathematics and Physics / Chemistry International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects including Mathematics and Physics / Chemistry Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% including Physics A&B / Chemistry A&B and Mathematics A&B Other Qualifications Ministry of Education Matriculation in related field min. CGPA 2.00 including OR Foundation in the Field of Engineering with min. CGPA 2.00 OR Diploma in Engineering with min. CGPA2.00 from any institution recognised by the Malaysian Govt. Application via APEL A is allowed. For more information, visit here . Notes : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our curriculum places a strong emphasis on the practical application of knowledge. Through hands-on laboratory experiments and industry-relevant projects, you will gain valuable experience in applying theoretical concept\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Engineering Mathematics and Modelling I\", \"Engineering Design and Analysis\", \"Circuits and Signals\", \"Engineering Mathematics and Modelling II\", \"Programming Techniques\", \"Thermofluid Engineering 1\", \"Digital and Analog Electronics\", \"Engineering Design and Project Management\", \"Materials and Manufacturing\", \"Finite Element Method and Simulation\"], \"ms\": [\"Our curriculum places a strong emphasis on the practical application of knowledge. Through hands-on laboratory experiments and industry-relevant projects, you will gain valuable experience in applying theoretical concept\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Engineering Mathematics and Modelling I\", \"Engineering Design and Analysis\", \"Circuits and Signals\", \"Engineering Mathematics and Modelling II\", \"Programming Techniques\", \"Thermofluid Engineering 1\", \"Digital and Analog Electronics\", \"Engineering Design and Project Management\", \"Materials and Manufacturing\", \"Finite Element Method and Simulation\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：4-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：4-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mechatronics Engineering programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Automation Engineer\", \"Automation Systems Designer\", \"Control System Engineer\", \"Design Engineer\", \"Electronics Engineer\", \"Engineering Academician/Researcher\", \"Manufacturing Engineer\", \"Mechanical Engineer\", \"Mechatronic Engineer\", \"Mechatronics System Designer\", \"Product Engineer\", \"Product Designer\", \"Production Engineer\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Mechatronics Engineering programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Automation Engineer\", \"Automation Systems Designer\", \"Control System Engineer\", \"Design Engineer\", \"Electronics Engineer\", \"Engineering Academician/Researcher\", \"Manufacturing Engineer\", \"Mechanical Engineer\", \"Mechatronic Engineer\", \"Mechatronics System Designer\", \"Product Engineer\", \"Product Designer\", \"Production Engineer\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Throughout this programme, you will explore the design, development, and control of smart systems and devices that combine mechanical, electronic, and software components. The curriculum is carefully crafted to cover a wide range of topics, including robotics, automation, sensors and actuators, embedded systems, and control engineering. You will learn how to design and implement intelligent systems, working with cutting-edge technologies that shape the future of industries such as manufacturing, automotive, healthcare, and aerospace. One of the key features of our programme is the emphasis on hands-on learning and industry engagement. You will have the opportunity to participate in practical projects, internships, and collaborative research, allowing you to apply your theoretical knowledge to real-world challenges. This approach ensures that you graduate with the technical expertise and problem-solving skills required to excel in the evolving field of mechatronics. As we welcome applicants from all over the world, we are thrilled to see many students recognising the exceptional quality and opportunities our programme offers, and their drive to be selected in a competitive admissions process.\", \"ms\": \"Throughout this programme, you will explore the design, development, and control of smart systems and devices that combine mechanical, electronic, and software components. The curriculum is carefully crafted to cover a wide range of topics, including robotics, automation, sensors and actuators, embedded systems, and control engineering. You will learn how to design and implement intelligent systems, working with cutting-edge technologies that shape the future of industries such as manufacturing, automotive, healthcare, and aerospace. One of the key features of our programme is the emphasis on hands-on learning and industry engagement. You will have the opportunity to participate in practical projects, internships, and collaborative research, allowing you to apply your theoretical knowledge to real-world challenges. This approach ensures that you graduate with the technical expertise and problem-solving skills required to excel in the evolving field of mechatronics. As we welcome applicants from all over the world, we are thrilled to see many students recognising the exceptional quality and opportunities our programme offers, and their drive to be selected in a competitive admissions process.\", \"zh-CN\": \"机电工程荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由工程学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"機电工程榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由工程學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mechatronics-engineering.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mechatronics-engineering.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/undergraduate/bachelor-of-mechatronics-engineering.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/st