nce and Technology or related to computing, with CGPA below 2.75 but above 2.50, can be accepted subject to rigorous internal assessment process, OR Bachelor\'s Degree (Tier 3) Bachelor\'s Degree (Level 6 MQF) of computing or in the area of Science and Technology or related to computing, with CGPA less than 2.50 but above 2.00, with a minimum of 5 years working experience in a relevant field may be accepted. Other equivalent qualification Any other equivalent qualification recognized by Malaysian government or accepted by the Taylor\'s University Senate. AND Any of condition of the above would require student\'s research proposal to be approved.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our MSc in Engineering attracts highly motivated individuals from diverse backgrounds who are drawn by the programme’s strong reputation for academic excellence, innovation, and practical impact. Successful applicants ga\", \"Through a thoughtfully designed curriculum, you will develop advanced competencies in project management, collaborative research, and technical communication. These skills prepare you not only to excel in your chosen are\", \"The Master of Science in Engineering blends advanced theoretical knowledge with hands-on application, allowing you to tailor your studies to align with your professional interests and career ambitions.\", \"Programme Highlights:\", \"Theoretical Knowledge:\", \"Deepen your understanding of advanced engineering concepts and research methodologies.\", \"Laboratory Work:\", \"Apply theoretical insights through hands-on experiments in industry-standard facilities.\", \"Independent Research:\", \"Conduct a thesis project under the guidance of expert academic supervisors.\", \"Industry Placements:\", \"Gain real-world exposure through collaborations, internships, and applied projects.\", \"By integrating rigorous research with experiential learning, the programme challenges you to push boundaries, explore innovative solutions, and make meaningful contributions to solving real-world engineering challenges —\", \"Research Methodology\"], \"ms\": [\"Our MSc in Engineering attracts highly motivated individuals from diverse backgrounds who are drawn by the programme’s strong reputation for academic excellence, innovation, and practical impact. Successful applicants ga\", \"Through a thoughtfully designed curriculum, you will develop advanced competencies in project management, collaborative research, and technical communication. These skills prepare you not only to excel in your chosen are\", \"The Master of Science in Engineering blends advanced theoretical knowledge with hands-on application, allowing you to tailor your studies to align with your professional interests and career ambitions.\", \"Programme Highlights:\", \"Theoretical Knowledge:\", \"Deepen your understanding of advanced engineering concepts and research methodologies.\", \"Laboratory Work:\", \"Apply theoretical insights through hands-on experiments in industry-standard facilities.\", \"Independent Research:\", \"Conduct a thesis project under the guidance of expert academic supervisors.\", \"Industry Placements:\", \"Gain real-world exposure through collaborations, internships, and applied projects.\", \"By integrating rigorous research with experiential learning, the programme challenges you to push boundaries, explore innovative solutions, and make meaningful contributions to solving real-world engineering challenges —\", \"Research Methodology\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：