 to solving real-world engineering challenges —\", \"Research Methodology\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Through advanced study, you will build critical thinking, analytical reasoning, and problem-solving capabilities that are essential in today’s complex engineering landscape. With a strong emphasis on research and applied practice, you will learn to address real-world engineering challenges and develop innovative solutions that contribute meaningfully to society, industry, and academia.\", \"ms\": \"Through advanced study, you will build critical thinking, analytical reasoning, and problem-solving capabilities that are essential in today’s complex engineering landscape. With a strong emphasis on research and applied practice, you will learn to address real-world engineering challenges and develop innovative solutions that contribute meaningfully to society, industry, and academia.\", \"zh-CN\": \"工程学理学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由工程学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"工程學理學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由工程學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/master-research/master-of-science-in-engineering.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/master-research/master-of-science-in-engineering.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/master-research/master-of-science-in-engineering.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/master-research/master-of-science-in-engineering.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \