 and research accomplishments, will guide and mentor you as you navigate the research process. We recommend that you register your interest for a spot early to have a higher chance of securing your place.\", \"ms\": \"Our Doctor of Philosophy in Engineering programme is designed to provide students with an expanded mental capacity, enabling them to engage in advanced research within their chosen field and contribute to the generation of new knowledge. We aim to cultivate independent researchers who can push the boundaries of knowledge in a global context. We are delighted by the strong applications we receive from aspiring students, who recognise the value of our programme and are eager to earn a place in their preferred intake. Throughout the programme, you will develop the necessary skills and expertise to conduct thorough and independent research. By engaging in cutting-edge research projects, you will have the opportunity to make significant contributions to your field of study. Our faculty, renowned for their expertise and research accomplishments, will guide and mentor you as you navigate the research process. We recommend that you register your interest for a spot early to have a higher chance of securing your place.\", \"zh-CN\": \"工程学哲学博士 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由工程学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"工程學哲學博士 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由工程學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-engineering.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-engineering.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/engineering/phd-researc