nly.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS, TOEFL, MUET, UEC English Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2 - Grade C Pre-U/Diploma Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS 5.0 Pre-U/Diploma Completed Pre-U/Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 50%; IB 24 points\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 50%; IB 24 points\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 50%; IB 24 points。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; ATAR 55; 50%; IB 24 points。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of International Tourism Management (Honours). To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM//O-level or equivalent with 5 credits for entry with pre-university / foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM/O-level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Notes : 1. Candidates need to pass BM and History at SPM level. 2. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Requirements Taylor’s Foundation / Diploma Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation / Diploma Programme Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs A Level Min. DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 55 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 50% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% MOHE Matriculation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Other Equivalent Qualification Pass Foundation from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government with min. CGPA 2.00. Pass Diploma from other institution recognised by Malaysian Government with min CGPA 2.00. Any other equivalent qualification recognised by the Malaysian Government. Application via APEL A is allowed. For the requirements please refer to the index page. Note : *All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a full-scale bachelor of tourism curriculum, this programme covers topics such as tourism marketing, destination management, sustainable development, event management, and cultural studies—ensuring a 360° understandin\", \"The programme is highly recognised by the industry and was awarded the Business Events (BE) Education Excellence Award and accredited as an International Centre of Excellence in Event Management.\", \"This degree is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Business of Hospitality, Food and Leisure Management\", \"Leisure Attraction Management\", \"Destination Geography and Analysis\", \"Strategic Destination Marketing and Branding\", \"Tourism Economics\", \"Tourism Business Management\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Airline and Airport Management\"], \"ms\": [\"As a full-scale bachelor of tourism curriculum, this programme covers topics such as tourism marketing, destination management, sustainable development, event management, and cultural studies—ensuring a 360° understandin\", \"The programme is highly recognised by the industry and was awarded the Business Events (BE) Education Excellence Award and accredited as an International Centre of Excellence in Event Management.\", \"This degree is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Business of Hospitality, Food and Leisure Management\", \"Leisure Attraction Management\", \"Destination Geography and Analysis\", \"Strategic Destination Marketing and Branding\", \"Tourism Economics\", \"Tourism Business Management\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Airline and Airport Management\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this degree programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Destination Brand Manager\", \"Destination Development Specialist\", \"Incentive Specialist\", \"Recreation Entrepreneur\", \"Sports & Recreation Manager\", \"Tour Manager\", \"Tourism Office\", \"Tour Planner\", \"Tourism Bureau Manager\", \"Tour Company Manager\", \"Travel Consultant\", \"Travel Journalist\", \"Travel Retail Manager\"], \"ms\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this degree programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Destination Brand Manager\", \"Destination Development Specialist\", \"Incentive Specialist\", \"Recreation Entrepreneur\", \"Sports & Recreation Manager\", \"Tour Manager\", \"Tourism Office\", \"Tour Planner\", \"Tourism Bureau Manager\", \"Tour Company Manager\", \"Travel Consultant\", \"Travel Journalist\", \"Travel Retail Manager\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a full-scale bachelor of tourism curriculum, this programme covers topics such as tourism marketing, destination management, sustainable development, event management, and cultural studies—ensuring a 360° understandin\"], \"ms\": [\"As a full-scale bachelor of tourism curriculum, this programme covers topics such as tourism marketing, destination management, sustainable development, event management, and cultural studies—ensuring a 360° understandin\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Through this programme, you will gain the knowledge and practical skills needed to contribute meaningfully to the growth and transformation of the tourism sector. You will also develop forward-thinking capabilities in planning and decision-making, enabling you to respond effectively to global trends and challenges in tourism and hospitality. As this highly sought-after programme offers a unique opportunity to shape the future of travel and the broader hospitality industry, early application is encouraged to secure your spot in our competitive intake.\", \"ms\": \"Through this programme, you will gain the knowledge and practical skills needed to contribute meaningfully to the growth and transformation of the tourism sector. You will also develop forward-thinking capabilities in planning and decision-making, enabling you to respond effectively to global trends and challenges in tourism and hospitality. As this highly sought-after programme offers a unique opportunity to shape the future of travel and the broader hospitality industry, early application is encouraged to secure your spot in our competitive intake.\", \"zh-CN\": \"国际旅游管理荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由酒店、旅游与活动学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"國際旅遊管理榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由酒店、旅遊與活动學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/undergraduate/bachelor-of-international-tourism-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/undergraduate/bachelor-of-international-tourism-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/undergraduate/bachelor-of-international-tourism-management.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/undergraduate/bachelor-of-international-tourism-management.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \