f 5 years related working experience; OR Postgraduate Diploma Postgraduate Diploma Level 7 in same field recognised by Malaysian Government; OR Other equivalent qualification Any other equivalent qualification recognised by the Malaysian Government Application via APEL A is allowed. *Students without a qualification in the related field but with relevant working experience requires to fulfil the following conditions: a) CGPA above 2.50 must have at least one (1) year of relevant working experience; or b) CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The Master of Global Hospitality Management programme is committed to providing you with a comprehensive understanding of the hospitality industry, while equipping you with the latest management tools and techniques. Our\", \"Taylor\'s 100% Online Postgraduate Programmes offer busy learners with multiple commitments or international learners the life-changing and career-building opportunity to pursue a Master’s or Postgraduate Certificate qual\", \"Quality Management\", \"Strategic Marketing\", \"Sustainable Development in Hospitality and Tourism\", \"Strategic Decision Making in the Hospitality Industry\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Dissertation Project\", \"Hospitality Application Simulation Management\", \"Hospitality Asset Management and Financial Planning\", \"Hospitality Project Management\", \"Elective 1\", \"Choice of Electives\", \"Choose 1 from the list:\"], \"ms\": [\"The Master of Global Hospitality Management programme is committed to providing you with a comprehensive understanding of the hospitality industry, while equipping you with the latest management tools and techniques. Our\", \"Taylor\'s 100% Online Postgraduate Programmes offer busy learners with multiple commitments or international learners the life-changing and career-building opportunity to pursue a Master’s or Postgraduate Certificate qual\", \"Quality Management\", \"Strategic Marketing\", \"Sustainable Development in Hospitality and Tourism\", \"Strategic Decision Making in the Hospitality Industry\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Dissertation Project\", \"Hospitality Application Simulation Management\", \"Hospitality Asset Management and Financial Planning\", \"Hospitality Project Management\", \"Elective 1\", \"Choice of Electives\", \"Choose 1 from the list:\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：online；官方学制：2-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：online；官方學制：2-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Online Master of Global Hospitality Management (100% Online) programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Hotel Management (hotel, resorts, F&B, spa and wellness centres)\", \"Event & Conference Industry (concerts, festivals, MICE, weddings)\", \"Tourism Organisations\", \"Integrated Resort Industry (hotel, restaurants, casinos, events)\", \"Amusement & Theme Parks\", \"Airline Industry\", \"Cruise Industry (accommodation, entertainment, leisure)\", \"Celebrity Chef\", \"Hospitality Consulting\", \"Business Owner\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Online Master of Global Hospitality Management (100% Online) programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Hotel Management (hotel, resorts, F&B, spa and wellness centres)\", \"Event & Conference Industry (concerts, festivals, MICE, weddings)\", \"Tourism Organisations\", \"Integrated Resort Industry (hotel, restaurants, casinos, events)\", \"Amusement & Theme Parks\", \"Airline Industry\", \"Cruise Industry (accommodation, e