 cutting-edge techniques necessary to excel in management careers within the hospitality sector.\", \"ms\": \"This academically rigorous programme combines the best of academic knowledge and industry relevance, providing you with a comprehensive understanding of the intricacies of hospitality management. With a strong focus on practical skills and industry orientation, the programme equips you with the sophisticated tools and cutting-edge techniques necessary to excel in management careers within the hospitality sector.\", \"zh-CN\": \"国际酒店管理硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由酒店、旅游与活动学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"國際酒店管理碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由酒店、旅遊與活动學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/master-coursework/master-of-international-hospitality-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/master-coursework/master-of-international-hospitality-management.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/master-coursework/master-of-international-hospitality-management.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/master-coursework/master-of-international-hospitality-management.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-o