R Bachelor\'s Degree (Tier 3) Bachelor\'s degree in the field or related fields with a CGPA above 2.00 but below 2.50, recognised by the Malaysian or National Government, AND a minimum of 5 years related working experience; Other equivalent qualification Any other equivalent qualification recognized by Malaysian government or accepted by the Taylor\'s University Senate AND Any of condition of the above would require student\'s research proposal to be approved.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the following modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature:\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Click here to learn more about our\", \"research area\", \"Consumer Behavior\", \"Destination Development\", \"Destination Benchmarking\", \"Environmental Management\", \"Ecotourism Rating and Certification\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the following modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature:\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Click here to learn more about our\", \"research area\", \"Consumer Behavior\", \"Destination Development\", \"Destination Benchmarking\", \"Environmental Management\", \"Ecotourism Rating and Certification\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science in Tourism programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Managers (hotel, airlines, resorts, F&B, spa and wellness centres)\", \"Organisers & Planners (concerts, festivals, MICE, weddings)\", \"Cruise Industry (accommodation, entertainment, and leisure)\", \"Hospitality Consultant\", \"Business Owner\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science in Tourism programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Managers (hotel, airlines, resorts, F&B, spa and wellness centres)\", \"Organisers & Planners (concerts, festivals, MICE, weddings)\", \"Cruise Industry (accommodation, entertainment, and leisure)\", \"Hospitality Consultant\", \"Business Owner\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 6 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 6 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research area\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research area\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"This is a programme for curious, committed minds. Students come with different goals, some aiming to teach or pursue doctoral research, others seeking to become specialists who influence industry practice or policy. What they share is a desire to ask better questions about tourism, understand its complexities, and produce work that stands up to academic and professional scrutiny. Throughout the programme, you will engage with tourism from multiple perspectives, combining theoretical grounding with practical relevance. You will explore how tourism operates across social, economic, cultural, and environmental contexts, while also examining current trends and emerging challenges shaping the field. Coursework builds a strong conceptual foundation, while the research component allows you to investigate a topic that matters to you in depth, developing analytical, critical, and research skills that are transferable well beyond graduation. By the end of the programme, you will not only understand tourism more deeply, but also be equipped to contribute new knowledge, challenge assumptions, and participate thoughtfully in shaping how tourism evolves in an increasingly complex world.\", \"ms\": \"This is a programme for curious, committed minds. Students come with different goals, some aiming to teach or pursue doctoral research, others seeking to become specialists who influence industry practice or policy. What they share is a desire to ask better questions about tourism, understand its complexities, and produce work that stands up to academic and professional scrutiny. Throughout the programme, you will engage with tourism from multiple perspectives, combining theoretical grounding with practical relevance. You will explore how tourism operates across social, economic, cultural, and environmental contexts, while also examining current trends and emerging challenges shaping the field. Coursework builds a strong conceptual foundation, while the research component allows you to investigate a topic that matters to you in depth, developing analytical, critical, and research skills that are transferable well beyond graduation. By the end of the programme, you will not only understand tourism more deeply, but also be equipped to contribute new knowledge, challenge assumptions, and participate thoughtfully in shaping how tourism evolves in an increasingly complex world.\", \"zh-CN\": \"旅游学理学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由酒店、旅游与活动学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"旅遊學理學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由酒店、旅遊與活动學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/master-research/master-of-science-in-tourism.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitali