 semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-hospitality-tourism-and-events/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-hospitality-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6.5, \"toefl\": 79}','English Requirement for international students : IELTS 6.5 / TOEFL 79 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. *Students without a qualification in the related field but with relevant working experience requires to fulfil the following conditions: a) CGPA above 2.50 must have at least one (1) year of relevant working experience; or b) CGPA 2.00 to 2.50 must have at least five (5) years of relevant working experience; In addition, students will need to undergo a rigorous internal assessment Accelerated PhD Bachelor’s degree candidates who are registered for master’s degree programmes may apply to convert to the doctoral degree programmes subjected to the following conditions: Within 1 year for full time and within 2 years for part-time candidates. Having shown competency and capability in conducting research at doctoral level through rigorous internal evaluation. Approval of the Taylor’s University Senate. Note : Students without a qualification in the related fields or relevant working experience requires to undergo and pass a bridging module. Any of the above conditions would require student\'s research proposal to be approved. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below: Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation; An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field; A list of scholarly published work; The minimum language proficiency of the candidates must be determined by the HEP consistent with applicable programme standards or based on the needs of the programme, i.e., learning outcomes and the medium of instruction. A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications or productions must be published or produced within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications or productions, the candidate must be the principal author or creator with the contributions of others clearly defined. Notes All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department. Note : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','{\"gpa\": 3.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','We offered two entry pathway for this PhD programme, which is normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Masters Masters in the field or related fields; OR Bachelor’s Degree Passed Bachelor’s degree in the field or related fields with min. CGPA 3.67 and registered as a Masters candidate and passed related qualifying assessment Other equivalent qualification Any other equivalent qualification recognized by Malaysian government or accepted by the Taylor\'s University Senate and Any of condition of the above would require student\'s research proposal to be approved.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"This comprehensive programme is designed to provide you with a transformative research experience and equip you with the skills and knowledge to become a leading expert in your field. Throughout your PhD journey, you wil\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the following modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature:\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Tourism & Hospitality Business Operation Management\", \"Hotel Management\", \"Human Resource Management\", \"Knowledge Management\"], \"ms\": [