us research and contributing new insights, ideas, and theories to the field. Our programme is built on the principles of intellectual curiosity, critical analysis, and originality, empowering you to make a significant impact in the realm of Hospitality and Tourism. Due to the programme\'s reputation for producing influential researchers and its strategic partnerships with leading institutions, early application is highly encouraged to secure your place in a cohort of future innovators, committed to driving positive change.\", \"ms\": \"As a PhD candidate, you will have the opportunity to delve deep into your area of interest, conducting rigorous research and contributing new insights, ideas, and theories to the field. Our programme is built on the principles of intellectual curiosity, critical analysis, and originality, empowering you to make a significant impact in the realm of Hospitality and Tourism. Due to the programme\'s reputation for producing influential researchers and its strategic partnerships with leading institutions, early application is highly encouraged to secure your place in a cohort of future innovators, committed to driving positive change.\", \"zh-CN\": \"酒店与旅游哲学博士 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由酒店、旅游与活动学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"酒店與旅遊哲學博士 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由酒店、旅遊與活动學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-hospitality-tourism.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-hospitality-tourism.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-hospitality-tourism.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/hospitality-tourism-and-events/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-hospitality-tourism.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-hospitality-tourism-and-events/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-hospitality-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-011. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 14,315 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.447659','2026-06-21 01:09:06.447659',14315.00,'phd'),(7501,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-071-bachelor-of-laws-honours','TSU-UG-071','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Laws (Honours)\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Laws (Honours)\", \"zh-CN\": \"法律荣誉学士\", \"zh-TW\": \"法律榮譽學士\"}','Bachelor of Laws (Honours)','law','{\"en\": \"School of Law and Governance\", \"ms\": \"School of Law and Governance\", \"zh-CN\": \"法律与治理学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"法律與治理學院\"}','法律与治理学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',3.0,'3-year',91997,'USD','USD 38,332 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-law-and-governance/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-law-and-governance-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": 4, \"ielts\": 0, \"toefl\": 60}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS Overall Band 6.0 TOEFL 60 - Internet Based Test (20 in writing) MUET Band 4 Other Equivalent English Qualifications Students with other qualifications will be considered on a case-by-case basis Pre-University / Diploma Completed Pre-University / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS (or Equivalent) Band 6.0 Pre-University / Diploma Completed Pre-University / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Note : - International students may join IEN Preparatory Course and achieve the IELTS score. - All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.67; ATAR 70; 65%; 60%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.67; ATAR 70; 65%; 60%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.67; ATAR 70; 65%; 60%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.67; ATAR 70; 65%; 60%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Laws. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U or Foundation Qualification Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits (including English) for entry with pre-university / foundation qualification (Except for UEC) SPM / O-Level with Diploma Qualification Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits (including English) for entry with Diploma qualification. Prerequisite for CLP Students who wish to pursue the CLP Examinations, will be required to show 5 credits in SPM/ equivalent in one (1) sitting, prior to joining the programme Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Requirements Taylor’s Foundation* Pass with min. CGPA 2.67/4.00 Taylor’s Diploma* Pass with min. CGPA 2.67/4.00 in a related discipline Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Pass STPM with CGPA 2.67 in 2 subjects with at least a Pass in Pengajian Am Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) A Pass in UEC with min 5Bs including English, with Max. of 20 points. For entry with UEC, the SPM prerequisites of 5 credits in one (1) sitting (prior to joining the programme), must be satisfied for students’ who wish to sit for CLP Exam. Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in UEC English may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in English at SPM or equivalent A Level Min. CC / BD / AD AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 70 Canadian Pre-University (CPU)* Min. average of 65% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) 24 points in 6 subjects and at least 4 points for 3 Higher Level subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 60% Other Qualifications* Pass Foundation/ Matriculation recognised as an equivalent by the Malaysian Government / Diploma in a related discipline recognised as an equivalent by the Malaysian Government with Min CGPA of 2.67 Note : Students are advised to check with LPQB (Legal Profession Qualifying Board) on the recognition of the Pre-U programme for purposes of pursuing the CLP (Certificate of Legal Practice) All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','No programme-specific interview, portfolio, proposal, supervisor, publication or work-experience condition is marked for public display in this review-only row unless official evidence is reviewed.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our curriculum is thoughtfully designed to equip you with the relevant knowledge and abilities needed to thrive in the industry. By immersing yourself in a dynamic learning environment, you will gain the confidence and a\", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Click here to find out more about the Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Core Modules\", \"Contract Law I\", \"Contract Law II\", \"Law of Tort I\", \"Law of Tort II\", \"Constitutional and Administrative Law I\", \"Constitutional and Administrative Law II\", \"English Legal System\", \"Legal Skills and Methods\"], \"ms\": [\"Our curriculum is thoughtfully designed to equip you with the relevant knowledge and abilities needed to thrive in the industry. By immersing yourself in a dynamic learning environment, you will gain the confidence and a\", \"This programme is compatible with the new Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework that allows students to mix & match study modules.\", \"Click here to find out more about the Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework.\", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Core Modules\", \"Contract Law I\", \"Contract Law II\", \"Law of Tort I\", \"Law of Tort II\", \"Constitutional and Administrative Law I\", \"Constitutional and Administrative Law II\", \"English Legal System\", \"Legal Skills and Methods\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Laws programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Solicitor\", \"Researcher\", \"Corporate Legal Advisor\", \"Legal Writer\", \"Journalist\", \"Forensic Investigator\", \"Criminal Investigator\", \"Company Secretarial\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Laws programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Solicitor\", \"Researcher\", \"Corporate Legal Advisor\", \"Legal Writer\", \"Journalist\", \"Forensic Investigator\", \"Criminal Investigator\", \"Company Secretarial\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"School of Law and Governance (SLG) provides an in-depth appreciation of legal doctrines and concepts, enabling you to apply knowledge in real-world situations. With limited seats available each intake, the curriculum combines rigorous theoretical study with practical exposure across contract law, criminal law, property law, and constitutional law. Recognised by the\", \"ms\": \"School of Law and Governance (SLG) provides an in-depth appreciation of legal doctrines and concepts, enabling you to apply knowledge in real-world situations. With limited seats available each intake, the curriculum combines rigorous theoretical study with practical exposure across contract law, criminal law, property law, and constitutional law. Recognised by the\", \"zh-CN\": \"法律荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由法律与治理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"法律榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由法律與治理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/undergraduate/bachelor-of-laws.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/undergraduate/bachelor-of-laws.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/undergraduate/bachelor-of-laws.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/undergraduate/bachelor-of-laws.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://univers