successfully completed this Master of Laws in Healthcare and Medical Law programme, you could advance to any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Corporate Executive\", \"In-house Counsel\", \"Medico-legal Professions\"], \"ms\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this Master of Laws in Healthcare and Medical Law programme, you could advance to any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Corporate Executive\", \"In-house Counsel\", \"Medico-legal Professions\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 4 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 4 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\", \"Research Project\", \"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\", \"Research Project\", \"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"This specialised programme dives into advanced legal frameworks relating to medical practice, healthcare regulations and policies, medical ethics, medical negligence, informed consent, confidentiality, and other critical areas. You\'ll be equipped to address legal challenges in healthcare services, navigate the impact of new technologies on healthcare practices, and understand the regulations that govern the health professions. Whether you aspire to practise healthcare law, pursue a career in healthcare administration, or influence health policy and reform, this programme provides you with the expertise and qualifications to excel in the field.\", \"ms\": \"This specialised programme dives into advanced legal frameworks relating to medical practice, healthcare regulations and policies, medical ethics, medical negligence, informed consent, confidentiality, and other critical areas. You\'ll be equipped to address legal challenges in healthcare services, navigate the impact of new technologies on healthcare practices, and understand the regulations that govern the health professions. Whether you aspire to practise healthcare law, pursue a career in healthcare administration, or influence health policy and reform, this programme provides you with the expertise and qualifications to excel in the field.\", \"zh-CN\": \"Laws in Healthcare与Medical Law硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由法律与治理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"Laws in Healthcare與Medical Law碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由法律與治理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws-in-healthcare-and-medical-law.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws-in-healthcare-and-medical-law.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws-in-healthcare-and-medical-law.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws-in-healthcare-and-medical-law.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-law-and-governance/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-law-and-master-of-laws-in-healthcare-and-medical-law-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given s