 \"Corporate Executive\", \"In-house Counsel\", \"Medico-legal Professions\"], \"ms\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this Master of Laws programme, you could advance to any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Corporate Executive\", \"In-house Counsel\", \"Medico-legal Professions\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 4 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 4 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\", \"Research Project\", \"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\", \"Research Project\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\", \"Research Project\", \"Research Methods I\", \"Research Methods II\", \"Research Project\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Whether your goal is to develop a specialised niche or advance your professional competencies, the LL.M programme provides in-depth exposure to contemporary legal domains such as International Business and Trade, Healthcare Law, Artificial Intelligence, and E-Commerce. To ensure a robust mastery of these areas, you are required to engage critically with complex legal issues, strengthening both theoretical understanding and practical application. Through a broad range of elective modules, you can tailor your learning experience to match your interests. Practical assessments and real-world applications further enhance your skills in negotiation, report writing, policy drafting, and case studies. Join us to become a forward-thinking legal professional, fully equipped to lead in the digital era.\", \"ms\": \"Whether your goal is to develop a specialised niche or advance your professional competencies, the LL.M programme provides in-depth exposure to contemporary legal domains such as International Business and Trade, Healthcare Law, Artificial Intelligence, and E-Commerce. To ensure a robust mastery of these areas, you are required to engage critically with complex legal issues, strengthening both theoretical understanding and practical application. Through a broad range of elective modules, you can tailor your learning experience to match your interests. Practical assessments and real-world applications further enhance your skills in negotiation, report writing, policy drafting, and case studies. Join us to become a forward-thinking legal professional, fully equipped to lead in the digital era.\", \"zh-CN\": \"Laws硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由法律与治理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"Laws碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由法律與治理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/law-and-governance/master-coursework/master-of-laws.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-law-and-governance/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-law-and-master-of-laws-in-healthcare-and-medical-law-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester