; 50%; IB 24 points。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Performing Arts programme. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 5 credits for entry with Pre-University / Foundation qualification (Except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM / O-Level or equivalent with 3 credits for entry with Diploma qualification. Note : 1. Candidates need to pass BM and History at SPM level. 2. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Audition Prepare adequately for the audition with the guidance provided by our experts, tailored to meet the requirements of each specialisation. 1. Format: Video recording (MP4 or MOV format preferred) Duration: 2–5 minutes Clear audio and visual quality 2. Content: Dance Specialisation: One solo piece (contemporary, traditional, or classical) demonstrating technique, creativity, and performance quality. (2-3 minutes) Music Specialisation: One performance of a chosen song (2-3 minutes). Performance Specialisation: One monologue, original or published play showing character interpretation and vocal clarity. (2-3 minutes) 3. Introduction State the following details before beginning your performance: Full name Specialisation (Dance / Music / Performance) Title of your piece 4. Submission Method Upload your video to YouTube, and submit the link only File name format: FullName_Specialisation_Audition2026 5. Assessment Criteria Technique and control Creativity and originality Expression and interpretation Stage presence and confidence Overall presentation Entry Pathway Specialisation Audition Pass Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs A Level Min. DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 50 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 50% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) 50% MOHE Matriculation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Foundation and Diploma programmes Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation / Diploma programme with CGPA 2.00 Other Equivalent Qualification Pass Foundation from any other institution recognised by MOHE; or Pass Diploma from any other institution recognised by MOHE; or Pass Matriculation from an institution recognised by MOHE; or Any other equiv. qualification recognized by M\'sian Government. Application via APEL A is allowed. Note : All Malaysian students are required to attain a Pass in Bahasa Melayu and English in SPM / O-Level / UEC / IGCSE or equivalent. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department. Students must pass auditions for the performance, dance, and music tracks.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Embark on a transformative journey with our performing arts programme, where you will learn from highly qualified academicians and esteemed industry leaders dedicated to nurturing the next generation of creative professi\", \"The programme contains modules that include Performance, Directing, History of Theatre, Devising Performance Text, Voice and Speech, Movement, Technical Theatre, Stage Costume, Hair and Makeup, Stage Lighting, Stage Soun\", \"Co-created, co-designed and co-delivered by Taylor\'s University, top industry professionals and renowned Adjuncts\", \"Collaborative teaching & learning by leaders in education and performing arts\", \"Flexible learning spaces at Taylor\'s University Lakeside\", \"This programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"that allow you to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Introduction to Performing Arts\", \"History of Theatre\", \"Introduction to Acting\", \"Fundamentals of Choir Performance\"], \"ms\": [\"Embark on a transformative journey with our performing arts programme, where you will learn from highly qualified academicians and esteemed industry leaders dedicated to nurturing the next generation of creative professi\", \"The programme contains modules that include Performance, Directing, History of Theatre, Devising Performance Text, Voice and Speech, Movement, Technical Theatre, Stage Costume, Hair and Makeup, Stage Lighting, Stage Soun\", \"Co-created, co-designed and co-delivered by Taylor\'s University, top industry professionals and renowned Adjuncts\", \"Collaborative teaching & learning by leaders in education and performing arts\", \"Flexible learning spaces at Taylor\'s University Lakeside\", \"This programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"that allow you to mix & match study modules.\", \"Primary Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Introduction to Performing Arts\", \"History of Theatre\", \"Introduction to Acting\", \"Fundamentals of Choir Performance\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Performing Arts programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Stage, TV, and Film\", \"Actor / Actress, Singer, Dancer\", \"Stage Manager\", \"Production Manager\", \"Performer\", \"Scriptwriter\", \"Presenter\", \"Movement Coach\", \"Corporate Training\", \"Storyteller\", \"Education\", \"Drama teacher\", \"Dance teacher\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Performing Arts programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Stage, TV, and Film\", \"Actor / Actress, Singer, Dancer\", \"Stage Manager\", \"Production Manager\", \"Performer\", \"Scriptwriter\", \"Presenter\", \"Movement Coach\", \"Corporate Training\", \"Storyteller\", \"Education\", \"Drama teacher\", \"Dance teacher\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"With a curriculum shaped by leading industry professionals and academics, our students are in high demand for their versatility and depth of training. Spaces in this innovative programme are limited, ensuring an immersive, personalised learning journey for every performer. Guided by industry veterans, develop your talents across theatre, dance, music, and more (think marketing, fintech, or even psychology), while building critical thinking, cultural awareness, and social engagement skills that take you further in the performing arts industry.\", \"ms\": \"With a curriculum shaped by leading industry professionals and academics, our students are in high demand for their versatility and depth of training. Spaces in this innovative programme are limited, ensuring an immersive, personalised learning journey for every performer. Guided by industry veterans, develop your talents across theatre, dance, music, and more (think marketing, fintech, or even psychology), while building critical thinking, cultural awareness, and social engagement skills that take you further in the performing arts industry.\", \"zh-CN\": \"表演艺术荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由文理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"表演藝術榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由文理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-performing-arts.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-performing-arts.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-performing-arts.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-performing-arts.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-