-liberal-arts-and-sciences-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5.5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS, TOEFL, MUET, UEC English Pass English Taylor\'s EET Overall Score 5.0 Taylor\'s IEN Level 2- Grade C Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma that was conducted in English INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS 5.5 Pre-U / Diploma Completed Pre-U / Diploma that was conducted in English Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 50; 50%\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 50; 50%\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 50; 50%。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.00; CGPA 2.50; ATAR 50; 50%。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Psychology. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level with Pre-U / Foundation Pass SPM / O-level or equivalent with 5 credits in Mathematics, Biology/Physics/ Chemistry/ General Science/Applied Science and a Pass in English (Except for UEC). SPM / O-Level with Diploma Pass SPM//O-level or equivalent with 3 credits in Mathematics, Biology/Physics/ Chemistry/ General Science/Applied Science and a Pass in English for entry with Diploma Qualification. Note: 1. Candidates without a credits in Mathematics, Biology/ Physics/Chemistry/ General Science/ Applied Science and a Pass in English at SPM level or its equivalent may be admitted if the STPM / Foundation / Diploma/Matriculation programme contains subjects in Mathematics, Biology/Physics/ Chemistry/ General Science/Applied Science and English that are equivalent or higher to Mathematics, Biology/ Physics/ Chemistry/ General Science/ Applied Science and English at SPM level. 2. Those without a pass/credit in Mathematics, Biology/ Physics/Chemistry/ General Science/Applied Science at SPM level or equivalent can be admitted but must attend special enhancement course(s). These special enhancement courses should be SPM equivalent, remedial. Students must pass/credit the Mathematics and Biology/ Physics/ Chemistry/General Science/ Applied Science enhancement courses as a prerequisite to related core courses taught in English. 3. Candidates need to pass BM and History at SPM level. 4. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. CC Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) A Pass in UEC with a minimum of 5B including Mathematics, Biology / Physics / Chemistry / General Science / Applied Science and a Pass in English (Note: Candidates without a Grade ‘B’ in the subjects above may be admitted if the candidate has a credit in the subjects above at SPM or equivalent level) A Level Min. DD AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 50 Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 50% in 6 subjects International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Overall 50% Diploma in Psychology CGPA 2.00 Taylor’s Foundation and Diploma programmes Pass any Taylor\'s Foundation/Diploma programme with min. CGPA 2.00 Foundation / Pre-University / Diploma from any other institution recognised by MOHE Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 MOHE Matriculation Pass with min. CGPA 2.00 DKM/DKLM/DVM Pass with a min. CGPA 2.50 subject to Senate approval of the relevant institutions OR Graduated with a min. CGPA 2.00 with a minimum of two (2) years of work experience in the related field Other Equivalent Qualification Application via APEL A is allowed The HEPs are required to conduct screening and provide appropriate bridging courses in Mathematics and Science Any other equivalent qualification recognised by the Malaysian Government Note : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"This Bachelor of Psychology programme provides you with a solid foundation in psychological theories, concepts, empirical studies, and professional practice. Benefit from the expertise of our team of psychology experts w\", \"As part of our commitment to offering a flexible and personalised learning experience, our programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"This framework allows you to mix and match study modules according to your interests and career goals.\", \"Common Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Introduction to Psychology\", \"Research in Psychology\", \"Learning and Motivation\", \"Philosophy and Theories of Psychotherapy\", \"Human Personality\", \"Quantitative Methods\", \"Qualitative Methods\", \"Biological Psychology\"], \"ms\": [\"This Bachelor of Psychology programme provides you with a solid foundation in psychological theories, concepts, empirical studies, and professional practice. Benefit from the expertise of our team of psychology experts w\", \"As part of our commitment to offering a flexible and personalised learning experience, our programme is compatible with the new\", \"Taylor\'s Curriculum Framework\", \"This framework allows you to mix and match study modules according to your interests and career goals.\", \"Common Core\", \"This component consists of core subjects, which are primary modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Introduction to Psychology\", \"Research in Psychology\", \"Learning and Motivation\", \"Philosophy and Theories of Psychotherapy\", \"Human Personality\", \"Quantitative Methods\", \"Qualitative Methods\", \"Biological Psychology\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Psychology programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Advertising Accounts Planner\", \"Career Counsellor\", \"Clinical Psychologist\", \"Consumer Psychologist\", \"Counselling Psychologist\", \"Developmental Psychologist\", \"Educational Psychologist\", \"Forensic Psychologist\", \"Market Researcher\", \"Occupational Psychologist\", \"Psychotherapist\", \"Rehabilitation Specialist\", \"Social Service Specialist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Psychology programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Advertising Accounts Planner\", \"Career Counsellor\", \"Clinical Psychologist\", \"Consumer Psychologist\", \"Counselling Psychologist\", \"Developmental Psychologist\", \"Educational Psychologist\", \"Forensic Psychologist\", \"Market Researcher\", \"Occupational Psychologist\", \"Psychotherapist\", \"Rehabilitation Specialist\", \"Social Service Specialist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 14 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 14 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research in Psychology\"], \"ms\": [\"Research in Psychology\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"With the increasing importance of mental health awareness and psychological support, this programme prepares you to meet evolving societal needs. You\'ll gain insight into how psychological principles can be applied not only in clinical or counselling environments but also in areas like Human Resources, education, community outreach, and corporate wellness. Spaces in this programme are competitive, reflecting strong industry demand and Taylor’s commitment to future-focused, quality education. You’ll also have the opportunity to transition smoothly into postgraduate pathways such as the Master of Clinical Psychology or the Master of Counselling. These advanced degrees deepen your expertise and prepare you for specialised roles in mental health care, therapy, or organisational psycholog Graduates of our Psychology programmes are equipped to pursue diverse career paths. Whether you aim to work in clinical practice, corporate consulting, human resource management, academic research, or community development, you\'ll have a strong foundation for meaningful, impactful careers in psychology and beyond.\", \"ms\": \"With the increasing importance of mental health awareness and psychological support, this programme prepares you to meet evolving societal needs. You\'ll gain insight into how psychological principles can be applied not only in clinical or counselling environments but also in areas like Human Resources, education, community outreach, and corporate wellness. Spaces in this programme are competitive, reflecting strong industry demand and Taylor’s commitment to future-focused, quality education. You’ll also have the opportunity to transition smoothly into postgraduate pathways such as the Master of Clinical Psychology or the Master of Counselling. These advanced degrees deepen your expertise and prepare you for specialised roles in mental health care, therapy, or organisational psycholog Graduates of our Psychology programmes are equipped to pursue diverse career paths. Whether you aim to work in clinical practice, corporate consulting, human resource management, academic research, or community development, you\'ll have a strong foundation for meaningful, impactful careers in psychology and beyond.\", \"zh-CN\": \"心理学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由文理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"心理學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由文理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-psychology.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-psychology.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduat