es within your area of specialisation, gaining practical insights that set you apart as a competent and confident professional.\", \"ms\": \"During the initial two years on campus, you will be guided by distinguished International Relations scholars and national leaders. Through a rich curriculum, you\'ll delve into the theories and practices of international relations, equipping you with leadership skills and a fresh understanding of global issues. To complement your knowledge, you also gain a competitive edge through the programme’s final-year industry experience. Supported by industry coaches and university lecturers, apply your skills directly to international relations projects and contemporary challenges within your area of specialisation, gaining practical insights that set you apart as a competent and confident professional.\", \"zh-CN\": \"International Relations社会科学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由文理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"International Relations社会科學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由文理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-social-science-in-international-relations.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-social-science-in-international-relations.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-social-science-in-international-relations.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/undergraduate/bachelor-of-social-science-in-international-relations.html\", \"note\": \"Capt