imate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-liberal-arts-and-sciences/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-counselling-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"April\", \"September\"]','April and September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": 40}','For International students: IELTS 5.0 / TOEFL 40 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. For Malaysian students (if their undergraduate or postgraduate degree qualifications [whichever more recent] were done outside of Malaysia, and were not undertaken in the English language): IELTS 5.0 / TOEFL 500 paper-based or 213 for computer-based (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score). The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Note Terms and conditions apply. All candidates who fulfil the above requirements must pass Candidate Selection Interview to ensure comprehension of English language and the basic psychological wellbeing suitability of the candidate for the role as a Counsellor. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','{\"gpa\": 2.5, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.00。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','ENTRY REQUIREMENT Fulfilling one of the requirements listed below: Bachelors degree from a recognised university with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 or equivalent preferably but not necessarily with relevant industry experience; Those with CGPA between 2.00 to 2.49 but with a minimum of 5 years\' relevant working experience are also admissible. ENGLISH REQUIREMENT','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our programme structure is carefully designed to align with the standards and guidelines set by Malaysia\'s Board of Counsellors (Lembaga Kaunselor Malaysia, LKM). We are committed to providing a curriculum that meets the\", \"Throughout the programme, we focus on developing your abilities in client assessment and management. You will learn effective strategies and techniques to understand and assess clients\' needs, providing them with appropr\", \"Primary Modules\", \"The comprehensive syllabus of the programme aims to equip individuals with the skills, knowledge, attitude, and mindset necessary to become passionate, professional counselors dedicated to providing mental healthcare to \", \"Counselling Interventions: Skills and Techniques\", \"Theories and Applications of Psychotherapy\", \"Professional Issues, Ethics and Law in Counselling\", \"Testing and Measurement in Counselling\", \"Group Dynamics and Therapy\", \"Multicultural Counselling\", \"Human Development Across Life Span\", \"Theories of Career Development\", \"Research Methodology and Statistics\", \"Career Counselling: Assessments and Applications\"], \"ms\": [\"Our programme structure is carefully designed to align with the standards and guidelines set by Malaysia\'s Board of Counsellors (Lembaga Kaunselor Malaysia, LKM). We are committed to providing a curriculum that meets the\", \"Throughout the programme, we focus on developing your abilities in client assessment and management. You will learn effective strategies and techniques to understand and assess clients\' needs, providing them with appropr\", \"Primary Modules\", \"The comprehensive syllabus of the programme aims to equip individuals with the skills, knowledge, attitude, and mindset necessary to become passionate, professional counselors dedicated to providing mental healthcare to \", \"Counselling Interventions: Skills and Techniques\", \"Theories and Applications of Psychotherapy\", \"Professional Issues, Ethics and Law in Counselling\", \"Testing and Measurement in Counselling\", \"Group Dynamics and Therapy\", \"Multicultural Counselling\", \"Human Development Across Life Span\", \"Theories of Career Development\", \"Research Methodology and Statistics\", \"Career Counselling: Assessments and Applications\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：2 to 3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：2 to 3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Counselling programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Counsellor\", \"Academician\", \"Private Practitioner\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Researcher\", \"Graduates can work in the government sector (hospitals, universities, and clinics), private sector (hospitals, universities, corporate companies, clinics, and centres), and Non-Governmental Organisations.\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Counselling programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Counsellor\", \"Academician\", \"Private Practitioner\", \"Entrepreneur\", \"Researcher\", \"Graduates can work in the government sector (hospitals, universities, and clinics), private sector (hospitals, universities, corporate companies, clinics, and centres), and Non-Governmental Organisations.\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 7 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 7 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Research Methodology and Statistics\"], \"ms\": [\"Research Methodology and Statistics\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"This programme serves as a vital stepping stone for those passionate about engaging in the field of mental health. With a focus on upholding ethical standards and fostering competence, our programme equips you with the expertise to become a globally competitive practitioner and researcher. Given the rising demand for professional counsellors, admission to the programme is increasingly selective to maintain our high standards.\", \"ms\": \"This programme serves as a vital stepping stone for those passionate about engaging in the field of mental health. With a focus on upholding ethical standards and fostering competence, our programme equips you with the expertise to become a globally competitive practitioner and researcher. Given the rising demand for professional counsellors, admission to the programme is increasingly selective to maintain our high standards.\", \"zh-CN\": \"辅导学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由文理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"辅导學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由文理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-counselling.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-counselling.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-counselling.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-counselling.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-liberal-arts-and-sciences/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-counselling-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-M-024. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 18,124 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.530762','2026-06-21 01:09:06.530762',18124.00,'master'),(7510,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-080-master-of-clinical-psychology','TSU-MA-080','{\"en\": \"Master of Clinical Psychology\", \"ms\": \"Master of Clinical Psychology\", \"zh-CN\": \"临床心理学硕士\", \"zh-TW\": \"臨床心理學碩士\"}','Master of Clinical Psychology','medicine','{\"en\": \"School of Liberal Arts and Sciences\", \"ms\": \"School of Liberal Arts and Sciences\", \"zh-CN\": \"文理学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"文理學院\"}','文理学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',2.0,'2-year (Full Time)',77479,'USD','USD 21,522 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-liberal-arts-and-sciences/postgraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-of-clinical-psychology-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"April\", \"September\"]','April and September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 5, \"toefl\": 40}','For International students: IELTS 5.0 / TOEFL 40 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. For Malaysian students (if their undergraduate or postgraduate degree qualifications [whichever more recent] were done outside of Malaysia, and were not undertaken in the English language): IELTS 5.0 / TOEFL 40 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Note Terms and conditions apply. *Rigorous internal assessment may include independent panel interview, GRE psychology examination, and relevant extensive experience. In the event the programme has available seats due to unforeseen circumstances: The candidates who have attended and passed the candidate selection interview for that semester but were moved to the subsequent semester due to lack of seats in the upcoming semester will be given first priority to join that semester. The remaining candidate(s) with the highest CGPA and relevant industry experience but who have not been interviewed yet will be given second priority to be interviewed for that semester. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department.','{\"gpa\": 2.75, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.00\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.00\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.00。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.00。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Requirement A Bachelor’s degree in Psychology (Level 6, MQF) with a minimum CGPA of 2.75 or its equivalent as accepted by the HEP Senate; OR A Bachelor’s degree in Psychology with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 and not meeting a CGPA of 2.75, can be accepted subject to rigorous internal assessment.* OR Candidates with a Bachelor’s degree (non-psychology, Level 6, MQF) with a minimum CGPA of 2.75 with a minimum 45 credits of prerequisites modules in Psychology or a graduate diploma in Psychology or its equivalent as accepted by the HEP Senate; OR Candidates with a Bachelor’s degree (non-psychology, Level 6, MQF) with a minimum CGPA of 2.75 and a Master’s degree in Psychology with a minimum 45 credits of prerequisites modules in Psychology or a graduate diploma in Psychology or its equivalent as accepted by the HEP Senate OR Other relevant equivalent qualifications recognised by Malaysian government as equivalent to the above requirements. Additional Requirement Personal statement (no more than 500 words) which outlines why the applicants wish to be considered for the course and their relevant skills. While clinically relevant work/volunteer experience is not a course entry requirement, applicants who have undertaken relevant work/volunteer experience may wish to include this as part of their personal statement. Minimum two confidential referee reports 1 academic referee - research supervisor is highly encouraged; 1 professional referee outside academic context) to be submitted; and Pass Candidate Selection Interview arranged by Taylor\'s University (short-listed applicants only) English Requirement','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, supervisor, referenceLetter. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待复核）\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简历\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待复核）\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待复核）\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it（译名待复核）\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"certified academic certificates and transcripts（译名待覆核）\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"个人简歷\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"employer testimonial or recommendation letter if applicable（译名待覆核）\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"pre-arrival health examination report when required by the application route（译名待覆核）\", \"reference or recommendation letter when the programme-specific route requires it（译名待覆核）\"]}','{\"en\": [\"The programme\'s thorough syllabus focuses on preparing you with the skills, knowledge, attitude, mindset, and clinical training necessary to diagnose and treat individuals for a fulfilling career in Clinical Psychology.\", \"Primary Modules\", \"Adult Clinical Psychology\", \"Child and Adolescent Clinical Psychology\", \"Psychological Assessment and Diagnosis\", \"Psychological Interventions and Therapies\", \"Cognitive Behaviour Therapy\", \"Intermediate Research Methods\", \"Intermediate Psychological Statistics\", \"Clinical Neuropsychological Assessment\", \"Biological Psychology and Psychopharmacology\", \"Professional and Ethical Practice (Clinical)\", \"Clinical Practicum and Seminar I\", \"Research Project I\"], \"ms\": [\"The programme\'s thorough syllabus focuses on preparing you with the skills, knowledge, attitude, mindset, and clinical training necessary to diagnose and treat individuals for a fulfilling career in Clinical Psychology.\", \"Primary Modules\", \"Adult Clinical Psychology\", \"Child and Adolescent Clinical Psychology\", \"Psychological Assessment and Diagnosis\", \"Psychological Interventions and Therapies\", \"Cognitive Behaviour Therapy\", \"Intermediate Research Methods\", \"Intermediate Psychological Statistics\", \"Clinical Neuropsychological Assessment\", \"Biological Psychology and Psychopharmacology\", \"Professional and Ethical Practice (Clinical)\", \"Clinical Practicum and Seminar I\", \"Research Project I\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：2-year (Full Time)。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：2-year (Full Time)。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this programme, you could advance to any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Clinical Psychologist\", \"Academician\", \"Researcher\", \"Mental Health Practitioner\", \"Psychology Consultant/Officer\", \"Employee Assistance Programme Consultant\", \"Corporate Consultant\", \"International Aid/Development Worker\", \"Graduates can work in the government sector (hospitals, universities, and clinics), private sector (hospitals, universities, corporate companies, clinics, and centres), and Non-Governmental Organisations.\"], \"ms\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this programme, you could advance to any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Clinical Psychologist\", \"Academician\", \"Researcher\", \"Mental Health Practitioner\", \"Psychology Consultant/Officer\", \"Employee Assistance Programme Consultant\", \"Corporate Consultant\", \"International Aid/Development Worker\", \"Graduates can work in the government sector (hospitals, universities, and clinics), private sector (hospitals, universities, corporate companies, clinics, and centres), and Non-Governmental Organisations.\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Intermediate Research Methods\", \"Research Project I\"], \"ms\": [\"Intermediate Research Methods\", \"Research Project I\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"This programme equips you with the core skills and knowledge needed to support individuals facing psychological disorders. From psychological assessment and diagnosis to psychotherapy, intervention, clinical research, and mental health prevention—you’ll build practical skills tailored to real-world clinical practice. The programme adheres to the standards set by the Malaysian Allied Health Professions Council, the Allied Health Professions Act 2016, and the Malaysian Society of Clinical Psychology (MSCP). Graduates are eligible to register as Clinical Psychologists under the Malaysian Allied Health Professions Council.\", \"ms\": \"This programme equips you with the core skills and knowledge needed to support individuals facing psychological disorders. From psychological assessment and diagnosis to psychotherapy, intervention, clinical research, and mental health prevention—you’ll build practical skills tailored to real-world clinical practice. The programme adheres to the standards set by the Malaysian Allied Health Professions Council, the Allied Health Professions Act 2016, and the Malaysian Society of Clinical Psychology (MSCP). Graduates are eligible to register as Clinical Psychologists under the Malaysian Allied Health Professions Council.\", \"zh-CN\": \"临床心理学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由文理学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"臨床心理學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由文理學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-clinical-psychology.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-clinical-psychology.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-clinical-psychology.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/liberal-arts-and-sciences/master-coursework/master-of-clinical-psychology.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit