d by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-pharmacy/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-pharmacy-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"April\", \"September\"]','April & September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": 3, \"ielts\": 5.5, \"toefl\": null}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 5.5 MUET Band 3 Pre-University / Diploma / Foundation Completed Pre-University / Diploma / Foundation that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 5.5 Pre-University / Foundation / Diploma Completed Pre-University / Foundation / Diploma programme that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Note : - International students may join IEN Preparatory Course and achieve the IELTS score. - All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.5, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.85\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.85\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.85。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.50; CGPA 2.33; CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.85。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Pharmaceutical Science programme. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites Sijil Pelajaran Malaysia (SPM) A pass in SPM/SPMV/O-level or equivalent with 5 credits (Except for UEC) Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation in Science (FIS) Pass with min. CGPA 2.50 including GPA 2.33 in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry. Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Pass with a minimum GPA 2.33 in (ANY 2) of the following subjects: Biology, Physics/Mathematics, Chemistry. Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. 5Bs including (ANY 2): Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry. A Level Min. DD in TWO of the subjects: Biology, Physics/Mathematics, Chemistry. Min D in each subject. AUSMAT (SACEi) Achieve ATAR 60 with min. Grade C+ each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry. Canadian Pre-University (CPU) Min. average of 60% in 6 subjects including min. 65% each in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry. International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 24 points in 6 subjects including min. 5 points at Higher Level (HL) in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry. Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Achieve an overallof 55% for (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry with min. 65% in each subject Matriculation in Science Min. CGPA 2.33 for 3 subjects including (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Diploma Recognised Diploma with minimum CGPA of 2.75 in related field OR Recognised Diploma with CGPA less than 2.75 in related field and a minimum of 3 years (36 months) working experience in the related field. OR Pass Foundation in Science from other institution with CGPA 2.85 including GPA of 2.67 in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics/Mathematics, Chemistry. Foundation in Science from other institutions Pass with CGPA 2.85 including GPA of 2.67 in (ANY 2) subjects: Biology, Physics / Mathematics, Chemistry Other Qualifications Students with other qualifications will be considered on a case-by-case basis. Application via APEL A is allowed. Note : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"This programme presents students with a choice between two tracks: a conventional or a work-based learning (WBL) track. The curriculum equips students with essential knowledge in physiology, pharmacology, pharmaceutical \", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Human Anatomy & Physiology\", \"Principles of Life Sciences\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Pharmaceutical Organic Chemistry\", \"Basic Pharmacology and Toxicology with Health Informatics\", \"Physical Pharmaceutics\", \"Pharmaceutical Dosage Form\", \"Principles of Pharmaceutical Chemistry\", \"Advanced Pharmacology\"], \"ms\": [\"This programme presents students with a choice between two tracks: a conventional or a work-based learning (WBL) track. The curriculum equips students with essential knowledge in physiology, pharmacology, pharmaceutical \", \"Primary Major\", \"This component consists of Common Core subjects, which are common modules across a discipline that provides the fundamental knowledge of the discipline.\", \"Common Core\", \"Human Anatomy & Physiology\", \"Principles of Life Sciences\", \"Principles of Marketing\", \"Understanding Entrepreneurialism\", \"Pharmaceutical Organic Chemistry\", \"Basic Pharmacology and Toxicology with Health Informatics\", \"Physical Pharmaceutics\", \"Pharmaceutical Dosage Form\", \"Principles of Pharmaceutical Chemistry\", \"Advanced Pharmacology\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：3-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：3-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Pharmaceutical Science degree, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Formulation Scientists\", \"Manufacturing Specialists\", \"Clinical Trial Associates and Scientists\", \"Pharmaceutical Product Portfolio Manager\", \"Pharmaceutical Market Analyst\", \"Regulatory Affairs Officers\", \"Research Scientist\", \"Quality Assurance and Quality Control Personnel\", \"Pharmaceutical Business Development Expert\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Pharmaceutical Science degree, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Formulation Scientists\", \"Manufacturing Specialists\", \"Clinical Trial Associates and Scientists\", \"Pharmaceutical Product Portfolio Manager\", \"Pharmaceutical Market Analyst\", \"Regulatory Affairs Officers\", \"Research Scientist\", \"Quality Assurance and Quality Control Personnel\", \"Pharmaceutical Business Development Expert\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 10 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 10 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Whether you\'re aiming to lead in pharmaceutical research, create innovative cosmetic products, or revolutionise the healthcare landscape, the future of pharmacy begins here. Apply early to secure your place in this dynamic, in-demand programme and embark on your journey to becoming a future leader in the pharmaceutical industry.\", \"ms\": \"Whether you\'re aiming to lead in pharmaceutical research, create innovative cosmetic products, or revolutionise the healthcare landscape, the future of pharmacy begins here. Apply early to secure your place in this dynamic, in-demand programme and embark on your journey to becoming a future leader in the pharmaceutical industry.\", \"zh-CN\": \"药剂科学荣誉学士 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由药学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"藥劑科學榮譽學士 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由藥學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/undergraduate/bachelor-of-pharmaceutical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/undergraduate/bachelor-of-pharmaceutical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/undergraduate/bachelor-of-pharmaceutical-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://universit