 (Tier 1) Bachelor\'s degree in Pharmacy or relevant science discipline with min. CGPA of 2.75 as accepted by the Senate; OR Bachelor\'s Degree in Pharmacy (Tier 2) Bachelor\'s degree in Pharmacy or relevant science discipline with CGPA min. 2.50 but less than 2.75 can be accepted subjected to a minimum of 2 years working experience in relevant field.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience, proposal. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a master student in pharmaceutical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide \", \"Full time\", \"2 – 4 years\", \"Part time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Click here to learn more about our\", \"research area\", \"Pharmaceutical Technology\", \"Bioequivalence studies\"], \"ms\": [\"As a master student in pharmaceutical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide \", \"Full time\", \"2 – 4 years\", \"Part time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Click here to learn more about our\", \"research area\", \"Pharmaceutical Technology\", \"Bioequivalence studies\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academic Pharmacist\", \"Community Pharmacist\", \"Hospital Pharmacist\", \"Industrial Pharmacist\", \"Regulatory Pharmacist\", \"Toxicologist\", \"Veterinary Pharmacist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academic Pharmacist\", \"Community Pharmacist\", \"Hospital Pharmacist\", \"Industrial Pharmacist\", \"Regulatory Pharmacist\", \"Toxicologist\", \"Veterinary Pharmacist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业