aylor’s University. Throughout this journey, our dedicated faculty provide close mentorship and guidance, supported by experienced preceptors officially recognised by the Pharmacy Board of Malaysia, ensuring rigorous supervision and professional development.\", \"ms\": \"For Bachelor of Pharmacy graduates, enrolling in this MPhil programme presents an exciting pathway to advance both academic and professional goals. In addition to deepening your research expertise through hands-on experience in laboratory-based investigations, you may also complete your 1-year Provisionally Registered Pharmacist (PRP) training at Taylor’s University. Throughout this journey, our dedicated faculty provide close mentorship and guidance, supported by experienced preceptors officially recognised by the Pharmacy Board of Malaysia, ensuring rigorous supervision and professional development.\", \"zh-CN\": \"Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Sciences硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由药学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Sciences碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由藥學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-impor