ods.\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Click here to learn more about our\", \"research area\", \"Clinical Pharmacy and Pharmacy Practice\", \"Community pharmacy\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Philosophy in Pharmacy programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academic Pharmacist\", \"Community Pharmacist\", \"Hospital Pharmacist\", \"Industrial Pharmacist\", \"Regulatory Pharmacist\", \"Toxicologist\", \"Veterinary Pharmacist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Philosophy in Pharmacy programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academic Pharmacist\", \"Community Pharmacist\", \"Hospital Pharmacist\", \"Industrial Pharmacist\", \"Regulatory Pharmacist\", \"Toxicologist\", \"Veterinary Pharmacist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 8 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 8 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a master student in pharmacy, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with a sup\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research area\"], \"ms\": [\"As a master student in pharmacy, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with a sup\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research area\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"As a Bachelor of Pharmacy graduate, enrolling in our MPhil programme offers you an exciting opportunity to further your education and expand your skillset. One unique advantage is that you have the option to complete your Provisionally Registered Pharmacist (PRP) training right here at Taylor\'s University. Our experienced preceptors, recognised by the Pharmacy Board of Malaysia, will provide you with the necessary guidance and supervision throughout this training period.\", \"ms\": \"As a Bachelor of Pharmacy graduate, enrolling in our MPhil programme offers you an exciting opportunity to further your education and expand your skillset. One unique advantage is that you have the option to complete your Provisionally Registered Pharmacist (PRP) training right here at Taylor\'s University. Our experienced preceptors, recognised by the Pharmacy Board of Malaysia, will provide you with the necessary guidance and supervision throughout this training period.\", \"zh-CN\": \"Philosophy in Pharmacy硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由药学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"Philosophy in Pharmacy碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由藥學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmacy.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmacy.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmacy.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/master-research/master-of-philosophy-in-pharmacy.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-research-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and E