,'master'),(7516,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-086-doctor-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-sciences','TSU-PHD-086','{\"en\": \"Doctor of Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Sciences\", \"ms\": \"Doctor of Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Sciences\", \"zh-CN\": \"药剂科学哲学博士\", \"zh-TW\": \"藥劑科學哲學博士\"}','Doctor of Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Sciences','medicine','{\"en\": \"School of Pharmacy\", \"ms\": \"School of Pharmacy\", \"zh-CN\": \"药学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"藥學院\"}','药学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',16307,'USD','USD 13,589 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-pharmacy/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-pharmacy-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"September\"]','February, April, September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6, \"toefl\": 60}','International Students English Requirement: IELTS 6.0 / TOEFL 60 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score) The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Accelerated PhD Programme Bachelor\'s degree candidates who are registered for master\'s degree programmes may apply to convert to the doctoral degree programmes subjected to the following conditions: Within 1 year for full time and within 2 years for part-time candidates; Having shown competency and capability in conducting research at doctoral level through rigorous internal evaluation. Approval of the Taylor\'s University Senate. Note : Any of the above conditions would require student\'s research proposal to be approved. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below: Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field A list of scholarly published work The minimum language proficiency of the candidates must be determined by the HEP consistent with applicable programme standards or based on the needs of the programme, i.e., learning outcomes and the medium of instruction. A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications must be published within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications, the candidate must be the principal author with the contributions of others clearly defined. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 3.67, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.67\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.67。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','We offered two entry pathway for this PhD programme, which is normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Pre-requisites Master\'s Degree in Pharmacy Master\'s degree in Pharmacy or relevant science discipline OR Bachelor\'s Degree A Bachelor\'s degree in Pharmacy or relevant science discipline with CGPA 3.67 and registered as a Masters candidate and achieve outstanding performance in research and conversion assessment with Senate approval; OR Equivalent Qualifications Any other equivalent qualifications which is recognized by the Malaysian Government.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: workExperience, proposal, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in pharmaceutical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provid\", \"Full time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Part time\", \"4 – 8 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Clinical Pharmacy and Pharmacy Practice\", \"Community pharmacy\", \"Digital Health and Innovation\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in pharmaceutical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provid\", \"Full time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Part time\", \"4 – 8 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Clinical Pharmacy and Pharmacy Practice\", \"Community pharmacy\", \"Digital Health and Innovation\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academic Pharmacist\", \"Community Pharmacist\", \"Hospital Pharmacist\", \"Industrial Pharmacist\", \"Regulatory Pharmacist\", \"Toxicologist\", \"Veterinary Pharmacist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Doctor of Philosophy in Pharmaceutical Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Academic Pharmacist\", \"Community Pharmacist\", \"Hospital Pharmacist\", \"Industrial Pharmacist\", \"Regulatory Pharmacist\", \"Toxicologist\", \"Veterinary Pharmacist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 8 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 8 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in pharmaceutical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provid\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research areas\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in pharmaceutical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provid\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research areas\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Throughout the programme, you will develop a deep understanding of the scientific principles and methodologies necessary for conducting cutting-edge research in areas related to human health and disease. Our curriculum covers a wide range of topics, including drug discovery, drug development, pharmacology, pharmaceutical analysis, drug delivery systems, and pharmaceutical biotechnology. To ensure quality supervision, only a select number of students are admitted each intake. We recommend applying early to join our impactful community of research professionals.\", \"ms\": \"Throughout the programme, you will develop a deep understanding of the scientific principles and methodologies necessary for conducting cutting-edge research in areas related to human health and disease. Our curriculum covers a wide range of topics, including drug discovery, drug development, pharmacology, pharmaceutical analysis, drug delivery systems, and pharmaceutical biotechnology. To ensure quality supervision, only a select number of students are admitted each intake. We recommend applying early to join our impactful community of research professionals.\", \"zh-CN\": \"药剂科学哲学博士 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由药学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"藥劑科學哲學博士 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由藥學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/pharmacy/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-pharmaceutical-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-pharmacy/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-pharmacy-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-014. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,589 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.602349','2026-06-21 01:09:06.602349',13589.00,'phd'),(7517,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-087-bachelor-of-medicine-bachelor-of-surgery-mbbs','TSU-UG-087','{\"en\": \"Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS)\", \"ms\": \"Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS)\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学士与外科学士（MBBS）\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學士與外科學士（MBBS）\"}','Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS)','medicine','{\"en\": \"School of Medicine\", \"ms\": \"School of Medicine\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學院\"}','医学院','coursework / full-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',5.0,'5-year',173832,'USD','USD 120,717 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-medicine/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-medicine-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"April\", \"September\"]','April and September','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": 4, \"ielts\": 6, \"toefl\": 60}','English Requirements LOCAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 6.0 TOEFL 60 (Internet Based Test) MUET Band 4 UEC English B4 1119 (GCE-O) Grade B Pre-University / Diploma Completed Pre-University / Diploma that was conducted in English Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS IELTS Band 6.0 TOEFL iBT 60 Cambridge English / ELS the minimum score varies by programme Note : The minimum entry requirements are subject to meet current requirements set by the Ministry of Higher Education / Malaysian Qualifications Agency / Malaysia Medical Council. Pre-employment requirement: Graduates from a medical programme who seek employment in the public sector shall attain a pass in Bahasa Malaysia and English at SPM or its equivalent. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department. Interview All eligible candidates are required to attend an interview. Health Requirements The student should be at least 18 years. Prior to admission, students are required to undergo a medical examination to ensure they are in good health and free of transmissible diseases. They also need to comply with the immunisation and infection risk policy.','{\"gpa\": 3, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 3.00; CGPA 3.50; CGPA 3.0; CGPA 3.5\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 3.00; CGPA 3.50; CGPA 3.0; CGPA 3.5\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 3.00; CGPA 3.50; CGPA 3.0; CGPA 3.5。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 3.00; CGPA 3.50; CGPA 3.0; CGPA 3.5。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) programme. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Prerequisites SPM / O-Level A pass in SPM/O-level or equivalent with 5Bs each in Biology, Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics / Additional Mathematics and another subject at school level or its equivalent. Note : The above Pre-requisite is not applicable for the following qualifications: STPM, A-level. All other exit qualifications from secondary school must be read with SPM/O level or equivalent. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university. Entry Pathway Taylor’s Foundation in Science (FIS) Min. CGPA 3.00 (out of 4.0) in Biology, Chemistry and Physics / Mathematics (Provided no score for any subject is less than C (GPA 2.0), the course is not less than 1 year in the same accredited institution, and student meets prerequisite) Diploma in Health Sciences Min. CGPA 3.50 with min. 2Bs each in Biology and/or Chemistry and/or Physics and 3 credits each in English, Mathematics / Additional Mathematics and another subject at SPM or its equivalent (Provided the course is not less than 5 semesters/2.5 years in the same accredited institution) Sijil Tinggi Persekolahan Malaysia (STPM) Min. BBB, ABC or AAC or CGPA 3.0 in 3 subjects: Biology, Chemistry and Physics / Mathematics Unified Examination Certificate (UEC) Pass with min. B4 in Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Advanced Mathematics 1 / Mathematics, and Advanced Mathematics II / Advanced Mathematics A Level Min. BBB / ABC / AAC in Biology, Chemistry and Physics / Mathematics AUSMAT (SACEi) Min. ATAR 80 including Biology, Chemistry and Physics / Mathematics or Aggregate / Average of 80% or the equivalent of B in Biology, Chemistry and Physics / Mathematics Canadian Pre-University (CPU) / Canadian International Matriculation Programme / Canadian Grade 12 / 13 / Ontario Secondary School Diploma Grade 12 Min. average of 80% in 3 subjects: Biology, Chemistry, Physics / Mathematics International Baccalaureate (IB) Min. 33 points including 2 science subjects (Biology and Chemistry) at Higher Level (HL) and Mathematics at HL with a min. score of 5 each in Biology, Chemistry and Mathematics Monash University Foundation Year (MUFY) Aggregate or the equivalent of B in 3 subjects (Biology, Chemistry, Physics / Mathematics) or ATAR 80% in Biology, Chemistry and Physics / Mathematics Matriculation in Science (by Ministry of Education Malaysia) Pass with CGPA 3.00 in Biology, Chemistry and Physics / Mathematics (provided no score for any subject is less than C (GPA 2.0), the course is not less than 1 year in the same accredited institution, and student must meet prerequisite/ CGPA 3.0 in Degree in Health Science, Pure Science or Applied Science/ CGPA 3.5 in Degree in the Arts or Humanities) Other Qualifications Students with other qualifications will be considered on a case-by-case basis. Note : The minimum entry requirements are subject to meet current requirements set by the Ministry of Higher Education / Malaysian Qualifications Agency / Malaysia Medical Council. Pre-employment requirement: Graduates from a medical programme who seek employment in the public sector shall attain a pass in Bahasa Malaysia and English at SPM or its equivalent. All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university’s Admissions Department.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, healthMedical. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"medical or health examination evidence when the programme-specific route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"photographs\", \"identity document\", \"academic transcripts\", \"completion certificates\", \"official English translation if academic documents are not in English\", \"medical or health examination evidence when the programme-specific route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"证件照片\", \"身份证明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕业或完成证明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"medical or health examination evidence when the programme-specific route requires it（译名待复核）\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"證件照片\", \"身份證明文件\", \"成绩单\", \"毕業或完成證明\", \"非英文材料的官方英文翻译件\", \"medical or health examination evidence when the programme-specific route requires it（译名待覆核）\"]}','{\"en\": [\"Our MBBS programme is divided into two distinct phases, each designed to provide you with a well-rounded and comprehensive medical education:\", \"Phase 1 (Year 1, 2) focuses on building a strong foundation in medical sciences while introducing you to the world of clinical medicine. During this phase, you will have the opportunity to develop essential skills such a\", \"Phase 2 (Years 3, 4 and 5) takes your learning to a more advanced level by immersing you in\", \"real-world clinical rotations\", \"at designated hospitals affiliated with the Ministry of Health. This phase is an invaluable opportunity for you to gain hands-on experience working directly with patients. You will have the chance to apply the knowledge \", \"After graduating from Taylor’s Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) programme, you will obtain a prestigious MQA-accredited MBBS degree that is widely recognised and respected worldwide, enhancing your profes\", \": Housemanship in Malaysia is open to Malaysian citizens only.\", \"Semester 1\", \"Biological Basis of Medicine Block\", \"Musculoskeletal System Block\", \"Learning Skills / ICT / Communication Skills\", \"Semester 2\", \"Haematology and Immunology System Block\", \"Cardiovascular System Block\"], \"ms\": [\"Our MBBS programme is divided into two distinct phases, each designed to provide you with a well-rounded and comprehensive medical education:\", \"Phase 1 (Year 1, 2) focuses on building a strong foundation in medical sciences while introducing you to the world of clinical medicine. During this phase, you will have the opportunity to develop essential skills such a\", \"Phase 2 (Years 3, 4 and 5) takes your learning to a more advanced level by immersing you in\", \"real-world clinical rotations\", \"at designated hospitals affiliated with the Ministry of Health. This phase is an invaluable opportunity for you to gain hands-on experience working directly with patients. You will have the chance to apply the knowledge \", \"After graduating from Taylor’s Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) programme, you will obtain a prestigious MQA-accredited MBBS degree that is widely recognised and respected worldwide, enhancing your profes\", \": Housemanship in Malaysia is open to Malaysian citizens only.\", \"Semester 1\", \"Biological Basis of Medicine Block\", \"Musculoskeletal System Block\", \"Learning Skills / ICT / Communication Skills\", \"Semester 2\", \"Haematology and Immunology System Block\", \"Cardiovascular System Block\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：coursework；学习安排：full-time；官方学制：5-year。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：coursework；學习安排：full-time；官方學制：5-year。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Medical Officer\", \"House Officer\", \"Specialist\", \"Administrator\", \"Consultant\", \"Professor / Lecturer\", \"Researcher\", \"International Aid / Development Worker\"], \"ms\": [\"When you’ve successfully completed this Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Medical Officer\", \"House Officer\", \"Specialist\", \"Administrator\", \"Consultant\", \"Professor / Lecturer\", \"Researcher\", \"International Aid / Development Worker\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 9 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 9 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [], \"ms\": [], \"zh-CN\": [], \"zh-TW\": []}','{\"en\": \"Central to this preparation is extensive clinical exposure. As MBBS students, you will benefit from intensive training in medicine and surgery, gained across diverse healthcare settings. The hands-on approach of the MBBS programme ensures you are ready for real-world patient care and clinical decision-making. The programme is fully recognised by the Malaysian Medical Council, providing a clear pathway towards professional registration and practice. In addition, we offer dedicated support for the USMLE (United States Medical Licensing Examination), which is required for local and international students intending to practise in the United States. You will also enjoy exclusive access to the Elsevier ClinicalKey Student resource, featuring over 4,500 USMLE questions, comprehensive study aids, mock examinations, and detailed performance feedback. With limited intake and strong demand each year, the programme often reaches capacity ahead of application deadlines. We strongly encourage you to apply early to secure your place in this career-defining medical programme.\", \"ms\": \"Central to this preparation is extensive clinical exposure. As MBBS students, you will benefit from intensive training in medicine and surgery, gained across diverse healthcare settings. The hands-on approach of the MBBS programme ensures you are ready for real-world patient care and clinical decision-making. The programme is fully recognised by the Malaysian Medical Council, providing a clear pathway towards professional registration and practice. In addition, we offer dedicated support for the USMLE (United States Medical Licensing Examination), which is required for local and international students intending to practise in the United States. You will also enjoy exclusive access to the Elsevier ClinicalKey Student resource, featuring over 4,500 USMLE questions, comprehensive study aids, mock examinations, and detailed performance feedback. With limited intake and strong demand each year, the programme often reaches capacity ahead of application deadlines. We strongly encourage you to apply early to secure your place in this career-defining medical programme.\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学士与外科学士（MBBS） 是泰莱大学 bachelor 层级的审核候选专业，由医学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學士與外科學士（MBBS） 是泰莱大學 bachelor 层级的審核候选專業，由醫學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/undergraduate/bachelor-of-medicine-bachelor-of-surgery.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/undergraduate/bachelor-of-medicine-bachelor-of-surgery.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/undergraduate/bachelor-of-medicine-bachelor-of-surgery.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/undergraduate/bachelor-of-medicine-bachelor-of-surgery.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/school-of-medicine/undergraduate/taylors-fees-schedule-ug-medicine-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/undergraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-B-046. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 120,717 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.608047','2026-06-21 01:09:06.608047',120717.00,'bachelor'),(7518,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-088-master-of-science-in-medical-science','TSU-MA-088','{\"en\": \"Master of Science in Medical Science\", \"ms\": \"Master of Science in Medical Science\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学科学理学硕士\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學科學理學碩士\"}','Master of Science in Medical Science','medicine','{\"en\": \"School of Medicine\", \"ms\": \"School of Medicine\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學院\"}','医学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',4.0,'2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)',24577,'USD','USD 13,654 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-research-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6, \"toefl\": 60}','International Students English Requirement / Proficiency: IELTS 6.0 / TOEFL 60 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score). The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within two (2) years from the date of the examination. Note : Any of the above conditions would require student\'s research proposal to be approved. All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 2.75, \"note\": {\"en\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75\", \"ms\": \"CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75\", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：CGPA 2.75; CGPA 2.50; CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','Are you ready to take the next step in your academic journey? Our programme offers an exciting opportunity for individuals passionate about the field of Master of Computer Science. To ensure a smooth admission process, please take note of our entry requirements listed below. Fulfiling one of the requirements listed below: Bachelor of Medicine / Bachelor of Surgery The degree of Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (Level 6, Malaysian Qualification Framework, MQF) with minimum CGPA of 2.75 (or its equivalent); OR Bachelor of Science with Honours The Bachelor of Science with Hons (Level 6, MQF) in relevant field with CGPA of not less than 2.75 (or its equivalent); OR Bachelor of Science with Honours The Bachelor of Science with Hons (Level 6, MQF) in relevant field with CGPA between 2.50 and 2.75, can be accepted subject to rigorous internal assessment (or its equivalent); OR Bachelor of Science (with working experience) The Bachelor of Science with Hons (Level 6, MQF) in relevant field with CGPA of less than 2.50 and a minimum of 5 years working experience in the related field; OR Other Qualifications Applicants with other qualifications deemed equivalent and approved by Taylor\'s University Senate, along with evidence of adequate training and ability to undertake the degree programme, will be considered. Additionally, candidates are required to satisfy the department responsible for their chosen programme of study through a selection interview conducted by faculty members.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, proposal. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待复核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"research proposal or statement of purpose when the programme-specific requirement publishes it（译名待覆核）\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a medical science master\'s student, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Full time\", \"2 – 4 years\", \"Part time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the following modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature:\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Click here to learn more about our\", \"research area\"], \"ms\": [\"As a medical science master\'s student, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Full time\", \"2 – 4 years\", \"Part time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Students are required to pass the following modules (6 credit hours) in the first year of their candidature:\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \": All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Click here to learn more about our\", \"research area\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方课程设置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公开前需逐项完成中文译名复核。\", \"学习类型：research；学习安排：full-time / part-time；官方学制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或发表要求为准，英文证据保存在审计字段中。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方课程設置已采集，当前记录包含 14 个课程结构或研究方向条目；公開前需逐项完成中文译名覆核。\", \"學习类型：research；學习安排：full-time / part-time；官方學制：2 to 4-year (Full Time); 3 to 6-year (Part Time)。\", \"研究型信息以官方研究方向、研究方法、论文或發表要求为准，英文證據保存在審計字段中。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science in Medical Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Biostatistician\", \"Clinical Researcher\", \"Medical Affairs Manager\", \"Medical/Research Scientist\", \"Medical Writer\", \"QC Analyst\", \"Regulatory Affairs Specialist\"], \"ms\": [\"When you\'ve successfully completed this Master of Science in Medical Science programme, you could embark on any of these exciting careers, including:\", \"Biostatistician\", \"Clinical Researcher\", \"Medical Affairs Manager\", \"Medical/Research Scientist\", \"Medical Writer\", \"QC Analyst\", \"Regulatory Affairs Specialist\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 8 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 8 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a medical science master\'s student, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research area\"], \"ms\": [\"As a medical science master\'s student, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you with\", \"Research Methodology\", \"Research Method for Social Science (Core Module)\", \"Qualitative Research Methods / Quantitative Research Methods\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research area\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Open to graduates holding a relevant bachelor’s degree, such as a Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) , the programme is also a strong academic pathway for those seeking to strengthen their scientific foundation before progressing towards professional medical qualifications. Throughout the programme, you will be immersed in a dynamic learning environment that encourages exploration, inquiry, and innovation.\", \"ms\": \"Open to graduates holding a relevant bachelor’s degree, such as a Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) , the programme is also a strong academic pathway for those seeking to strengthen their scientific foundation before progressing towards professional medical qualifications. Throughout the programme, you will be immersed in a dynamic learning environment that encourages exploration, inquiry, and innovation.\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学科学理学硕士 是泰莱大学 master 层级的审核候选专业，由医学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學科學理學碩士 是泰莱大學 master 层级的審核候选專業，由醫學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/master-research/master-of-science-in-medical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/master-research/master-of-science-in-medical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/master-research/master-of-science-in-medical-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/master-research/master-of-science-in-medical-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-master-research-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-M-028. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-total; fee basis: total-programme. IELTS scalar status: official-value. Field evidence count: 10. Review-only policy: imported rows are non-public and must not appear in public APIs, lists, programme details, aggregates, or recommendations.','USD 13,654 total programme',0,'2026-06-21 01:09:06.626481','2026-06-21 01:09:06.626481',13654.00,'master'),(7519,120,'tsu-official-2026-row-089-doctor-of-philosophy-in-medical-science','TSU-PHD-089','{\"en\": \"Doctor of Philosophy in Medical Science\", \"ms\": \"Doctor of Philosophy in Medical Science\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学科学哲学博士\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學科學哲學博士\"}','Doctor of Philosophy in Medical Science','medicine','{\"en\": \"School of Medicine\", \"ms\": \"School of Medicine\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学院\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學院\"}','医学院','research / full-time / part-time','Taylor\'s University Lakeside Campus, Subang Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',6.0,'3 to 6-year (Full Time); 4 to 8-year (Part Time)',16307,'USD','USD 13,589 total programme',51560,'Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-phd-research-usd.pdf','','matched-official','2026-06-20','[\"February\", \"April\", \"June\", \"September\", \"October\"]','February, April, June, September and October','Taylor\'s official intake months captured in the TSU 2026 official audit batch; imported for backend/admin review only.','{\"pte\": null, \"muet\": null, \"ielts\": 6, \"toefl\": 60}','International Students IELTS 6.0 / TOEFL 60 (Internet Based Test) (May join IEN preparatory course and achieve the IELTS score). The validity of the IELTS or equivalent is within 2 years from the date of the examination. Note : All information is subject to change. The above entry requirements serve as a guideline. Readers are responsible to verify the information by contacting the university\'s Admissions Department Prior Publication Mode You will need to fulfil one of the below: Obtain a master\'s degree in the field or related fields accepted by the HEP Senate Obtain other qualifications equivalent to a master\'s degree recognised by the Government of Malaysia Candidates without a related qualification in the field/s or working experience in the relevant fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses determined by the HEP In addition to the above criteria, those who want to join Doctoral Degree by Retrospective or Prior Publication mode must include the below to the formal application: Minimum of 5 publications or equivalent works in alignment with the theme of the specialisation An executive summary of the above publications to demonstrate the applicant’s contribution to knowledge in the field A list of scholarly published work The minimum language proficiency of the candidates must be determined by the HEP consistent with applicable programme standards or based on the needs of the programme, i.e., learning outcomes and the medium of instruction. A Selection Committee must be established to review the formal application for PhD by Retrospective or Prior Publication and recommend to the Senate to obtain approval. Criteria for published works Published work must encompass high-quality journals, monographs, books, research-based chapters in books, electronic publications which have not been used to obtain other awards or deemed a part of those awards. The publications must be published within a period not exceeding ten (10) years from the date of submission. For the five (5) nominated publications, the candidate must be the principal author with the contributions of others clearly defined. Note : All information is subject to change. Readers are responsible for verifying information that pertains to them by contacting the university.','{\"gpa\": 0, \"note\": {\"en\": \"Master\'s Degree in Medical Science The Master\'s degree (Level 7, MQF) in relevant field; Master\'s Degree (Level 7, MQF); Bachelor\'s Degree The Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (or its equivalent) / Bachelor of Dentistry (Level 6, MQF) and evidence \", \"ms\": \"Master\'s Degree in Medical Science The Master\'s degree (Level 7, MQF) in relevant field; Master\'s Degree (Level 7, MQF); Bachelor\'s Degree The Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (or its equivalent) / Bachelor of Dentistry (Level 6, MQF) and evidence \", \"zh-CN\": \"官方学术门槛摘要：Master\'s Degree in Medical Science The Master\'s degree (Level 7, MQF) in relevant field; Master\'s Degree (Level 7, MQF); Bachelor\'s Degree The Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (or its equivalent) / Bachelor of Dentistry (Level 6, MQF) and evidence 。具体学历路径与例外条件以官方页面证据为准。\", \"zh-TW\": \"官方學術门槛摘要：Master\'s Degree in Medical Science The Master\'s degree (Level 7, MQF) in relevant field; Master\'s Degree (Level 7, MQF); Bachelor\'s Degree The Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (or its equivalent) / Bachelor of Dentistry (Level 6, MQF) and evidence 。具體學歷路径與例外条件以官方頁面證據为准。\"}, \"gaokaoRequired\": false, \"huikaoRequired\": false}','We offered two entry pathway for this PhD programme, which is normal mode and prior to publication mode. Our PhD by Prior Publication mode provides a unique pathway for you to achieve a Doctoral award based on your existing body of work. We recognise the value of your prior publications and include them as a significant part of your submission for the Doctoral award. Normal Mode Pre-requisites: Master\'s Degree in Medical Science The Master\'s degree (Level 7, MQF) in relevant field; OR Relevant Bachelor\'s Degree The Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (or its equivalent) / Bachelor of Dentistry (Level 6, MQF) and evidence of postgraduate specialist which is equivalent to Master\'s Degree (Level 7, MQF); OR Other Qualifications An equivalent qualification approved by Taylor\'s Senate; AND Evidence of adequate training and ability to undertake the Degree programme of study; AND Satisfies the Department responsible for the candidate’s programme of study of suitability of candidacy in a selection interview by the Faculty members.','China-specific admission route was not separately published in the TSU official evidence; keep for Ian review before any public display.','Programme-specific official requirement flags captured for review: interview, workExperience, priorPublication, bridgingModule. Public display requires Ian review of source wording before release.','{\"en\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"ms\": [\"certified Bachelor and/or Master degree certificates and transcripts\", \"passport copies, including blank pages, with at least 15 months validity\", \"passport-sized photographs\", \"research proposal\", \"curriculum vitae or resume\", \"two academic referee reports\", \"addendum if applicable\", \"scholarship or sponsorship letter if applicable\", \"evidence of English competency when previous degree was not completed in English\", \"pre-arrival health examination report after acceptance for visa processing\", \"published works, executive summary, and scholarly publication list for prior-publication doctoral route\", \"work experience evidence such as company reference letter when the route requires it\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"经认证的本科和/或硕士学位证书与成绩单\", \"护照复印件（含空白页），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究计划书\", \"个人简历\", \"两封学术推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖学金或资助证明\", \"前序学历非英文授课时的英语能力证明\", \"录取后用于签证流程的抵达前体检报告\", \"以既有发表成果申请博士路径时提交发表作品、执行摘要和学术发表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作经验证明，例如公司推荐信\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"經认證的本科和/或碩士學位證書與成绩单\", \"护照覆印件（含空白頁），有效期至少 15 个月\", \"护照规格照片\", \"研究計划書\", \"个人简歷\", \"两封學術推荐人报告\", \"适用时提交补充说明\", \"适用时提交奖學金或资助證明\", \"前序學歷非英文授课时的英语能力證明\", \"录取後用于签證流程的抵达前體检报告\", \"以既有發表成果申请博士路径时提交發表作品、执行摘要和學術發表清单\", \"路径要求时提交工作經验證明，例如公司推荐信\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in medical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you w\", \"Full time\", \"3 – 6 years\", \"Part time\", \"4 – 8 years\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"Find out more about our\", \"research areas\", \"Hiring Graduate Students\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\", \"Associate Professor Dr Wong Eng Hwa, Programme Director\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in medical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of 