ch Coordinator\", \"Medical Writer\", \"Medical Science Liaison\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方职业方向已采集 8 项；公开前需逐项完成中文职业名称校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方职業方向已采集 8 项；公開前需逐项完成中文职業名称校對。\"]}','{\"en\": [\"As a doctoral student in medical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you w\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research areas\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"ms\": [\"As a doctoral student in medical science, you will embark on a research journey that will deepen your understanding of the field and make significant contributions to knowledge. Our programme is designed to provide you w\", \"Research Methodology\", \"In their first year, students must complete the following modules (totalling 6 credit hours): Research Method for Science and either Qualitative Research Methods or Quantitative Research Methods.\", \"Key Research Areas\", \"At Taylor\'s University, we believe research can help shape the future. Our postgraduate research programmes cover a broad range of topics with the aim to help shape the future in the aspects of society, technology, econo\", \"research areas\", \"More than 300 postgraduates have chosen Taylor\'s to fulfil their research aspiration. Join us and contribute to our innovative and progressive research projects\"], \"zh-CN\": [\"官方研究方向或专题信息已采集，公开前需中文校对。\"], \"zh-TW\": [\"官方研究方向或專题信息已采集，公開前需中文校對。\"]}','{\"en\": \"Through rigorous academic training and hands-on research experiences, you\'ll explore novel approaches and challenge existing paradigms. Graduates emerge ready to lead in academia, industry, and policy, joining our elite alumni network shaping healthcare advancements globally.\", \"ms\": \"Through rigorous academic training and hands-on research experiences, you\'ll explore novel approaches and challenge existing paradigms. Graduates emerge ready to lead in academia, industry, and policy, joining our elite alumni network shaping healthcare advancements globally.\", \"zh-CN\": \"医学科学哲学博士 是泰莱大学 phd 层级的审核候选专业，由医学院开设。官方证据已覆盖学制、开学月份、国际学生 USD 总学费、入学要求、英语要求和来源链接；当前仅供后台审查，不进入公开学生目录。\", \"zh-TW\": \"醫學科學哲學博士 是泰莱大學 phd 层级的審核候选專業，由醫學院開設。官方證據已覆盖學制、開學月份、國際學生 USD 总學费、入學要求、英语要求和來源链接；当前仅供後台審查，不进入公開學生目录。\"}','No programme-level accreditation claim is published from this review-only import unless the candidate evidence carries a dedicated official accreditation source.','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-medical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-medical-science.html','https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-medical-science.html','[{\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/explore-all-programmes/medicine/phd-research/doctor-of-philosophy-in-medical-science.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official programme page\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/content/dam/taylorsrevamp/university/study/scholarships-and-financial-aid/fees-schedule/postgraduate-general/taylors-fees-schedule-pg-phd-research-usd.pdf\", \"note\": \"Note: Fees will be reviewed annually. For the avoidance of doubt, Taylor’s reserves the right to revise the fee payable for any given semester. Effective 1 July 2025, a 6% Service Tax will be imposed on non-Malaysian citizens, applicable to all fees and charges, except International Security Deposit and EMGS application fees. Fees shown in the Fee Schedule are exclusive of the 6% Service Tax. The Service Tax rate and taxable fee components are subject to change as determined by government regulations. Local-student MYR fee captured separately as MYR 51,560; it is not used as the international total. CNY annual value is a review-only sorting estimate and must not be presented as an official converted tuition amount.\", \"title\": \"Official fee source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"fee\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://university.taylors.edu.my/en/study/how-to-apply/postgraduate-admission.html\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"entry-requirement\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}, {\"url\": \"https://topas.taylors.edu.my/\", \"note\": \"Captured in the TSU 2026 official review-import audit batch.\", \"title\": \"Official source\", \"status\": \"official-verified\", \"sourceType\": \"admission\", \"verifiedAt\": \"2026-06-20\"}]','2026-06-20','official-verified','needs-review','Review-only database import. Hidden from the public student catalogue until Ian approves the ready conversion and public release gates pass.','Official facts calibrated; public display still requires localization and final student-facing copy review. Review-only import for Ian approval; all rows are non-public.','Original TSU candidate code: TSU-D-015. Official source data status: verified-official; candidate officialSourceStatus: verified-official. Fee candidate status: verified-official-